(853472, 96649, 10339, '<td valign="top">I really like the subject. IMO - this was taken at the wrong time. I don''t get the feel of standing on the tracks. The light seems kind of flat and the clouds on the left are too bright.</td>', 'I really like the subject. IMO - this was taken at the wrong time. I don''t get the feel of standing on the tracks. The light seems kind of flat and the clouds on the left are too bright.', '2004-08-11 01:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
