(853525, 96711, 1368, '<td valign="top">I think the cropping is a bit too tight on this one, also colors are grey and dull and whole picture dont really have a focusing point so the eye just wanderes around it a little to flat I think, still the rain always gives my a feeling of sadness if its captured like this  i think you could improve this photo a lot Just my opinion. Good luck</td>', 'I think the cropping is a bit too tight on this one, also colors are grey and dull and whole picture dont really have a focusing point so the eye just wanderes around it a little to flat I think, still the rain always gives my a feeling of sadness if its captured like this  i think you could improve this photo a lot Just my opinion. Good luck', '2004-08-11 01:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(853526, 96989, 25203, '<td valign="top">no true distinct vanishing point</td>', 'no true distinct vanishing point', '2004-08-11 01:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
