(853547, 97004, 5534, '<td valign="top">This photo here reminds me so much of Waimea...haven''t been there in a long time. Vanishing point is there and the wooden fence post gives this a nice country feel. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This photo here reminds me so much of Waimea...haven''t been there in a long time. Vanishing point is there and the wooden fence post gives this a nice country feel. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-08-11 01:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(853548, 96190, 10339, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection that you picked up in the rail. I wish that the overall picture were larger.</td>', 'I like the reflection that you picked up in the rail. I wish that the overall picture were larger.', '2004-08-11 01:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(853550, 95763, 25203, '<td valign="top">In art the vanishing point will draw the eye to the object, not away</td>', 'In art the vanishing point will draw the eye to the object, not away', '2004-08-11 01:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(853555, 96625, 25203, '<td valign="top">Good lines but they lead the eye nowhere</td>', 'Good lines but they lead the eye nowhere', '2004-08-11 01:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(853556, 96918, 7322, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped the sky to just above the rail for more dramatic impact. Still, it''s a very nice composition. I like the shadows quite a bit. They add further emphasis to the vanishing point.</td>', 'I would have cropped the sky to just above the rail for more dramatic impact. Still, it''s a very nice composition. I like the shadows quite a bit. They add further emphasis to the vanishing point.', '2004-08-11 01:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(853557, 96984, 25203, '<td valign="top">no true vanishing point, but good photo</td>', 'no true vanishing point, but good photo', '2004-08-11 01:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(853558, 96918, 25203, '<td valign="top">good, but try to lead the eye with the vanishing point</td>', 'good, but try to lead the eye with the vanishing point', '2004-08-11 01:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(853560, 96163, 16301, '<td valign="top">This would have looked better without the orange sky and effect you applied to the whole photo, it looks like a painting here...I''m imagining it without all that stuff, and it looks great.</td>', 'This would have looked better without the orange sky and effect you applied to the whole photo, it looks like a painting here...I''m imagining it without all that stuff, and it looks great.', '2004-08-11 01:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(853561, 95999, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great black and white technique.  Good dodging and burning.  Made me go back and look at the mockery I made of mine trying to edit with only a few minutes left.  My favorite image so far. 10</td>', 'Great black and white technique.  Good dodging and burning.  Made me go back and look at the mockery I made of mine trying to edit with only a few minutes left.  My favorite image so far. 10', '2004-08-11 01:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(853563, 95833, 20779, '<td valign="top">What beauty. Next time, size larger so you don''t get struck down in voting here. It won''t affect my score, but I think you may see an effect from others perhaps.</td>', 'What beauty. Next time, size larger so you don''t get struck down in voting here. It won''t affect my score, but I think you may see an effect from others perhaps.', '2004-08-11 01:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
