(853873, 96049, 8816, '<td valign="top">I''m a fan of big borders, and get PO''d when people complain about a simple thick black border, but this is even too much for me.  It draws attention away from the photo ( which is VERY strong).  This photo is fantastic, but would''ve been GREAT if you had just gone for the inner part of the border (black/skinny white/black).</td>', 'I''m a fan of big borders, and get PO''d when people complain about a simple thick black border, but this is even too much for me.  It draws attention away from the photo ( which is VERY strong).  This photo is fantastic, but would''ve been GREAT if you had just gone for the inner part of the border (black/skinny white/black).', '2004-08-11 03:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(853874, 96640, 17185, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, and wonderful colours and textures. Great find!</td>', 'Nicely composed, and wonderful colours and textures. Great find!', '2004-08-11 03:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(853876, 96688, 24459, '<td valign="top">the lines are there, the composition is ok, the idea is fine, but something is wrong with the picture. It''s too grey and sad (no life) and something seems to be missing (maybe the life itself)</td>', 'the lines are there, the composition is ok, the idea is fine, but something is wrong with the picture. It''s too grey and sad (no life) and something seems to be missing (maybe the life itself)', '2004-08-11 03:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(853877, 96903, 24459, '<td valign="top">I really like the shot. There are no parallel lines, but then your interpretation is more of a vanishing point to me, than just neverending street/railway/path (you name it). This in fact is vanishing for me. <br/>If anything - the air could be either clearer (and bluer) or even more foggy and misty. But hey, we only have a week for that.<br/>I hope you rate as high as I did you :)</td>', 'I really like the shot. There are no parallel lines, but then your interpretation is more of a vanishing point to me, than just neverending street/railway/path (you name it). This in fact is vanishing for me. If anything - the air could be either clearer (and bluer) or even more foggy and misty. But hey, we only have a week for that.I hope you rate as high as I did you :)', '2004-08-11 03:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(853878, 96926, 24128, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, makes me miss the ocean, nice pic with a really good feeling to it, but looking at the tilt on the horizon makes my neck hurt</td>', 'Ahhh, makes me miss the ocean, nice pic with a really good feeling to it, but looking at the tilt on the horizon makes my neck hurt', '2004-08-11 03:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(853879, 96219, 24459, '<td valign="top">the car is indeed running out of the picture, but does that make it vanish? I think the place, composition and quality could have been better.</td>', 'the car is indeed running out of the picture, but does that make it vanish? I think the place, composition and quality could have been better.', '2004-08-11 03:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(853880, 95833, 8816, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo, and yes, I believe it fits the challenge very nicely.  However, I think most people are going to decimate you for two reasons: 1)It isn''t an obvious, smack you in the face ''vanishing point'' 2)the border is a bit strong.  I believe in nice wide borders, and the so on, but yours just has a bit too much going on, I think if you cut the outside black it would be very nice.  Also, your photo has a lot of detail in it that isn''t visible because you chose to upload such a small image, another reason people will choose to makr you down.  As for me, all that stuff is secondary to the fact that this is an excellent image, that makes a logical use of vanishing point in a strong image. 10</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo, and yes, I believe it fits the challenge very nicely.  However, I think most people are going to decimate you for two reasons: 1)It isn''t an obvious, smack you in the face ''vanishing point'' 2)the border is a bit strong.  I believe in nice wide borders, and the so on, but yours just has a bit too much going on, I think if you cut the outside black it would be very nice.  Also, your photo has a lot of detail in it that isn''t visible because you chose to upload such a small image, another reason people will choose to makr you down.  As for me, all that stuff is secondary to the fact that this is an excellent image, that makes a logical use of vanishing point in a strong image. 10', '2004-08-11 03:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(853881, 96485, 24459, '<td valign="top">Less focus on the horse, more focus on the fence would make this pic much better. And maybe a bit too light. But the idea is GREAT.</td>', 'Less focus on the horse, more focus on the fence would make this pic much better. And maybe a bit too light. But the idea is GREAT.', '2004-08-11 03:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(853882, 96980, 24459, '<td valign="top">It would be even better if <br/>a) lines were going even further, to show more of them, and going even closer to oneanother<br/>-or-<br/>b) you took the pic more horizontally (would give simillar effect to a)<br/>but I love the originality of idea and quality. You score very high in my ranks</td>', 'It would be even better if a) lines were going even further, to show more of them, and going even closer to oneanother-or-b) you took the pic more horizontally (would give simillar effect to a)but I love the originality of idea and quality. You score very high in my ranks', '2004-08-11 03:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(853884, 96984, 24459, '<td valign="top">The ''horizontal'' lines take over the ''vertical'' ones so that the effect of vanishing lines is hardly seen.</td>', 'The ''horizontal'' lines take over the ''vertical'' ones so that the effect of vanishing lines is hardly seen.', '2004-08-11 03:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(853885, 95763, 8816, '<td valign="top">I love this.  I love images that use childrens toys!  I wonder if all these such images in the past challenges are from the same individual?  Have you been working on a series perhaps?  Very nice, a creative original approach that captivates the viewer, and really makes me ponder ''Whats goin on with this girl?''  It''s a very emotive photo, that makes a good use of vanishing point in an symbolic, abstract way.  This photo has DEPTH, something a lot of challenge photos lack. 10</td>', 'I love this.  I love images that use childrens toys!  I wonder if all these such images in the past challenges are from the same individual?  Have you been working on a series perhaps?  Very nice, a creative original approach that captivates the viewer, and really makes me ponder ''Whats goin on with this girl?''  It''s a very emotive photo, that makes a good use of vanishing point in an symbolic, abstract way.  This photo has DEPTH, something a lot of challenge photos lack. 10', '2004-08-11 03:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
