(854088, 96846, 15407, '<td valign="top">WOW COOL SHOT! I like it ...  THe motion blur seems totaly indipendant from the clear focus on the seam in the door jam.  So I''m thionking that the camera on time exposure or remote trigger had a  rear curtain synch on a flash ??? How did you do it ? (9)</td>', 'WOW COOL SHOT! I like it ...  THe motion blur seems totaly indipendant from the clear focus on the seam in the door jam.  So I''m thionking that the camera on time exposure or remote trigger had a  rear curtain synch on a flash ??? How did you do it ? (9)', '2004-08-11 05:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
