(854113, 96852, 25320, '<td valign="top">Ah, I see what happened with you.  I have done this myself.  You tried to cut the image with the windows editor, right?  It is much better to edit the picture to the right size in the camera before you save it. Nice effort though.</td>', 'Ah, I see what happened with you.  I have done this myself.  You tried to cut the image with the windows editor, right?  It is much better to edit the picture to the right size in the camera before you save it. Nice effort though.', '2004-08-11 06:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
