(854486, 96503, 16488, '<td valign="top">Sharp and bright!  Use of lines gives great impact.  I like the way the mirage at the end of the runway disolves into the sky.  Most of the thinner lines look jaggy on my monitor, however.  Is this over-sharpening or just a remant of compression?</td>', 'Sharp and bright!  Use of lines gives great impact.  I like the way the mirage at the end of the runway disolves into the sky.  Most of the thinner lines look jaggy on my monitor, however.  Is this over-sharpening or just a remant of compression?', '2004-08-11 10:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(854487, 96697, 19841, '<td valign="top">As pretty as the trees are, I think this photo would be more dynamic with the top cropped closer, to make a distinctly horizontal image.</td>', 'As pretty as the trees are, I think this photo would be more dynamic with the top cropped closer, to make a distinctly horizontal image.', '2004-08-11 10:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(854488, 96847, 25005, '<td valign="top">I don''t think it meet the challenge requirements.</td>', 'I don''t think it meet the challenge requirements.', '2004-08-11 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(854491, 96751, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice abstraction.  A little too over-saturated for my taste, especially because the building disolves into the sky at one point near the top.</td>', 'Nice abstraction.  A little too over-saturated for my taste, especially because the building disolves into the sky at one point near the top.', '2004-08-11 10:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(854496, 96999, 24454, '<td valign="top">I want to go there.   It''s pretty!</td>', 'I want to go there.   It''s pretty!', '2004-08-11 10:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(854497, 96926, 24454, '<td valign="top">REALLY cool looking!</td>', 'REALLY cool looking!', '2004-08-11 10:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(854499, 96049, 16488, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge well.  The use of duo-tone is nice.  I think your frame is a bit to heavy--it takes up space that could be used by the more interesting elements of the photo</td>', 'Fits the challenge well.  The use of duo-tone is nice.  I think your frame is a bit to heavy--it takes up space that could be used by the more interesting elements of the photo', '2004-08-11 11:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(854500, 96438, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great color &amp; ambience to this picture.  I really like it.</td>', 'Great color & ambience to this picture.  I really like it.', '2004-08-11 11:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(854501, 97009, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for the challenge.  The little boy is adorable, but the man with the red hat pulls attention away from him.  I think the cropping could be tighter, the horizon less tipped and the focus a bit sharper.</td>', 'Nice idea for the challenge.  The little boy is adorable, but the man with the red hat pulls attention away from him.  I think the cropping could be tighter, the horizon less tipped and the focus a bit sharper.', '2004-08-11 11:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(854502, 96049, 24454, '<td valign="top">Good job!</td>', 'Good job!', '2004-08-11 11:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(854503, 96871, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a great picture.  The colors give such a nice feel to this picture.</td>', 'What a great picture.  The colors give such a nice feel to this picture.', '2004-08-11 11:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(854506, 96410, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like pictures of paths and roads and this is certainly an inviting one.  I like the wide crop, but might have taken just a bit more off the bottom to eliminate some of the distracting debris at the edge of the frame.  Loss of detail in the foliage due to overexposure...</td>', 'I like pictures of paths and roads and this is certainly an inviting one.  I like the wide crop, but might have taken just a bit more off the bottom to eliminate some of the distracting debris at the edge of the frame.  Loss of detail in the foliage due to overexposure...', '2004-08-11 11:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(854507, 96331, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oooooooh. . . very cool feel to this picture!</td>', 'Oooooooh. . . very cool feel to this picture!', '2004-08-11 11:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(854509, 96762, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat picture.  Railroad tracks are a pretty common vanishing point, but you have taken a common theme and made it striking and original with the colors and the lighting.  I love it.</td>', 'This is a really neat picture.  Railroad tracks are a pretty common vanishing point, but you have taken a common theme and made it striking and original with the colors and the lighting.  I love it.', '2004-08-11 11:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(854510, 96993, 19841, '<td valign="top">A step to the left or the right would have added more interest to the composition.</td>', 'A step to the left or the right would have added more interest to the composition.', '2004-08-11 11:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(854513, 96474, 16488, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t get it.  The image is grainy and overexposed.  The bit of red is mysterious and draws undue attention.  The tipped horizon line seems to add nothing to the composition.  The bridge is interesting an holds possibilities for a more successful image.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t get it.  The image is grainy and overexposed.  The bit of red is mysterious and draws undue attention.  The tipped horizon line seems to add nothing to the composition.  The bridge is interesting an holds possibilities for a more successful image.', '2004-08-11 11:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(854515, 96899, 24454, '<td valign="top">I want to go there!</td>', 'I want to go there!', '2004-08-11 11:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(854517, 96802, 24454, '<td valign="top">I like the way you angled this.   It makes it really interesting.   Good job!</td>', 'I like the way you angled this.   It makes it really interesting.   Good job!', '2004-08-11 11:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(854518, 96766, 16488, '<td valign="top">The subject is an original and interesting choice for the challenge.  However, the photo is out of focus and grainy.</td>', 'The subject is an original and interesting choice for the challenge.  However, the photo is out of focus and grainy.', '2004-08-11 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(854519, 96401, 16488, '<td valign="top">Really sharp and a strong composition.  I think the frame is just a bit too heavy, but understand why you went that way.  To be ultra-picky the appearance of the tail-light at the bottom right of the round mirror bothers me.  Overall, a real attention grabber.</td>', 'Really sharp and a strong composition.  I think the frame is just a bit too heavy, but understand why you went that way.  To be ultra-picky the appearance of the tail-light at the bottom right of the round mirror bothers me.  Overall, a real attention grabber.', '2004-08-11 11:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(854521, 96698, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is a neat picture!</td>', 'This is a neat picture!', '2004-08-11 11:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(854524, 96366, 24595, '<td valign="top">Need to make the file size bigger and use higher resolution, you image, while possibly pretty is hampered by this.</td>', 'Need to make the file size bigger and use higher resolution, you image, while possibly pretty is hampered by this.', '2004-08-11 11:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(854528, 96203, 16488, '<td valign="top">So, he left the lid up again, did he? =)<br/> <br/>I like this and think it funny.  The angle is interesting, I like the point of view from top to bottom, but the horizontal seems off.   Too bad that water supply hose peeks out as well.</td>', 'So, he left the lid up again, did he? =) I like this and think it funny.  The angle is interesting, I like the point of view from top to bottom, but the horizontal seems off.   Too bad that water supply hose peeks out as well.', '2004-08-11 11:25:07.000000', NULL, 1);
