(854578, 96923, 23561, '<td valign="top">I gave this photo a 10. Lighting is very good and the purple flowers give the vanishing point more appeal. Very well done.</td>', 'I gave this photo a 10. Lighting is very good and the purple flowers give the vanishing point more appeal. Very well done.', '2004-08-11 11:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
