(854592, 96988, 25005, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, great colors, but I don''t think it meet the challenge requirements.</td>', 'Nice photo, great colors, but I don''t think it meet the challenge requirements.', '2004-08-11 11:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(854593, 96352, 23561, '<td valign="top">This photo got the 10 it deserves. I had the same idea for a subject in this challenge, but you pulled it off better. I''m not usually a fan of B&amp;W but in this photo it has a soothing quality. I also like the pot of flowers, gives you something to look at besides the vanishing points. I also like the angle you captured giving multiple examples of a vanishing point.</td>', 'This photo got the 10 it deserves. I had the same idea for a subject in this challenge, but you pulled it off better. I''m not usually a fan of B&W but in this photo it has a soothing quality. I also like the pot of flowers, gives you something to look at besides the vanishing points. I also like the angle you captured giving multiple examples of a vanishing point.', '2004-08-11 11:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(854596, 96964, 20494, '<td valign="top">very refreshing image....like it alot! 10!</td>', 'very refreshing image....like it alot! 10!', '2004-08-11 11:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(854599, 96335, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good raw quality.</td>', 'Good raw quality.', '2004-08-11 11:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(854600, 96702, 23561, '<td valign="top">This is the best photo where the subject is the vanishing point. I like the colors and the lighting. Wish the ceiling was more appealling. The tilt of the camera makes it interesting but it does make me dizzy if I look at it too long. 9</td>', 'This is the best photo where the subject is the vanishing point. I like the colors and the lighting. Wish the ceiling was more appealling. The tilt of the camera makes it interesting but it does make me dizzy if I look at it too long. 9', '2004-08-11 11:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(854602, 96989, 24642, '<td valign="top">A nice change from the straight lines.</td>', 'A nice change from the straight lines.', '2004-08-11 11:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(854605, 96409, 24642, '<td valign="top">IMHO a bowler would make the shot stronger.</td>', 'IMHO a bowler would make the shot stronger.', '2004-08-11 11:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(854607, 96299, 23561, '<td valign="top">10. Most original this round. Not only do the rings "vanish", so do the shadows on each ring. Only thing that could improve this photo would be a red car parked where the black one is, or one that would compliment the red frame.</td>', '10. Most original this round. Not only do the rings "vanish", so do the shadows on each ring. Only thing that could improve this photo would be a red car parked where the black one is, or one that would compliment the red frame.', '2004-08-11 11:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(854609, 96846, 24642, '<td valign="top">Flashy. Good idea.  I give this one a 10.  The best colors in this Challange.</td>', 'Flashy. Good idea.  I give this one a 10.  The best colors in this Challange.', '2004-08-11 11:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(854612, 96485, 23561, '<td valign="top">One of my top five. Lighting is great, not too bright or dark. Fence line give the illusion of a vanishing point so it meets the challenge and I like that you added a subject that goes naturally with your vanishing point. Beautiful horse.</td>', 'One of my top five. Lighting is great, not too bright or dark. Fence line give the illusion of a vanishing point so it meets the challenge and I like that you added a subject that goes naturally with your vanishing point. Beautiful horse.', '2004-08-11 12:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(854613, 95899, 20056, '<td valign="top">I was thinking in the same idea but I couldn''t get a good picture: You did it!<br/>In my favourites for future project...</td>', 'I was thinking in the same idea but I couldn''t get a good picture: You did it!In my favourites for future project...', '2004-08-11 12:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(854615, 95982, 16488, '<td valign="top">Pretty, soft and inviting subject.  I think the point of view could be improved--perhaps a lower angle?  Just seems the composition could be more striking.</td>', 'Pretty, soft and inviting subject.  I think the point of view could be improved--perhaps a lower angle?  Just seems the composition could be more striking.', '2004-08-11 12:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(854616, 96401, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Fantastic colors, great framing.  I like the way you make the thickness of the mirror and the frame the same.  This one is a 10</td>', 'Good idea.  Fantastic colors, great framing.  I like the way you make the thickness of the mirror and the frame the same.  This one is a 10', '2004-08-11 12:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(854620, 96986, 16488, '<td valign="top">Striking lines and colors!  Illustrates the challenge concept well.  Don''t know why, but I''m wishing for a little less cropping at the top--maybe I need to see the roof lines?</td>', 'Striking lines and colors!  Illustrates the challenge concept well.  Don''t know why, but I''m wishing for a little less cropping at the top--maybe I need to see the roof lines?', '2004-08-11 12:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(854624, 95817, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh Yeah!   THIS has that WOW factor!   What a GREAT picture!</td>', 'Oh Yeah!   THIS has that WOW factor!   What a GREAT picture!', '2004-08-11 12:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(854626, 96918, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the subject.  The rust plays well off the blue sky and water.  I think the composition would be improved by cropping out some of the "extra" sky at the top.  And the lighthouse seems overexposed and out of focus detracting from the otherwise strong lines.</td>', 'I like the subject.  The rust plays well off the blue sky and water.  I think the composition would be improved by cropping out some of the "extra" sky at the top.  And the lighthouse seems overexposed and out of focus detracting from the otherwise strong lines.', '2004-08-11 12:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(854627, 96327, 23561, '<td valign="top">The cyclist makes this photo. I like the blurred, blink and you''ll miss him quality. 9</td>', 'The cyclist makes this photo. I like the blurred, blink and you''ll miss him quality. 9', '2004-08-11 12:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(854628, 96851, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is great!   You have a taken a common theme and made it look extraordinary!  I love the cepia colors.  It gives the picture a really neat feel.</td>', 'This is great!   You have a taken a common theme and made it look extraordinary!  I love the cepia colors.  It gives the picture a really neat feel.', '2004-08-11 12:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(854630, 96331, 25242, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo!</td>', 'Very cool photo!', '2004-08-11 12:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(854633, 96936, 18349, '<td valign="top">Excellent tonal range; love the crop...it adds a lot more interest to the seemingly general railroad track shot everyone seems to be submitting.  Well done!  ;o)</td>', 'Excellent tonal range; love the crop...it adds a lot more interest to the seemingly general railroad track shot everyone seems to be submitting.  Well done!  ;o)', '2004-08-11 12:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(854640, 96799, 23765, '<td valign="top">very interesting, I couldn''t understand what it is for a while, it gave me many other meanings. the color is very nice</td>', 'very interesting, I couldn''t understand what it is for a while, it gave me many other meanings. the color is very nice', '2004-08-11 12:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(854643, 96702, 23765, '<td valign="top">is that Frankfurt? the tunnel between the terminals? nice shot, I like the rotation.</td>', 'is that Frankfurt? the tunnel between the terminals? nice shot, I like the rotation.', '2004-08-11 12:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(854645, 96500, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very cool looking!   Love it!</td>', 'Very cool looking!   Love it!', '2004-08-11 12:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(854647, 96375, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very striking!   I love it!</td>', 'Very striking!   I love it!', '2004-08-11 12:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(854649, 96085, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great picture!</td>', 'Great picture!', '2004-08-11 12:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(854650, 96960, 24595, '<td valign="top">too dark</td>', 'too dark', '2004-08-11 12:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(854651, 96682, 23561, '<td valign="top">I have looked at this three or four times and I keep bumping it up. My first impression was "meets the challenge but the horizontal lines distract from the vanishing point and not much color". The second time I looked at it I took more time and noticed how the big ball with the air bubbles has a bit of purple and yellow and it kind of contrasts with the small blue slick looking ball that is full of reflection. Both of which contrast with the texture of the paper. What the heck. I like looking at this one so I''ll give it a 10.</td>', 'I have looked at this three or four times and I keep bumping it up. My first impression was "meets the challenge but the horizontal lines distract from the vanishing point and not much color". The second time I looked at it I took more time and noticed how the big ball with the air bubbles has a bit of purple and yellow and it kind of contrasts with the small blue slick looking ball that is full of reflection. Both of which contrast with the texture of the paper. What the heck. I like looking at this one so I''ll give it a 10.', '2004-08-11 12:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(854654, 97008, 20056, '<td valign="top">Good exercise on those rails reflextion! but the final picture I find it no complete...</td>', 'Good exercise on those rails reflextion! but the final picture I find it no complete...', '2004-08-11 12:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
