(854845, 96222, 7152, '<td valign="top">WOW !!!!! ... this is just unreal ... I know the road is the VP .. but I think the moutain over powers this image, same with the field and sky. While I would love to give this a 10 because this is a incredible photograph and my jaw dropped (I have a thing for mountains) .. I think I''m going to give an 8 b/c of the fact that VP isn''t really obvious (right away I mean) ... maybe if you managed to have the road more in the middle of the photo .. sort of vanishing into the mountain .. not sure .. again WOW !</td>', 'WOW !!!!! ... this is just unreal ... I know the road is the VP .. but I think the moutain over powers this image, same with the field and sky. While I would love to give this a 10 because this is a incredible photograph and my jaw dropped (I have a thing for mountains) .. I think I''m going to give an 8 b/c of the fact that VP isn''t really obvious (right away I mean) ... maybe if you managed to have the road more in the middle of the photo .. sort of vanishing into the mountain .. not sure .. again WOW !', '2004-08-11 13:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(854846, 96485, 25065, '<td valign="top">Good VP, nice to see lines going sideways instead of the old Bottom-to-horizon...</td>', 'Good VP, nice to see lines going sideways instead of the old Bottom-to-horizon...', '2004-08-11 13:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
