(855281, 96972, 21714, '<td valign="top">I like the way it pulls you.  Looks a bit unclean though.  I am not a fan of plastic looking images but but you can spot individual pixels floating around in this image. (8)</td>', 'I like the way it pulls you.  Looks a bit unclean though.  I am not a fan of plastic looking images but but you can spot individual pixels floating around in this image. (8)', '2004-08-11 16:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
