(855647, 96963, 25314, '<td valign="top">I like the creation of false parallel lines via the reflection, I think its an interesting twist on the challenge. Composition is good. However something seems a wee bit ''flat'' about the image, I''m not sure what it is. Perhaps it would''ve been better in B&amp;W with a touch of contrast. I also would''ve preferred it without the people, but that''s down to personal preference.<br/> <br/>Greater DOF might''ve made the ''vanishing point'' seem more significant.<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'I like the creation of false parallel lines via the reflection, I think its an interesting twist on the challenge. Composition is good. However something seems a wee bit ''flat'' about the image, I''m not sure what it is. Perhaps it would''ve been better in B&W with a touch of contrast. I also would''ve preferred it without the people, but that''s down to personal preference. Greater DOF might''ve made the ''vanishing point'' seem more significant. 7', '2004-08-11 18:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
