(855661, 96879, 15407, '<td valign="top">WOW... a favorite of mine... I snagged it and tweaked it a bit and found it even more to my liking (qualified by my potentially out of synch monitor settings) with my minus 5 gamma and minus 7 contrast using Thumbs Plus 6.0 Pro. Great Picture... Where is it?<br/>I also put a level on the horizon (WindowKey + O) drew a level line along the horizon even if it wasnt supposed to have one (perhaps it is sloped like that for the circulation of water) <br/></td>', 'WOW... a favorite of mine... I snagged it and tweaked it a bit and found it even more to my liking (qualified by my potentially out of synch monitor settings) with my minus 5 gamma and minus 7 contrast using Thumbs Plus 6.0 Pro. Great Picture... Where is it?I also put a level on the horizon (WindowKey + O) drew a level line along the horizon even if it wasnt supposed to have one (perhaps it is sloped like that for the circulation of water) ', '2004-08-11 19:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
