(855754, 96446, 24860, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but I would rather see this picture not so lopsided. You have a fence and trees on one side, but then somewhat random cars, a street, then more trees.  If you could have made it more symmetrical, it would''ve looked much better, but I do like the path. 5</td>', 'Not bad, but I would rather see this picture not so lopsided. You have a fence and trees on one side, but then somewhat random cars, a street, then more trees.  If you could have made it more symmetrical, it would''ve looked much better, but I do like the path. 5', '2004-08-11 19:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
