(855915, 96203, 14671, '<td valign="top">lol funny but I don''t think this meets the challenge.  "The vanishing point is the appearance of a point on the horizon at which parallel lines converge together."  But something about the picture...  It would appear the pictur eis not level and by this I mean you were probably standing on your left foot when you took the shot and not centered or level with the toilet.  I like the grey scale and admire the way you got no hot spots from the shiney bowl.  last but not least I would lke to offer you a job in my bathroom.  Unfortunately mine is not as clean.  lol</td>', 'lol funny but I don''t think this meets the challenge.  "The vanishing point is the appearance of a point on the horizon at which parallel lines converge together."  But something about the picture...  It would appear the pictur eis not level and by this I mean you were probably standing on your left foot when you took the shot and not centered or level with the toilet.  I like the grey scale and admire the way you got no hot spots from the shiney bowl.  last but not least I would lke to offer you a job in my bathroom.  Unfortunately mine is not as clean.  lol', '2004-08-11 21:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(855916, 96766, 8054, '<td valign="top">Such a shame that this photo is so poorly focused. I really liked the thumbnail and was excited to look at the full image. Contrast is also off and the right side and bottom could be cropped a bit more.</td>', 'Such a shame that this photo is so poorly focused. I really liked the thumbnail and was excited to look at the full image. Contrast is also off and the right side and bottom could be cropped a bit more.', '2004-08-11 21:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
