(855927, 96219, 14671, '<td valign="top">A good try but in my opinion does not meet the challenge.  "parallel lines converge together." isn''t actually in the picture.  would have made a nicer picture if you went closer to the road and and shot a longer shot with the lighted objected further away.  now not only would you have to road that would have fit the challenge but the lighted object (motorcycle I assume) would appear that is a 1 light splitting into 2...  or at least it sound right in my head.  lol</td>', 'A good try but in my opinion does not meet the challenge.  "parallel lines converge together." isn''t actually in the picture.  would have made a nicer picture if you went closer to the road and and shot a longer shot with the lighted objected further away.  now not only would you have to road that would have fit the challenge but the lighted object (motorcycle I assume) would appear that is a 1 light splitting into 2...  or at least it sound right in my head.  lol', '2004-08-11 21:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(855928, 96479, 23956, '<td valign="top">This is a nice change from traintracks, while keeping to the theme. Good composition.</td>', 'This is a nice change from traintracks, while keeping to the theme. Good composition.', '2004-08-11 21:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
