(856633, 96219, 6999, '<td valign="top">Shots like this are so dependent on your viewer''s precise set-up, that I think it''s difficult to be sure what exactly you were after. I see a vague roadscape with those lines, but a touch brighter and I see a skyline etc., a touch darker and I see only the hint of a road. Working with such very subtle graduations in the shadow areas is, I think, unlikely to get you a reaction you can really rely on. <br/> <br/>For me, it has the beginnings of an impact, but the muted nature of those surroundings confuses things.</td>', 'Shots like this are so dependent on your viewer''s precise set-up, that I think it''s difficult to be sure what exactly you were after. I see a vague roadscape with those lines, but a touch brighter and I see a skyline etc., a touch darker and I see only the hint of a road. Working with such very subtle graduations in the shadow areas is, I think, unlikely to get you a reaction you can really rely on.  For me, it has the beginnings of an impact, but the muted nature of those surroundings confuses things.', '2004-08-12 06:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
