(856674, 96954, 12733, '<td valign="top">The problem with using a cliche subject is that you really need a new take on it to stand out. The double set of tracks partly meets that criterion, but among som many rail shots this gets lost, nice as it is.</td>', 'The problem with using a cliche subject is that you really need a new take on it to stand out. The double set of tracks partly meets that criterion, but among som many rail shots this gets lost, nice as it is.', '2004-08-12 07:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(856678, 96766, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the use of tall trees to show a vanishing point, as it forces the eye into the picture. The colors and textures would be great (I think) if they were in sharp focus - unfortunately they are not.</td>', 'I like the use of tall trees to show a vanishing point, as it forces the eye into the picture. The colors and textures would be great (I think) if they were in sharp focus - unfortunately they are not.', '2004-08-12 07:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
