(856761, 96922, 25095, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and concept, would be really nice I think without the dock but still a nice shot.</td>', 'Wonderful colors and concept, would be really nice I think without the dock but still a nice shot.', '2004-08-12 09:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
