(856771, 96085, 21554, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, the heaviness of the bridge supports massed together at the right margin distracts your eye.   Maybe not much you could have done, though.   Very nice composition otherwise.</td>', 'Unfortunately, the heaviness of the bridge supports massed together at the right margin distracts your eye.   Maybe not much you could have done, though.   Very nice composition otherwise.', '2004-08-12 09:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
