(856823, 95833, 19841, '<td valign="top">The border looks like a picture frame.  Unfortunately, it''s not a good frame for this image.  I think it would have been better to leave the "frame" off and post a larger image.</td>', 'The border looks like a picture frame.  Unfortunately, it''s not a good frame for this image.  I think it would have been better to leave the "frame" off and post a larger image.', '2004-08-12 10:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
