(856843, 96732, 19841, '<td valign="top">The vanishing point is an imaginary point at which PARALLEL lines APPEAR to converge.  These lines really do converge.   Nice photo, but in the wrong challenge.</td>', 'The vanishing point is an imaginary point at which PARALLEL lines APPEAR to converge.  These lines really do converge.   Nice photo, but in the wrong challenge.', '2004-08-12 10:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(856845, 96331, 14603, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition..I also like the contrasty exposure ..but the wooden pathway is the key to success for me in this image in the way it leads the eye straight into the picture.<br/>Good luck..9</td>', 'Excellent composition..I also like the contrasty exposure ..but the wooden pathway is the key to success for me in this image in the way it leads the eye straight into the picture.Good luck..9', '2004-08-12 10:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(856849, 95838, 20494, '<td valign="top">very interesting shot!</td>', 'very interesting shot!', '2004-08-12 11:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(856851, 96891, 20494, '<td valign="top">out of focus</td>', 'out of focus', '2004-08-12 11:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(856856, 96762, 14603, '<td valign="top">I`ve seen a few of this type of image so far in the challenge..but this one made me stop and look..The light plays a major part in that.. in the way it illuminates the rails and the wooden "sleepers"..the telegraph poles are an added bonus, their silhouette receding into the distance gives the picture added impact.<br/>This is really very good and I hope that voters give it the time and score it deserves....9</td>', 'I`ve seen a few of this type of image so far in the challenge..but this one made me stop and look..The light plays a major part in that.. in the way it illuminates the rails and the wooden "sleepers"..the telegraph poles are an added bonus, their silhouette receding into the distance gives the picture added impact.This is really very good and I hope that voters give it the time and score it deserves....9', '2004-08-12 11:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(856859, 96847, 19841, '<td valign="top">To get the "vanishing point" idea, you should have taken the photo from the end of the pool, rather than the side.   It''s a good shot, but wasted in this challenge.</td>', 'To get the "vanishing point" idea, you should have taken the photo from the end of the pool, rather than the side.   It''s a good shot, but wasted in this challenge.', '2004-08-12 11:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
