(857035, 96163, 21362, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t care for photos that are processed to the point that they look like paintings and not photographs. I love everything else about this though. Beautiful!</td>', 'I personally don''t care for photos that are processed to the point that they look like paintings and not photographs. I love everything else about this though. Beautiful!', '2004-08-12 13:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(857036, 96699, 24846, '<td valign="top">Like the colors, capture of string shadows too. Nice title...</td>', 'Like the colors, capture of string shadows too. Nice title...', '2004-08-12 13:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(857037, 96859, 21362, '<td valign="top">Tilted horizon, and not really meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Tilted horizon, and not really meeting the challenge.', '2004-08-12 13:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(857040, 96708, 24846, '<td valign="top">Like the multiple vanishing elements, bulbs, shadows, tiles. What kind of service tunnel is this?</td>', 'Like the multiple vanishing elements, bulbs, shadows, tiles. What kind of service tunnel is this?', '2004-08-12 13:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(857041, 96957, 7322, '<td valign="top">This shows a horizone but it doesn''t really show a vanishing point. I should be seeing parallel lines converging at some point in the distance. It''s an interesting photo though.</td>', 'This shows a horizone but it doesn''t really show a vanishing point. I should be seeing parallel lines converging at some point in the distance. It''s an interesting photo though.', '2004-08-12 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(857046, 97008, 7322, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a brave submission. Not the kind of image that DPC voters generally go for. I like it. It has a simple, abstract quality. I really enjoy the repeated shape of the mouth of the tunnel in black and white.</td>', 'Wow, this is a brave submission. Not the kind of image that DPC voters generally go for. I like it. It has a simple, abstract quality. I really enjoy the repeated shape of the mouth of the tunnel in black and white.', '2004-08-12 13:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(857052, 96859, 7322, '<td valign="top">This shows a horizon line but it does not show a vanishing point. There should be parallel lines converging at an invisible point in the distance. Your horizon is a bit tilted.</td>', 'This shows a horizon line but it does not show a vanishing point. There should be parallel lines converging at an invisible point in the distance. Your horizon is a bit tilted.', '2004-08-12 13:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(857054, 96903, 19608, '<td valign="top">What a lovely scene - and perfect for the vanishing point.  Do you carry a graduated ND filter?  If so - use it on shots where the sky is so much brighter than the foreground.  Nice flat lighting works for this scene.</td>', 'What a lovely scene - and perfect for the vanishing point.  Do you carry a graduated ND filter?  If so - use it on shots where the sky is so much brighter than the foreground.  Nice flat lighting works for this scene.', '2004-08-12 13:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(857057, 96980, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea but you need a more extreme angle of view because the lines aren''t actually converging at this POV. In fact, they are barely converging at this point.</td>', 'This is a good idea but you need a more extreme angle of view because the lines aren''t actually converging at this POV. In fact, they are barely converging at this point.', '2004-08-12 13:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(857058, 96205, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great colors - and just the hint of the rr track works well.  As there is not very much of interest on the sides - I hope you also shot this as a vertical.</td>', 'Great colors - and just the hint of the rr track works well.  As there is not very much of interest on the sides - I hope you also shot this as a vertical.', '2004-08-12 13:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(857060, 96913, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the sunset that you captured in this photo. Has a soothing quaility to it.</td>', 'I like the sunset that you captured in this photo. Has a soothing quaility to it.', '2004-08-12 13:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(857063, 96986, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptionally well composed.  Exposure is great too.  Meets challenge: YOU BET.</td>', 'Exceptionally well composed.  Exposure is great too.  Meets challenge: YOU BET.', '2004-08-12 13:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(857064, 96753, 23561, '<td valign="top">Not a bad photo, just seems kind of flat to. Just my opinion.</td>', 'Not a bad photo, just seems kind of flat to. Just my opinion.', '2004-08-12 13:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(857067, 96376, 19608, '<td valign="top">Good printing - nice blacks, whites, and tonal range.  Perfect subject for challenge - and this is the only one I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'Good printing - nice blacks, whites, and tonal range.  Perfect subject for challenge - and this is the only one I''ve seen so far.', '2004-08-12 13:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(857068, 96791, 23561, '<td valign="top">I liked the concept here and the lighting works well.</td>', 'I liked the concept here and the lighting works well.', '2004-08-12 13:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(857072, 96824, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the angle on this picture and it meets the challenge.</td>', 'I like the angle on this picture and it meets the challenge.', '2004-08-12 13:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(857074, 96124, 19608, '<td valign="top">Your black and white technique is superb.  I really like the "fairyland" quality.  I really want to see the closest black fence pole and the closet concrete one in focus.  If you didn''t do it - take a tripod, stop down as far as you can, and use your DOF preview to check the near objects.  It will be a great image even better.</td>', 'Your black and white technique is superb.  I really like the "fairyland" quality.  I really want to see the closest black fence pole and the closet concrete one in focus.  If you didn''t do it - take a tripod, stop down as far as you can, and use your DOF preview to check the near objects.  It will be a great image even better.', '2004-08-12 13:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(857075, 96732, 7322, '<td valign="top">It took me awhile to see the vanishing point, or in this case points, in this photo. I''m not sure this is exactly right because a vanishing point is an optical illusion  and in this case of fireworks, the the streams of sparks are actually going off in different directions from a starting point. Not really the same thing. The purpose of a vanishing point is to create a sense of three-dimensional space. In drawing, the artist has to figure out where the vanishing point is and draw the parallel lines converging to that point to re-create what the eye sees in real life. In photography, it is more of a matter of photographing the scene from a POV which shows the illusion of the parallels converging. <br/>A view of fireworks in the sky doesn''t really illustrate this concept very well.</td>', 'It took me awhile to see the vanishing point, or in this case points, in this photo. I''m not sure this is exactly right because a vanishing point is an optical illusion  and in this case of fireworks, the the streams of sparks are actually going off in different directions from a starting point. Not really the same thing. The purpose of a vanishing point is to create a sense of three-dimensional space. In drawing, the artist has to figure out where the vanishing point is and draw the parallel lines converging to that point to re-create what the eye sees in real life. In photography, it is more of a matter of photographing the scene from a POV which shows the illusion of the parallels converging. A view of fireworks in the sky doesn''t really illustrate this concept very well.', '2004-08-12 13:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(857077, 95899, 23561, '<td valign="top">I think I would have like this shot more if the spider was focused.</td>', 'I think I would have like this shot more if the spider was focused.', '2004-08-12 13:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(857079, 96520, 23561, '<td valign="top">Not a bad photo. Natural lighting is good. Pic is a little bland though.</td>', 'Not a bad photo. Natural lighting is good. Pic is a little bland though.', '2004-08-12 13:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(857081, 96988, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is illustrating a horizon line but not a vanishing point. Yes, the sun is a vanishing point but there is nothing else in the photo to illustrate that concept. I''m looking for parallel lines converging at an invisible point in the distance. I don''t see that here.</td>', 'This is illustrating a horizon line but not a vanishing point. Yes, the sun is a vanishing point but there is nothing else in the photo to illustrate that concept. I''m looking for parallel lines converging at an invisible point in the distance. I don''t see that here.', '2004-08-12 13:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(857085, 96418, 23561, '<td valign="top">This isn''t one of my favorites, but I like how the puddle is focused and shows a reflection even though its night time. I also like the how the streetlamps give a nice glow and don''t look like their shining in my eyes. 7</td>', 'This isn''t one of my favorites, but I like how the puddle is focused and shows a reflection even though its night time. I also like the how the streetlamps give a nice glow and don''t look like their shining in my eyes. 7', '2004-08-12 13:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(857088, 96951, 7322, '<td valign="top">This isn''t really working to illustrate a vanishing point. The only lines that are actually converging, are actually converging physically in space. It should be an optical illusion, not a physical reality. The lines int he shutter aren''t shown at a dramatic enough angle for them to appear to converge.</td>', 'This isn''t really working to illustrate a vanishing point. The only lines that are actually converging, are actually converging physically in space. It should be an optical illusion, not a physical reality. The lines int he shutter aren''t shown at a dramatic enough angle for them to appear to converge.', '2004-08-12 13:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(857089, 96746, 23561, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W but a bit boring. Nothing pops at me.</td>', 'Nice B&W but a bit boring. Nothing pops at me.', '2004-08-12 13:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(857090, 96724, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have a very nice shot here that clearly demonstrates the vanishing point.  The shadows of the fence are especially nice.  You could easily crop off the structure at the top - to the ceiling above the man''s head.</td>', 'You have a very nice shot here that clearly demonstrates the vanishing point.  The shadows of the fence are especially nice.  You could easily crop off the structure at the top - to the ceiling above the man''s head.', '2004-08-12 13:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(857091, 95982, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the natural lighting in this photo. Trying to figure out what is making those weird reflections in the right. Kind of distracting.</td>', 'I like the natural lighting in this photo. Trying to figure out what is making those weird reflections in the right. Kind of distracting.', '2004-08-12 13:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(857099, 96384, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like this idea but the "stairs" look like you would fall off because they''re slanted. And there is some weird red smoke floating out from under the stairs that is distracting.</td>', 'I like this idea but the "stairs" look like you would fall off because they''re slanted. And there is some weird red smoke floating out from under the stairs that is distracting.', '2004-08-12 13:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(857101, 95898, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice rendition of a very common theme.  I like the curve at the end - it seems to emphasize the vp.  May be slightly over exposed.</td>', 'Nice rendition of a very common theme.  I like the curve at the end - it seems to emphasize the vp.  May be slightly over exposed.', '2004-08-12 13:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(857104, 96766, 16241, '<td valign="top">blurred, a bit</td>', 'blurred, a bit', '2004-08-12 13:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(857105, 95899, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very graphically done.  You don''t see many spider shots shot parallel to the web - good idea.  The spider needs to be a bit sharper.</td>', 'Very graphically done.  You don''t see many spider shots shot parallel to the web - good idea.  The spider needs to be a bit sharper.', '2004-08-12 13:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(857106, 96331, 23561, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W seems to bring out the grittiness of this shot. I also like the texture/comparison between the water and the wood. 7</td>', 'B&W seems to bring out the grittiness of this shot. I also like the texture/comparison between the water and the wood. 7', '2004-08-12 13:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(857107, 97005, 16241, '<td valign="top">good colors and composition</td>', 'good colors and composition', '2004-08-12 13:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(857109, 96538, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the concept but the lighting seems a little harsh on the eyes.</td>', 'I like the concept but the lighting seems a little harsh on the eyes.', '2004-08-12 13:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(857110, 96926, 7322, '<td valign="top">You should have adjusted the tilted horizon line in post-processing (this is allowed in the Basic Editing rules). Also, I would have cropped a good chunk of the bottom of the image, perhaps at the point where we can no longer see the rock wall, since not much is going on after that.</td>', 'You should have adjusted the tilted horizon line in post-processing (this is allowed in the Basic Editing rules). Also, I would have cropped a good chunk of the bottom of the image, perhaps at the point where we can no longer see the rock wall, since not much is going on after that.', '2004-08-12 13:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(857111, 95990, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great exposure and subject!  The range of lighting from side to side is wonderful and the yellow stripe of light at the top adds even more.</td>', 'Great exposure and subject!  The range of lighting from side to side is wonderful and the yellow stripe of light at the top adds even more.', '2004-08-12 13:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(857112, 96251, 7322, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really work for me as illustrating a vanishing point. A vanishing point should leave me with an illusion of depth--three-dimensional space--and this doesn''t do that.</td>', 'This doesn''t really work for me as illustrating a vanishing point. A vanishing point should leave me with an illusion of depth--three-dimensional space--and this doesn''t do that.', '2004-08-12 13:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(857113, 96222, 23561, '<td valign="top">I can''t help but wonder if you used a long shutter speed in this photo. I like the contrast of the greenish brown landscape against the blue-ish white mountain, but the dark clouds at the top of the pic are a bit distracting.</td>', 'I can''t help but wonder if you used a long shutter speed in this photo. I like the contrast of the greenish brown landscape against the blue-ish white mountain, but the dark clouds at the top of the pic are a bit distracting.', '2004-08-12 13:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(857116, 96347, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m looking for parallel lines converging at a point somewhere in the distance. I don''t see that in this photo. The image is a bit dark and lacking in contrast to make out much detail.</td>', 'I''m looking for parallel lines converging at a point somewhere in the distance. I don''t see that in this photo. The image is a bit dark and lacking in contrast to make out much detail.', '2004-08-12 13:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(857117, 96252, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the color you captured in the water.</td>', 'I like the color you captured in the water.', '2004-08-12 13:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(857118, 96926, 23561, '<td valign="top">Technically good photo but it just doesn''t jump out at me.</td>', 'Technically good photo but it just doesn''t jump out at me.', '2004-08-12 13:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(857119, 96152, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like this, although I would have cropped out the ceiling, either at some point just before the first light, or at the point where the ceiling and wall meet above the pillars.</td>', 'I like this, although I would have cropped out the ceiling, either at some point just before the first light, or at the point where the ceiling and wall meet above the pillars.', '2004-08-12 13:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(857121, 96725, 23561, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Looks like something out of a travel brochure.</td>', 'Nice photo. Looks like something out of a travel brochure.', '2004-08-12 13:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(857123, 96163, 19608, '<td valign="top">This image has a LOT going for it!  Perfect composition - the cables seems to extend the vp right up to the top of the bridge.  The dead centering is not normally best - but you picked the right time to ignore the rule.  You handled the colors exceptionally well - the hint of color in the wood on the path really balance the great sky.  Way to go!</td>', 'This image has a LOT going for it!  Perfect composition - the cables seems to extend the vp right up to the top of the bridge.  The dead centering is not normally best - but you picked the right time to ignore the rule.  You handled the colors exceptionally well - the hint of color in the wood on the path really balance the great sky.  Way to go!', '2004-08-12 13:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(857127, 96125, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the angle on this picture, how the bridge is in the shadows showing only its form rather than a bunch of ugly concrete. I also like how the cloud on the right is lit up, pulling your eye toward the vanishing point.</td>', 'I like the angle on this picture, how the bridge is in the shadows showing only its form rather than a bunch of ugly concrete. I also like how the cloud on the right is lit up, pulling your eye toward the vanishing point.', '2004-08-12 13:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(857129, 96993, 7322, '<td valign="top">A nice idea and a pretty scene. The lighting is a bit bland. If you can ajdust your EV setting to bracket exposures, you should try a -EV setting to get a bit more contrast in the play of light and shadow.</td>', 'A nice idea and a pretty scene. The lighting is a bit bland. If you can ajdust your EV setting to bracket exposures, you should try a -EV setting to get a bit more contrast in the play of light and shadow.', '2004-08-12 13:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(857131, 96879, 23561, '<td valign="top">Vanishing point is clear, I just don''t like the colors. The mountain range in the background looks, I don''t know, just kind of blah.</td>', 'Vanishing point is clear, I just don''t like the colors. The mountain range in the background looks, I don''t know, just kind of blah.', '2004-08-12 13:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(857133, 96984, 23561, '<td valign="top">Good detail.</td>', 'Good detail.', '2004-08-12 13:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(857136, 96564, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the red background but i don''t care for the focus.</td>', 'I like the red background but i don''t care for the focus.', '2004-08-12 13:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(857137, 96163, 1368, '<td valign="top">This is a good picture though I think its a little flat like it could use more contrast or something, and then the yellow sky fixes some of that But I am not sure about the yellow sky Its very unreal and then again it adds some glow to the picture, Good luck 7</td>', 'This is a good picture though I think its a little flat like it could use more contrast or something, and then the yellow sky fixes some of that But I am not sure about the yellow sky Its very unreal and then again it adds some glow to the picture, Good luck 7', '2004-08-12 13:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(857138, 96825, 23561, '<td valign="top">Has a vanishing point. Natural light not to harsh or dim. Focus is good. Just wouldn''t hang it on my wall.</td>', 'Has a vanishing point. Natural light not to harsh or dim. Focus is good. Just wouldn''t hang it on my wall.', '2004-08-12 13:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(857139, 95990, 1368, '<td valign="top">I like the shadows and the light that comes from the sides It really adds a lot to the picture, Good job</td>', 'I like the shadows and the light that comes from the sides It really adds a lot to the picture, Good job', '2004-08-12 13:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(857140, 96909, 7322, '<td valign="top">This a very interesting composition. I enjoy the placement of the women to the extreme right of the frame. Her hat makes a very pleasing curve. The colors are lovely--the pale blue of the hat and her warm brown skin contrasting with the white tank top. Sadly, this doesn''t illustrate a vanishing point to me. There is a horizon line, yes, but I''m loking for parallel lines converging at a point, real or imaginary, in the distance, and I don''t see that here. <br/> <br/>To further simplify this composition, I would suggest cropping out the area of cliffs that can be seen at the left of the frame.</td>', 'This a very interesting composition. I enjoy the placement of the women to the extreme right of the frame. Her hat makes a very pleasing curve. The colors are lovely--the pale blue of the hat and her warm brown skin contrasting with the white tank top. Sadly, this doesn''t illustrate a vanishing point to me. There is a horizon line, yes, but I''m loking for parallel lines converging at a point, real or imaginary, in the distance, and I don''t see that here.  To further simplify this composition, I would suggest cropping out the area of cliffs that can be seen at the left of the frame.', '2004-08-12 13:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(857144, 96511, 7322, '<td valign="top">Cute concept. My eye keeps being drawn to the boat and fence in the distance which don''t have anything to do with this image.</td>', 'Cute concept. My eye keeps being drawn to the boat and fence in the distance which don''t have anything to do with this image.', '2004-08-12 13:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(857146, 97003, 1368, '<td valign="top">I guess this is taken on a cloudy day, I think it would look much better on a sunny day with some lights and shadows or even in the nighttime if there are some light poles there in the neighborhood to give some lighting, I would also like to see a different take with the dof, composition is very good as it is, Good luck</td>', 'I guess this is taken on a cloudy day, I think it would look much better on a sunny day with some lights and shadows or even in the nighttime if there are some light poles there in the neighborhood to give some lighting, I would also like to see a different take with the dof, composition is very good as it is, Good luck', '2004-08-12 13:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(857149, 96864, 7322, '<td valign="top">A bit overexposed. My guess is the meter took a reading for the dark water. I would suggest, when taking a shot that can easily fool the meter (lights of contrast between lights and darks) using a -EV setting to trick the meter into exposing for some of those brighter areas. This will create greater detail in your lights and darks.</td>', 'A bit overexposed. My guess is the meter took a reading for the dark water. I would suggest, when taking a shot that can easily fool the meter (lights of contrast between lights and darks) using a -EV setting to trick the meter into exposing for some of those brighter areas. This will create greater detail in your lights and darks.', '2004-08-12 13:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(857151, 96461, 23561, '<td valign="top">Good photo. Lighting is not too harsh. Like the added vanishing point.</td>', 'Good photo. Lighting is not too harsh. Like the added vanishing point.', '2004-08-12 13:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(857152, 96409, 23561, '<td valign="top">The reflections on the lanes are distracting.</td>', 'The reflections on the lanes are distracting.', '2004-08-12 13:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(857153, 96993, 1368, '<td valign="top">I think this one could be better with some levels and color balance cause the colors seems a bit off, and the greyness of the picture makes it liik flat even though you have a great depth in it, Good luck</td>', 'I think this one could be better with some levels and color balance cause the colors seems a bit off, and the greyness of the picture makes it liik flat even though you have a great depth in it, Good luck', '2004-08-12 14:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(857155, 96963, 3102, '<td valign="top">A very cool shot, although it seems a little heavy on the blue to me.</td>', 'A very cool shot, although it seems a little heavy on the blue to me.', '2004-08-12 14:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(857156, 96766, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very OOF!</td>', 'Very OOF!', '2004-08-12 14:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(857158, 96983, 1368, '<td valign="top">This picture is a little flat I think you could improve this picture a lot by puting more contrast in it or play with levels and color balance I think the empty grey bottom is unnecasary to get the vanishing point here I think it just takes up to much space in your picture look like 50% or so, anyway hope it helped  Good luck</td>', 'This picture is a little flat I think you could improve this picture a lot by puting more contrast in it or play with levels and color balance I think the empty grey bottom is unnecasary to get the vanishing point here I think it just takes up to much space in your picture look like 50% or so, anyway hope it helped  Good luck', '2004-08-12 14:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(857159, 96865, 6130, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2004-08-12 14:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(857160, 96800, 3102, '<td valign="top">You seriously didn''t notice the giant blob created by the flash...?</td>', 'You seriously didn''t notice the giant blob created by the flash...?', '2004-08-12 14:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(857161, 96720, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot. I''m not sure how I feel about the extremely narrow cropping. Was the blown out background intentional? I would suggest that the area of shaodow in the foreground is more interesting the background. Your meter seems to have read from the darker foreground which overexposed the background. In this case, the thing to do is fool your camera''s meter by setting it to a -EV number. You''ll get a shorter exposure which will result in a more natural sky and  greater detail in the area of shadow play in the foreground.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot. I''m not sure how I feel about the extremely narrow cropping. Was the blown out background intentional? I would suggest that the area of shaodow in the foreground is more interesting the background. Your meter seems to have read from the darker foreground which overexposed the background. In this case, the thing to do is fool your camera''s meter by setting it to a -EV number. You''ll get a shorter exposure which will result in a more natural sky and  greater detail in the area of shadow play in the foreground.', '2004-08-12 14:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(857164, 96847, 19608, '<td valign="top">Hmm. A rather untraditional way to show vp - perpeddicular rather than parallel - but it works for me!  Great colors and perfect timing.  It is amazing the swimmers all have about the same repeating shape.</td>', 'Hmm. A rather untraditional way to show vp - perpeddicular rather than parallel - but it works for me!  Great colors and perfect timing.  It is amazing the swimmers all have about the same repeating shape.', '2004-08-12 14:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(857165, 96751, 1368, '<td valign="top">This looks like a candidate for neon, I feel that the screaming blue color against the screaming white makes it a little uncomfortable to look at,  but the clouds in the sky in the upper left corner is almost the only details here, good composition would like to see it with more details, Good luck</td>', 'This looks like a candidate for neon, I feel that the screaming blue color against the screaming white makes it a little uncomfortable to look at,  but the clouds in the sky in the upper left corner is almost the only details here, good composition would like to see it with more details, Good luck', '2004-08-12 14:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(857167, 96114, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice image - works well for vp.  Sky a bit hot, but I don''t think it hurts the image that much.  Actually it doesn''t hurt it at all.  Title could be much better.</td>', 'Nice image - works well for vp.  Sky a bit hot, but I don''t think it hurts the image that much.  Actually it doesn''t hurt it at all.  Title could be much better.', '2004-08-12 14:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(857168, 96376, 1368, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and peaceful scene I like the b&amp;w you choose here, good luck :)</td>', 'Beautiful and peaceful scene I like the b&w you choose here, good luck :)', '2004-08-12 14:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(857171, 96621, 1368, '<td valign="top">Nice composition here I think its bad that the sky is washed out, could have been better on a sunny day maybe, Good luck</td>', 'Nice composition here I think its bad that the sky is washed out, could have been better on a sunny day maybe, Good luck', '2004-08-12 14:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(857172, 96049, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice dock - good composition.  Printing is effective with good whites, dark blacks and good tonal range.  The border should be dumped into the sea.</td>', 'Nice dock - good composition.  Printing is effective with good whites, dark blacks and good tonal range.  The border should be dumped into the sea.', '2004-08-12 14:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(857173, 96975, 6667, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. . . but clean your lens!</td>', 'Nicely done. . . but clean your lens!', '2004-08-12 14:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(857176, 96315, 1368, '<td valign="top">This is very good, I like how you have put emotions into your vanishing point, Only thing is that she has hot spots  on her shirt and forehead But I dont think its a big problem in this picture, Good luck :)</td>', 'This is very good, I like how you have put emotions into your vanishing point, Only thing is that she has hot spots  on her shirt and forehead But I dont think its a big problem in this picture, Good luck :)', '2004-08-12 14:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(857177, 96998, 3102, '<td valign="top">Now THAT is pretty cool!  I assume this is a long exposure of a jet taking off.  It almost looks like the lit-up span of a bridge or something.  What a slick effect!  I don''t know if enough people will think this is as cool as I do for it to earn a ribbon, but it''s a 10 in my book!</td>', 'Now THAT is pretty cool!  I assume this is a long exposure of a jet taking off.  It almost looks like the lit-up span of a bridge or something.  What a slick effect!  I don''t know if enough people will think this is as cool as I do for it to earn a ribbon, but it''s a 10 in my book!', '2004-08-12 14:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(857178, 96991, 24976, '<td valign="top">slightly oversharpened. i love the colors!</td>', 'slightly oversharpened. i love the colors!', '2004-08-12 14:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(857179, 96467, 10785, '<td valign="top">This picture is technicaly very good. Good exposure, good DOFand good composition. It is just not interesting. It needs a pedestrian to add color and interest.</td>', 'This picture is technicaly very good. Good exposure, good DOFand good composition. It is just not interesting. It needs a pedestrian to add color and interest.', '2004-08-12 14:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(857182, 96987, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nicely done exposure!  I might have tried panning down to eliminate a bit more of the sky... but otherwise, well done!</td>', 'Nicely done exposure!  I might have tried panning down to eliminate a bit more of the sky... but otherwise, well done!', '2004-08-12 14:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(857183, 96623, 10785, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a lot of noise, making this look more like a video capture than a photo.</td>', 'There seems to be a lot of noise, making this look more like a video capture than a photo.', '2004-08-12 14:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(857184, 96746, 1368, '<td valign="top">Now here is a real vanishing point, still I think this picture looks a little to flat to hold any real interest, like there is nothing steady for they eye to grab on too A little bit of levels adjustments could have iimproved the flatness some I think, overall I like it, it has very good composition,  Good luck</td>', 'Now here is a real vanishing point, still I think this picture looks a little to flat to hold any real interest, like there is nothing steady for they eye to grab on too A little bit of levels adjustments could have iimproved the flatness some I think, overall I like it, it has very good composition,  Good luck', '2004-08-12 14:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(857186, 97008, 24976, '<td valign="top">is this a photo of a painting?</td>', 'is this a photo of a painting?', '2004-08-12 14:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(857189, 96732, 24976, '<td valign="top">your camera has a few hot pixels on the left side.</td>', 'your camera has a few hot pixels on the left side.', '2004-08-12 14:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(857190, 96222, 19608, '<td valign="top">Crabby!  If this isn''t Mr. Blue - I will be totally surprised, shocked, and ticked. I''m in total awe of the shot - and like it both in B&amp;W and in color.  Way to go man - you nailed this one.</td>', 'Crabby!  If this isn''t Mr. Blue - I will be totally surprised, shocked, and ticked. I''m in total awe of the shot - and like it both in B&W and in color.  Way to go man - you nailed this one.', '2004-08-12 14:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(857196, 96595, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is the kind of thing I used to do in tenth grade photographty class for subjects like, texture, perspective. It''s good, but unimaginative.</td>', 'This is the kind of thing I used to do in tenth grade photographty class for subjects like, texture, perspective. It''s good, but unimaginative.', '2004-08-12 14:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(857198, 96163, 3102, '<td valign="top">Can''t say I''m fond of the funky color shifts on this one... I think it would have been a fine shot had it been left alone.</td>', 'Can''t say I''m fond of the funky color shifts on this one... I think it would have been a fine shot had it been left alone.', '2004-08-12 14:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(857204, 96222, 3102, '<td valign="top">Whoa -- how cool is that!?  What an incredible scene!</td>', 'Whoa -- how cool is that!?  What an incredible scene!', '2004-08-12 14:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(857208, 95833, 3102, '<td valign="top">I think you went a bit overboard on the framing here... it looks like a great shot, but I would have enjoyed seeing more photo, less border.</td>', 'I think you went a bit overboard on the framing here... it looks like a great shot, but I would have enjoyed seeing more photo, less border.', '2004-08-12 14:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(857210, 96847, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wow -- great shot!  Looks like you snapped it at just the right instant!</td>', 'Wow -- great shot!  Looks like you snapped it at just the right instant!', '2004-08-12 14:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(857213, 96871, 1368, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors,  the couple walking there in the middle makes this picture really stand out emotionally, I love pictures that speak to me, good job - 10</td>', 'Beautiful colors,  the couple walking there in the middle makes this picture really stand out emotionally, I love pictures that speak to me, good job - 10', '2004-08-12 14:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(857217, 95893, 1368, '<td valign="top">Awesome lighting and composition good oposites in the balck and white, good job :)</td>', 'Awesome lighting and composition good oposites in the balck and white, good job :)', '2004-08-12 14:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(857218, 96651, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  I like the simplicity of this, the colors, composition... it just all comes together very well -- kudos! - 10</td>', 'Very nicely done!  I like the simplicity of this, the colors, composition... it just all comes together very well -- kudos! - 10', '2004-08-12 14:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(857223, 96785, 1368, '<td valign="top">This is just a picture of a fence line taken in the night with flash light, still I feel it has something that drags me too it, maybe cause of the fence goes right into the deep darkness I like that makes you wonder whats out there :) Good job</td>', 'This is just a picture of a fence line taken in the night with flash light, still I feel it has something that drags me too it, maybe cause of the fence goes right into the deep darkness I like that makes you wonder whats out there :) Good job', '2004-08-12 14:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(857225, 96152, 1368, '<td valign="top">I think this has to be the most beautiful hallway I have seen in my entire lifetime</td>', 'I think this has to be the most beautiful hallway I have seen in my entire lifetime', '2004-08-12 14:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(857227, 96511, 24715, '<td valign="top">Very nice, good color. Just too bad the background is too visible (bat, fence, house)</td>', 'Very nice, good color. Just too bad the background is too visible (bat, fence, house)', '2004-08-12 14:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(857229, 96375, 23126, '<td valign="top">I''m voting a 9. The only thing keeping me from giving a 10 is it doesn''t seem quite as sharp as it maybe could be, and the little bit of shore in the bottom right is distracting. If that were cropped out or if you had stood right at the waters edge so the shore was not in the frame, it would appear to be an infinite bridge.</td>', 'I''m voting a 9. The only thing keeping me from giving a 10 is it doesn''t seem quite as sharp as it maybe could be, and the little bit of shore in the bottom right is distracting. If that were cropped out or if you had stood right at the waters edge so the shore was not in the frame, it would appear to be an infinite bridge.', '2004-08-12 14:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(857230, 96786, 24715, '<td valign="top">Great contrast.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-09-10 12:32:30.</i></td>', 'Great contrast.', '2004-08-12 14:38:20.000000', '2004-09-10 13:32:30.000000', 1),
(857235, 96964, 1368, '<td valign="top">This is really nice, the red subject really stands out in the blue picture, good job :)</td>', 'This is really nice, the red subject really stands out in the blue picture, good job :)', '2004-08-12 14:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(857237, 96222, 1368, '<td valign="top">oh my how beautiful is this! Look forward to see where this was taken and If you have any more pics from those mountains, great stuff :)</td>', 'oh my how beautiful is this! Look forward to see where this was taken and If you have any more pics from those mountains, great stuff :)', '2004-08-12 14:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(857242, 96384, 1368, '<td valign="top">Stairway to heaven Great idea! Would be great to see a person there, but that would require some digital art But I can almost see how cool it would look, Good job :)</td>', 'Stairway to heaven Great idea! Would be great to see a person there, but that would require some digital art But I can almost see how cool it would look, Good job :)', '2004-08-12 14:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(857254, 96758, 23939, '<td valign="top">nice title</td>', 'nice title', '2004-08-12 14:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(857275, 95797, 21362, '<td valign="top">This photo could be improved by not cropping off the top of the tree, moving in front of that out of focus weed in the foreground (though I think if there was a bunch and not just one it could have worked), and cropping out the sign on the left which disrupts the otherwise rural feel. A nice sunset or sunrise sky would be a plus too.<br/> <br/>That said, it''s a beautiful scene. The colors are lovely, the rows of trees and the canals on either side of the road all really emphasize the vanishing point.<br/> <br/>Good, with potential for improvement. :)</td>', 'This photo could be improved by not cropping off the top of the tree, moving in front of that out of focus weed in the foreground (though I think if there was a bunch and not just one it could have worked), and cropping out the sign on the left which disrupts the otherwise rural feel. A nice sunset or sunrise sky would be a plus too. That said, it''s a beautiful scene. The colors are lovely, the rows of trees and the canals on either side of the road all really emphasize the vanishing point. Good, with potential for improvement. :)', '2004-08-12 15:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(857280, 96152, 24674, '<td valign="top">More crop might have helped a bit.</td>', 'More crop might have helped a bit.', '2004-08-12 15:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(857283, 96222, 12583, '<td valign="top">Very lovely. One of my few 10s. Nice job.</td>', 'Very lovely. One of my few 10s. Nice job.', '2004-08-12 15:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(857284, 96922, 12583, '<td valign="top">A beautiful picture and a nice example of VP. Awesome job. I gave you one of my few 10s.</td>', 'A beautiful picture and a nice example of VP. Awesome job. I gave you one of my few 10s.', '2004-08-12 15:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(857286, 96440, 24674, '<td valign="top">I like the angle.</td>', 'I like the angle.', '2004-08-12 15:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(857289, 96847, 12583, '<td valign="top">I loved this shot. It spoke to me in quite a few ways. For one, I was a swimmer myself, and this shot brings me back to the ten years I spent swimming competitively. Talk about nostalgia!! Plus, I loved the colors and the feel - I just wish it had been a bit brighter to really show the beauty of the pool and lanelines, not to mention the splashes, but I suppose you can''t really control the weather! :)<br/> <br/>I don''t know if everyone will pick up on the vanishing points that I see - lines on the bottom of the pool, and most importantly, the swimmers'' bodies, but I found them! I gave you a 10. Nice job.</td>', 'I loved this shot. It spoke to me in quite a few ways. For one, I was a swimmer myself, and this shot brings me back to the ten years I spent swimming competitively. Talk about nostalgia!! Plus, I loved the colors and the feel - I just wish it had been a bit brighter to really show the beauty of the pool and lanelines, not to mention the splashes, but I suppose you can''t really control the weather! :) I don''t know if everyone will pick up on the vanishing points that I see - lines on the bottom of the pool, and most importantly, the swimmers'' bodies, but I found them! I gave you a 10. Nice job.', '2004-08-12 15:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(857290, 96991, 12583, '<td valign="top">Ahhh. This is lovely - crisp and beautiful. I gave you a 10, one of my few for this challenge.</td>', 'Ahhh. This is lovely - crisp and beautiful. I gave you a 10, one of my few for this challenge.', '2004-08-12 15:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(857291, 96846, 12583, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot. I loved it and gave you a 9.</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot. I loved it and gave you a 9.', '2004-08-12 15:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(857295, 96640, 12583, '<td valign="top">9.<br/>This is superbly lovely - lots of clear vanishing points, beautiful color and clarity - awesome job!</td>', '9.This is superbly lovely - lots of clear vanishing points, beautiful color and clarity - awesome job!', '2004-08-12 15:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(857297, 96438, 12583, '<td valign="top">I wonder, did you also post "Evening Star?" That happens to be one of my favorites, and this shot is very reminiscent of it. Either way, I loved this picture, though the lighting suggested more of an evening time to me, I''ll take your word for it that it''s morning. <br/> <br/>Lovely shot, nice job!</td>', 'I wonder, did you also post "Evening Star?" That happens to be one of my favorites, and this shot is very reminiscent of it. Either way, I loved this picture, though the lighting suggested more of an evening time to me, I''ll take your word for it that it''s morning.  Lovely shot, nice job!', '2004-08-12 15:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(857306, 96891, 24674, '<td valign="top">Too shaken.</td>', 'Too shaken.', '2004-08-12 15:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(857312, 96222, 12962, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is truly a journey of discovery.  I like it that there is a reward at the end of the vanishing point after the experience, so to speak.  And that reward (the mountains) is just spectacular.  It''s too bad that we can''t have spot editing in this challenge as there is one glaring speck of dust in the sky that could have been cloned out (or cropped).  Does it  distract?  Maybe to sensitive viewers.  Hope you do well despite of it.</td>', 'Wow, this is truly a journey of discovery.  I like it that there is a reward at the end of the vanishing point after the experience, so to speak.  And that reward (the mountains) is just spectacular.  It''s too bad that we can''t have spot editing in this challenge as there is one glaring speck of dust in the sky that could have been cloned out (or cropped).  Does it  distract?  Maybe to sensitive viewers.  Hope you do well despite of it.', '2004-08-12 15:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(857314, 96331, 18084, '<td valign="top">This is totally cool. Where is it?</td>', 'This is totally cool. Where is it?', '2004-08-12 15:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(857315, 95763, 12962, '<td valign="top">There''s some drama and mystery to this.</td>', 'There''s some drama and mystery to this.', '2004-08-12 15:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(857328, 96974, 12962, '<td valign="top">I could just be me but focus looks soft which adds some kind of mystery (others may prefer spot on focus all throughout, though).  But I like the intrigue ... is it a path or is it just wood shavings? Does it lead to somewhere, anywhere?  I wonder if this will also work if you crop more from the top to make a square rather than rectangle - so your eyes could really be pulled into the vanishing point?</td>', 'I could just be me but focus looks soft which adds some kind of mystery (others may prefer spot on focus all throughout, though).  But I like the intrigue ... is it a path or is it just wood shavings? Does it lead to somewhere, anywhere?  I wonder if this will also work if you crop more from the top to make a square rather than rectangle - so your eyes could really be pulled into the vanishing point?', '2004-08-12 15:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(857329, 96785, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2004-08-12 15:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(857331, 95822, 16241, '<td valign="top">stunning</td>', 'stunning', '2004-08-12 15:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(857342, 96881, 24951, '<td valign="top">I like the old fashioned feel of this photo, and the graininess is appropriate too</td>', 'I like the old fashioned feel of this photo, and the graininess is appropriate too', '2004-08-12 15:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(857345, 95763, 24951, '<td valign="top">there is just something about this that I like</td>', 'there is just something about this that I like', '2004-08-12 15:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(857352, 96252, 12962, '<td valign="top">Love the vanishing points in several levels.  The colors are wonderul too.  Oh, and the fact that the horizontal level is spot on makes a very calming composition.</td>', 'Love the vanishing points in several levels.  The colors are wonderul too.  Oh, and the fact that the horizontal level is spot on makes a very calming composition.', '2004-08-12 15:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(857355, 96251, 327, '<td valign="top">Sorry don''t see much here of interest. I do like the red color.</td>', 'Sorry don''t see much here of interest. I do like the red color.', '2004-08-12 15:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(857357, 96800, 327, '<td valign="top">Flash is too too strong. Fried. :) Maybe you can try to cover it with some tissue, paper towel. Your focus is good and I think the idea is creative.</td>', 'Flash is too too strong. Fried. :) Maybe you can try to cover it with some tissue, paper towel. Your focus is good and I think the idea is creative.', '2004-08-12 15:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(857358, 96906, 327, '<td valign="top">Looking at your shot...I just see dust. The idea is okay, but the dust is too much of a distraction.</td>', 'Looking at your shot...I just see dust. The idea is okay, but the dust is too much of a distraction.', '2004-08-12 15:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(857359, 96640, 12962, '<td valign="top">What a nice capture!  I like that you added a little bit of sky to show that these bales are really vanishing into the horizon.  Hope you do well.</td>', 'What a nice capture!  I like that you added a little bit of sky to show that these bales are really vanishing into the horizon.  Hope you do well.', '2004-08-12 15:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(857361, 96917, 327, '<td valign="top">I think I see your idea but don''t think it works. Artifical plant, and too much background to hold the eye on the leading lines. Your focus is fine, color is also good. Just too complicated.</td>', 'I think I see your idea but don''t think it works. Artifical plant, and too much background to hold the eye on the leading lines. Your focus is fine, color is also good. Just too complicated.', '2004-08-12 15:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(857364, 96410, 327, '<td valign="top">I love sun and shadow. Here the sun is too bright and is washing out the green and the sky.</td>', 'I love sun and shadow. Here the sun is too bright and is washing out the green and the sky.', '2004-08-12 15:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(857366, 96331, 12962, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a local scenery ... a scene that can only be found in this particular location.  I don''t know where it is ... but I am sure it is unique for this locale.  And that''s where the beauty of this picture lies ... not only it very well portrays the vanishing point, but it also portrays local color.</td>', 'Nice capture of a local scenery ... a scene that can only be found in this particular location.  I don''t know where it is ... but I am sure it is unique for this locale.  And that''s where the beauty of this picture lies ... not only it very well portrays the vanishing point, but it also portrays local color.', '2004-08-12 16:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(857367, 96299, 12962, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Gives you a reward at the end of the vanishing point.</td>', 'Nice.  Gives you a reward at the end of the vanishing point.', '2004-08-12 16:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(857384, 96125, 24674, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed.</td>', 'Very nicely composed.', '2004-08-12 16:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(857387, 96232, 24674, '<td valign="top">Great idea.</td>', 'Great idea.', '2004-08-12 16:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(857395, 95817, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful.</td>', 'Very beautiful.', '2004-08-12 16:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(857398, 96950, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2004-08-12 16:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(857399, 96190, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like it.</td>', 'I like it.', '2004-08-12 16:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(857400, 95919, 6130, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2004-08-12 16:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(857402, 96916, 24674, '<td valign="top">Nice color</td>', 'Nice color', '2004-08-12 16:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(857413, 96640, 19978, '<td valign="top">The tones, the depth, the sheer scale of this image works very well. I''ve come back to it several times and can''t find a single thing wrong with it. Beautiful work. 10.</td>', 'The tones, the depth, the sheer scale of this image works very well. I''ve come back to it several times and can''t find a single thing wrong with it. Beautiful work. 10.', '2004-08-12 16:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(857416, 96865, 19978, '<td valign="top">This is a beautifully evocative image. The lonely twisted fence, the expanse of water, the isolated shrubs on the left, just beautiful. I think a few alternative crops might have enhanced it though. I think the submerged stick on lower left is somewhat distracting - but cropping the left would have removed the nice shrubs. Cropping the bottom would have removed the reflection of the foreground post. Ah, what to do. I''d also like to maybe see some levels adjustment to see if the sky could "pop" more. Anyway, beautiful shot! 8.</td>', 'This is a beautifully evocative image. The lonely twisted fence, the expanse of water, the isolated shrubs on the left, just beautiful. I think a few alternative crops might have enhanced it though. I think the submerged stick on lower left is somewhat distracting - but cropping the left would have removed the nice shrubs. Cropping the bottom would have removed the reflection of the foreground post. Ah, what to do. I''d also like to maybe see some levels adjustment to see if the sky could "pop" more. Anyway, beautiful shot! 8.', '2004-08-12 16:47:20.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(857418, 96467, 19978, '<td valign="top">A shot that truly meets the challenge. I like your choice of b&amp;w and the starbursts on the lights are great. This is a classy shot. Should be top 20.</td>', 'A shot that truly meets the challenge. I like your choice of b&w and the starbursts on the lights are great. This is a classy shot. Should be top 20.', '2004-08-12 16:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(857420, 96899, 19978, '<td valign="top">Something about this image really works for me. I''m a sucker for lonely, barren shots. I''d have liked to maybe see the colors of the leaves pop a bit more (adjust levels, increase sat?). How did you find such colorful foliage in Missouri this early in August?</td>', 'Something about this image really works for me. I''m a sucker for lonely, barren shots. I''d have liked to maybe see the colors of the leaves pop a bit more (adjust levels, increase sat?). How did you find such colorful foliage in Missouri this early in August?', '2004-08-12 16:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(857422, 96559, 19978, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot. Really meets the challenge and does so in an interesting way.</td>', 'A wonderful shot. Really meets the challenge and does so in an interesting way.', '2004-08-12 16:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(857425, 95822, 19978, '<td valign="top">Mmmm, very nice composition and crop. I love the deep dof. The textures are great too. An all-around outstanding job. Meets the challenge perfectly, and creatively! 8.<br/> <br/>PS: is that an Ovation?</td>', 'Mmmm, very nice composition and crop. I love the deep dof. The textures are great too. An all-around outstanding job. Meets the challenge perfectly, and creatively! 8. PS: is that an Ovation?', '2004-08-12 16:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(857429, 96846, 19978, '<td valign="top">Outstanding, wonderful, superb. This shot captures the eye in many ways. The motion blur of the lights and sharpness of the car is really spectacular. The exposure is spot-on. A top 10 for sure, maybe a ribbon. Congrats ahead of time!</td>', 'Outstanding, wonderful, superb. This shot captures the eye in many ways. The motion blur of the lights and sharpness of the car is really spectacular. The exposure is spot-on. A top 10 for sure, maybe a ribbon. Congrats ahead of time!', '2004-08-12 16:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(857431, 96913, 19978, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones. Love the shot.</td>', 'Beautiful tones. Love the shot.', '2004-08-12 16:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(857437, 96252, 19978, '<td valign="top">Great eye. Good for you for spotting the potential in a setting like this. Love the crop, love the dof. Very well-done image.</td>', 'Great eye. Good for you for spotting the potential in a setting like this. Love the crop, love the dof. Very well-done image.', '2004-08-12 16:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
