(857860, 96651, 20779, '<td valign="top">The colors of the water are beautiful. I think the two main focal points are a bit too distant for my taste (in relation to each other and within the frame). While you have clearly captured the horizon and that "vanishing point", I still feel it is a bit weak as far as meeting the challenge. In my mind, I would expect to see more of something compelling my eye towards it or into it to clearly address the challenge. However, I do not base my scoring on this, but am hopefully just giving some helpful input from one person''s perspective.</td>', 'The colors of the water are beautiful. I think the two main focal points are a bit too distant for my taste (in relation to each other and within the frame). While you have clearly captured the horizon and that "vanishing point", I still feel it is a bit weak as far as meeting the challenge. In my mind, I would expect to see more of something compelling my eye towards it or into it to clearly address the challenge. However, I do not base my scoring on this, but am hopefully just giving some helpful input from one person''s perspective.', '2004-08-12 21:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(857864, 96784, 20779, '<td valign="top">This "meets the challenge", but the presentation isn''t particularly interesting or compelling, which hurts it. There isn''t much color or tone variance, and the tilt should either be straightened or exaggerated. This is all just my opinion, and my own entry I could apply these same words to.</td>', 'This "meets the challenge", but the presentation isn''t particularly interesting or compelling, which hurts it. There isn''t much color or tone variance, and the tilt should either be straightened or exaggerated. This is all just my opinion, and my own entry I could apply these same words to.', '2004-08-12 21:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(857868, 96699, 20779, '<td valign="top">You used a cool perspective and subject matter for this. For me, the focus is too soft, and combined with the lack of strong contrasts in the image, it loses a lot of the impact for me. I think I would have chosen to keep it a bit more off center, also. But just an opinion.</td>', 'You used a cool perspective and subject matter for this. For me, the focus is too soft, and combined with the lack of strong contrasts in the image, it loses a lot of the impact for me. I think I would have chosen to keep it a bit more off center, also. But just an opinion.', '2004-08-12 21:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(857872, 96913, 15891, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot. The colors are very vibrant and it meets the challenge well. Only one little, itty, bitty problem... you see that white spec down there in the black foreground? I didn''t enter this challenge so I can''t recall if advanced editing was allowed &amp; I''m too lazy to go look right this second  but assuming you could have, your failure to clean that off is the only thing keeping me from giving this photo a 10. I wouldn''t sweat it too much though ''cause I''m giving you a 9. Good job!</td>', 'I like this image a lot. The colors are very vibrant and it meets the challenge well. Only one little, itty, bitty problem... you see that white spec down there in the black foreground? I didn''t enter this challenge so I can''t recall if advanced editing was allowed & I''m too lazy to go look right this second  but assuming you could have, your failure to clean that off is the only thing keeping me from giving this photo a 10. I wouldn''t sweat it too much though ''cause I''m giving you a 9. Good job!', '2004-08-12 21:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
