(857962, 96474, 8891, '<td valign="top">Just saw this bridge on my way home on Sunday from NY! It''s a great looking bridge and I almost asked my buddy to stop so I could take a shot or two. I''m thinking that this could use some rotation and maybe some focus, but I''m so happy to see a rendition of it so soon after having seen I''ll be kind and think that you took it out the window of a moving car looking backwards and this is pretty good for that.</td>', 'Just saw this bridge on my way home on Sunday from NY! It''s a great looking bridge and I almost asked my buddy to stop so I could take a shot or two. I''m thinking that this could use some rotation and maybe some focus, but I''m so happy to see a rendition of it so soon after having seen I''ll be kind and think that you took it out the window of a moving car looking backwards and this is pretty good for that.', '2004-08-12 23:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
