(857979, 96375, 8891, '<td valign="top">Wow this is like David Copperfield making the Statue of Liberty Vanish. Cool how the bridge seems to submerge it self off in the distanct fog. Very well done. You might consider cropping in right and losing the dark straight object near the right border past midway...you would also lose the bright white object on the right side of the frame towards the bottom  and could crop up to lose the other on the bottom. Stunner, none the less and Good Luck!</td>', 'Wow this is like David Copperfield making the Statue of Liberty Vanish. Cool how the bridge seems to submerge it self off in the distanct fog. Very well done. You might consider cropping in right and losing the dark straight object near the right border past midway...you would also lose the bright white object on the right side of the frame towards the bottom  and could crop up to lose the other on the bottom. Stunner, none the less and Good Luck!', '2004-08-12 23:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
