(858020, 96133, 8891, '<td valign="top">Normally I might have past this off for some reason or other. It is perhaps not my cup of tea but on 3rd look I finding myself drawn to it very much. The colors in this long exposure are are quite nice and you are either at  or early morning, dusk so what you got is very nice and not over saturated. It is a very clean image. The repitition of the lights and the multiple lines of the lights of the traffic is not overly bright except for a very very small portion in the back.  I assuming you used a filter of some sort and you obviously, if you did, made the right choice. Very well done and good luck!</td>', 'Normally I might have past this off for some reason or other. It is perhaps not my cup of tea but on 3rd look I finding myself drawn to it very much. The colors in this long exposure are are quite nice and you are either at  or early morning, dusk so what you got is very nice and not over saturated. It is a very clean image. The repitition of the lights and the multiple lines of the lights of the traffic is not overly bright except for a very very small portion in the back.  I assuming you used a filter of some sort and you obviously, if you did, made the right choice. Very well done and good luck!', '2004-08-12 23:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
