(858154, 96446, 20613, '<td valign="top">GREAT shot!!  This is my favorite, so far.  Great use of black &amp; white.  The sky looks amazing.  wonderful! 10!</td>', 'GREAT shot!!  This is my favorite, so far.  Great use of black & white.  The sky looks amazing.  wonderful! 10!', '2004-08-13 02:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(858157, 96307, 20613, '<td valign="top">great shot.  It''s really obvious that you actually thought outside the box on this challenge &amp; I think that''s awesome.  This is a great shot.  Beautiful &amp; very powerful.  9</td>', 'great shot.  It''s really obvious that you actually thought outside the box on this challenge & I think that''s awesome.  This is a great shot.  Beautiful & very powerful.  9', '2004-08-13 02:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(858160, 96500, 15212, '<td valign="top">Very nicly done! I love how you cropped this. One of my top three.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-08-18 01:00:08.</i></td>', 'Very nicly done! I love how you cropped this. One of my top three.', '2004-08-13 02:43:18.000000', '2004-08-18 02:00:08.000000', 1),
(858161, 96219, 15212, '<td valign="top">I really like you take on this challenge. It''s a little different, but not so much so that it''s a strech to meet the challenge.<br/>The only concern I have about tis is the crop. There is really no reason to have all that wassted space at the bottom. I would crop it about the edge of the grass. That would also help getting your lights on the bottom "thirds" of the image.<br/>Good Luck!</td>', 'I really like you take on this challenge. It''s a little different, but not so much so that it''s a strech to meet the challenge.The only concern I have about tis is the crop. There is really no reason to have all that wassted space at the bottom. I would crop it about the edge of the grass. That would also help getting your lights on the bottom "thirds" of the image.Good Luck!', '2004-08-13 02:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(858163, 96366, 15212, '<td valign="top">No matter how good an image is, only using 213 pixels of an allowed 640, will always result in a low score. From now on please try to submit a larger photo.<br/>Other then that, it''s also out of focus.</td>', 'No matter how good an image is, only using 213 pixels of an allowed 640, will always result in a low score. From now on please try to submit a larger photo.Other then that, it''s also out of focus.', '2004-08-13 02:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(858164, 96203, 15212, '<td valign="top">Toilets never seem to score well here. Try picking a better subject.</td>', 'Toilets never seem to score well here. Try picking a better subject.', '2004-08-13 02:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
