(858198, 96913, 19608, '<td valign="top">If this doesn''t ribbon I will be very surprised.  Vanishing point = 100%.  Colors = unbelievable. Composition = could not be better.  Improvement suggested (minor) = that one spot in the bottom black area, but you could easlily crop to tha point and eliminate all below.  My prediction = red, behind "Road to Denali."</td>', 'If this doesn''t ribbon I will be very surprised.  Vanishing point = 100%.  Colors = unbelievable. Composition = could not be better.  Improvement suggested (minor) = that one spot in the bottom black area, but you could easlily crop to tha point and eliminate all below.  My prediction = red, behind "Road to Denali."', '2004-08-13 04:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
