(858251, 96619, 25017, '<td valign="top">I take photos from our car and I know it can be hard getting the view desired, but I like the fact the road can be seen to trail off around this corner, I think the cars in front add something positive to the photo rather than it being an open road, the clouds are lovely too!</td>', 'I take photos from our car and I know it can be hard getting the view desired, but I like the fact the road can be seen to trail off around this corner, I think the cars in front add something positive to the photo rather than it being an open road, the clouds are lovely too!', '2004-08-13 05:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(858252, 96879, 25017, '<td valign="top">ah well done on this composition, I looked at doing something like this too but mine did not turn out half as good! it has all the right ingrediants for me, but so love the row of trees to the right, gives a lot of atmosphere to the pic!</td>', 'ah well done on this composition, I looked at doing something like this too but mine did not turn out half as good! it has all the right ingrediants for me, but so love the row of trees to the right, gives a lot of atmosphere to the pic!', '2004-08-13 05:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
