(858604, 96222, 16046, '<td valign="top">My favorite image in this challenge, great contrast, awesome lighting, cool clouds, perfect composition. My only concern is the vanishing point, not being a point. I hope you sell prints of this one.</td>', 'My favorite image in this challenge, great contrast, awesome lighting, cool clouds, perfect composition. My only concern is the vanishing point, not being a point. I hope you sell prints of this one.', '2004-08-13 13:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
