(858783, 96366, 3102, '<td valign="top">It''s potentially a pretty scene, but I''m afraid it''s of pretty poor quality, and way too small image to judge.  Not sure it is a good representation of the challenge topic...</td>', 'It''s potentially a pretty scene, but I''m afraid it''s of pretty poor quality, and way too small image to judge.  Not sure it is a good representation of the challenge topic...', '2004-08-13 16:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
