(858814, 97008, 22922, '<td valign="top">This is WAY overexposed, not sure what you were going for, but it''s not a good challenge entry.  Looks like the negative to an image, no detail is visible, just blobs of black and swaths of white. Sorry, but I can''t give this a very good score.  Better luck next time.</td>', 'This is WAY overexposed, not sure what you were going for, but it''s not a good challenge entry.  Looks like the negative to an image, no detail is visible, just blobs of black and swaths of white. Sorry, but I can''t give this a very good score.  Better luck next time.', '2004-08-13 16:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(858818, 96366, 22922, '<td valign="top">Too small, which I''m sure 300 people have already told you. Blurry as well, and there''s no vanishing point.  Increase your DOF to capture the skyline.</td>', 'Too small, which I''m sure 300 people have already told you. Blurry as well, and there''s no vanishing point.  Increase your DOF to capture the skyline.', '2004-08-13 16:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
