(859044, 96251, 19959, '<td valign="top">Nice effort. If this was a picture of the sun and not a desklamp then it would fit the challenge better....</td>', 'Nice effort. If this was a picture of the sun and not a desklamp then it would fit the challenge better....', '2004-08-13 19:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(859048, 96401, 21554, '<td valign="top">What a great idea.    And so well done.   The colours are lovely.  The frame is a little iffy....but it kind of works....<br/></td>', 'What a great idea.    And so well done.   The colours are lovely.  The frame is a little iffy....but it kind of works....', '2004-08-13 19:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(859058, 96315, 3032, '<td valign="top">I just wondered about the many vanishing point photos that were so boring because of the lack of a ''real'' point of interest. Adding some human interest would work and voila, I was presented this photo;<br/>Like the composition (use of person &amp; positioning in frame+shadow box, angle),<br/>shadows (lines lead, texture of the fence on the floor),<br/>lighting (shadows/ person''s body &amp; face). <br/>Another interesting factor is the balance between the purple pants in the foreground and the purple floor in the background. The purple works well with the yellow/orange (natrium light?).<br/>The vanishingpoint leads back to the person again and that is cool.</td>', 'I just wondered about the many vanishing point photos that were so boring because of the lack of a ''real'' point of interest. Adding some human interest would work and voila, I was presented this photo;Like the composition (use of person & positioning in frame+shadow box, angle),shadows (lines lead, texture of the fence on the floor),lighting (shadows/ person''s body & face). Another interesting factor is the balance between the purple pants in the foreground and the purple floor in the background. The purple works well with the yellow/orange (natrium light?).The vanishingpoint leads back to the person again and that is cool.', '2004-08-13 19:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(859168, 96049, 17890, '<td valign="top">i like this very much although would have scored it much higher without the framing, i think that it takes away from the vanishing point and the overall effect</td>', 'i like this very much although would have scored it much higher without the framing, i think that it takes away from the vanishing point and the overall effect', '2004-08-13 22:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(859195, 96922, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection you caught in the water in this pic. People in the top left corner are a little distracting.</td>', 'I like the reflection you caught in the water in this pic. People in the top left corner are a little distracting.', '2004-08-13 22:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(859206, 95833, 17890, '<td valign="top">this is a great picture, love the colours and the theme is there...i would have presented it without the frame...to me it takes away from the overall effect</td>', 'this is a great picture, love the colours and the theme is there...i would have presented it without the frame...to me it takes away from the overall effect', '2004-08-13 22:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
