(859217, 96927, 17245, '<td valign="top">I love this pictuer ! When I saw the thumbnail I was thinking: all those circels will cut of the paralell lines to the horison, but I was wrong. Is the light from the sun outside the tube(looks like holes where the lights comes from) or are they lamps ?</td>', 'I love this pictuer ! When I saw the thumbnail I was thinking: all those circels will cut of the paralell lines to the horison, but I was wrong. Is the light from the sun outside the tube(looks like holes where the lights comes from) or are they lamps ?', '2004-08-13 23:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(859218, 95833, 20539, '<td valign="top">this photo is picture perfect. unfortunately, the vanishing point isnt very present. if it were an open challlenge, this would definately place number 1, but since there is a specific topic, i cant give you the 10 you deserve.</td>', 'this photo is picture perfect. unfortunately, the vanishing point isnt very present. if it were an open challlenge, this would definately place number 1, but since there is a specific topic, i cant give you the 10 you deserve.', '2004-08-13 23:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
