(859221, 96762, 20539, '<td valign="top">finaly, a shot where you can actually see the lines converge together. there have been too many parallel lines that converged only half way. hope you get a ribbon. if not, i will be shocked. good luck, 10</td>', 'finaly, a shot where you can actually see the lines converge together. there have been too many parallel lines that converged only half way. hope you get a ribbon. if not, i will be shocked. good luck, 10', '2004-08-13 23:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
