(859273, 96335, 23561, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge. I guess you were going for a grainy look here. The motion you got with the blurred logo didn''t extend to the passenger on the train. I gave this a 3.</td>', 'Meets the challenge. I guess you were going for a grainy look here. The motion you got with the blurred logo didn''t extend to the passenger on the train. I gave this a 3.', '2004-08-14 00:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(859274, 96859, 23561, '<td valign="top">The water is very dark. Not the blue I would expect to see in this type of photo. I also would have cropped it differently (this is only IMO, I have been reading about the rule of thirds lately). Sky seems kind of bleached out to. I gave you a 3.</td>', 'The water is very dark. Not the blue I would expect to see in this type of photo. I also would have cropped it differently (this is only IMO, I have been reading about the rule of thirds lately). Sky seems kind of bleached out to. I gave you a 3.', '2004-08-14 00:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(859275, 96766, 23561, '<td valign="top">This picture just looked a bit too blurry and bright. I gave it a 3.</td>', 'This picture just looked a bit too blurry and bright. I gave it a 3.', '2004-08-14 00:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(859278, 95754, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the sunset in the background and the colors of the sky, but I thought all the power lines and ugly buildings in the forground detracted from the beauty of the sunset. I gave this a 3.</td>', 'I like the sunset in the background and the colors of the sky, but I thought all the power lines and ugly buildings in the forground detracted from the beauty of the sunset. I gave this a 3.', '2004-08-14 00:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
