(859282, 96733, 23561, '<td valign="top">I just thought this photo was too dark overall. The grainy quailty is kind of nice though, makes it look a little spooky. 5</td>', 'I just thought this photo was too dark overall. The grainy quailty is kind of nice though, makes it look a little spooky. 5', '2004-08-14 00:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(859284, 97008, 23561, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 3. I just don''t like the splotchy, I guess they''re leaves, dotting around the scene and I thought the white tree is kind of distracting. Reminds of my old job looking at microfiche all day. A kind of negitve effect. Probably what you were going for, just not my cup of tea.</td>', 'I gave this a 3. I just don''t like the splotchy, I guess they''re leaves, dotting around the scene and I thought the white tree is kind of distracting. Reminds of my old job looking at microfiche all day. A kind of negitve effect. Probably what you were going for, just not my cup of tea.', '2004-08-14 00:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(859285, 96732, 23561, '<td valign="top">I gave this photo a 3. The lines from the fireworks show an example of a vanishing point, I just thought you caught too much smoke in this shot. The little puffs are distracting and the overall haze just turned into an unflattering color that bleach out the effect you get that you see on the left where there is no smoke.</td>', 'I gave this photo a 3. The lines from the fireworks show an example of a vanishing point, I just thought you caught too much smoke in this shot. The little puffs are distracting and the overall haze just turned into an unflattering color that bleach out the effect you get that you see on the left where there is no smoke.', '2004-08-14 00:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(859286, 96891, 23561, '<td valign="top">This looks like it was taken from a moving vechicle. I gave this photo a three.</td>', 'This looks like it was taken from a moving vechicle. I gave this photo a three.', '2004-08-14 00:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
