(859304, 96401, 23561, '<td valign="top">I gave this photo a 3. It took me a long time to figure it out. I like the vanishing point showing up in the mirror and the blurred look you got in the forground, but the solid thick black frame that appear to be as thick as the black around the edge of the larger mirror is distracting. It looks as if the bottom and right of the picture is suppose to be cut out.</td>', 'I gave this photo a 3. It took me a long time to figure it out. I like the vanishing point showing up in the mirror and the blurred look you got in the forground, but the solid thick black frame that appear to be as thick as the black around the edge of the larger mirror is distracting. It looks as if the bottom and right of the picture is suppose to be cut out.', '2004-08-14 01:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
