(859313, 96948, 10339, '<td valign="top">Neat subject. I likethe colors that you have captured here. The statue appears to be slightly overexposed. The blue band around the post really draws my eye. Too bad that had to be in the picture.</td>', 'Neat subject. I likethe colors that you have captured here. The statue appears to be slightly overexposed. The blue band around the post really draws my eye. Too bad that had to be in the picture.', '2004-08-14 01:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
