(859407, 96474, 24048, '<td valign="top">Good lines and composition.  Check out the Tutorial, "Using Photoshop to Prepare Photos for DPC Challenges," and pay special attention to the section on Quality while saving for the web.  You have a lot of artifacts and very high compression that don''t show this photograph to it''s advantage.  I hope this helps...</td>', 'Good lines and composition.  Check out the Tutorial, "Using Photoshop to Prepare Photos for DPC Challenges," and pay special attention to the section on Quality while saving for the web.  You have a lot of artifacts and very high compression that don''t show this photograph to it''s advantage.  I hope this helps...', '2004-08-14 06:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
