(859494, 96205, 14671, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  Perhaps getting lower to the tracks would have put more light onto the tracks getting more distance on them to actually see the vanishing point.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'nice shot.  Perhaps getting lower to the tracks would have put more light onto the tracks getting more distance on them to actually see the vanishing point.  <8>', '2004-08-14 10:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(859497, 96910, 14671, '<td valign="top">A nice photo but in my opinion just a little to bright in the greens.  Maybe a B/W conversion would have looked differently. &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'A nice photo but in my opinion just a little to bright in the greens.  Maybe a B/W conversion would have looked differently. <5>', '2004-08-14 10:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(859500, 96621, 14671, '<td valign="top">I have skipped this shot a couple of times now trying to avoid voting on it because I just can''t see the vasishing point.  It''s an interesting shot but I don''t really see how it fits this challenge.</td>', 'I have skipped this shot a couple of times now trying to avoid voting on it because I just can''t see the vasishing point.  It''s an interesting shot but I don''t really see how it fits this challenge.', '2004-08-14 10:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(859502, 96366, 19841, '<td valign="top">Small, blurry, no vanishing point.  C''mon, you''re smarter than this!</td>', 'Small, blurry, no vanishing point.  C''mon, you''re smarter than this!', '2004-08-14 10:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(859503, 96625, 23312, '<td valign="top">I love the brightness on the top of the wall  - but I feel that the tree and sky in the top of the picture distract from the wall and the interesting textures of the foreground.</td>', 'I love the brightness on the top of the wall  - but I feel that the tree and sky in the top of the picture distract from the wall and the interesting textures of the foreground.', '2004-08-14 10:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(859504, 96988, 23312, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors and nice ray effect.  I think the shot would benefit from cropping out some of the stuff at the bottom in the foreground.</td>', 'Interesting colors and nice ray effect.  I think the shot would benefit from cropping out some of the stuff at the bottom in the foreground.', '2004-08-14 10:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(859506, 96062, 23312, '<td valign="top">I love the colors!</td>', 'I love the colors!', '2004-08-14 10:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(859507, 96991, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good color. Refreshing change to see curves instead of straight lines.</td>', 'Good color. Refreshing change to see curves instead of straight lines.', '2004-08-14 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(859508, 97007, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good title.  A bit dull in the upper part.</td>', 'Good title.  A bit dull in the upper part.', '2004-08-14 10:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(859510, 96952, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good job.</td>', 'Good job.', '2004-08-14 10:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(859513, 96299, 23312, '<td valign="top">Good idea and shot,  excellent composition and DOF.</td>', 'Good idea and shot,  excellent composition and DOF.', '2004-08-14 10:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(859516, 96357, 14671, '<td valign="top">I find the picture to be a little to dark.  A little brighter would have probably made me score it a little better.</td>', 'I find the picture to be a little to dark.  A little brighter would have probably made me score it a little better.', '2004-08-14 10:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(859517, 96900, 14671, '<td valign="top">interesting shot.  its to bad you couldn''t get the path in the mirror to be clear.  it would have had added more feeling to the vanishing point.</td>', 'interesting shot.  its to bad you couldn''t get the path in the mirror to be clear.  it would have had added more feeling to the vanishing point.', '2004-08-14 10:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(859520, 96786, 14671, '<td valign="top">In my opinion I find the picture to be to dark and lakcing interesting subject matter.</td>', 'In my opinion I find the picture to be to dark and lakcing interesting subject matter.', '2004-08-14 10:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(859521, 96474, 14671, '<td valign="top">why is this so grainy???</td>', 'why is this so grainy???', '2004-08-14 10:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(859522, 96988, 19841, '<td valign="top">I would really like to see the sunbeams more clearly for this challenge.   Also, you can crop off most of that black, it offers nothing to the image.  The top half is the pretty part, you only need enough skyline for context.   5</td>', 'I would really like to see the sunbeams more clearly for this challenge.   Also, you can crop off most of that black, it offers nothing to the image.  The top half is the pretty part, you only need enough skyline for context.   5', '2004-08-14 10:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(859523, 97007, 14671, '<td valign="top">interesting take.  It might have had more feeling if it were converted to B/W. &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'interesting take.  It might have had more feeling if it were converted to B/W. <6>', '2004-08-14 10:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(859527, 96564, 23312, '<td valign="top">The narrow DOF does interesting things to the strings - this is my favorite fretboard shot of this challenge!</td>', 'The narrow DOF does interesting things to the strings - this is my favorite fretboard shot of this challenge!', '2004-08-14 10:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(859528, 96800, 19841, '<td valign="top">I would have given you a point for humor, but the flash attached to your camera glared out the funny part.</td>', 'I would have given you a point for humor, but the flash attached to your camera glared out the funny part.', '2004-08-14 10:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(859546, 96923, 10818, '<td valign="top">What pretty flowers, lovely colors, nice take on the contest.</td>', 'What pretty flowers, lovely colors, nice take on the contest.', '2004-08-14 11:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(859547, 96628, 6999, '<td valign="top">Well - there are a number of obvious ''faults'' here - at least things that I see as ''wrong'' without seeing a good reason for them. The image appears to have been adjusted to be vertical according to the furthest lampost, but that leaves the entirety of the building and all the (larger) lampposts seeming tilted. There''s a simple perspecive correction required if you want everything t be vertical/horizontal. I know there''s a tram there because your title tells me so, but it would require some careful looking to find it without that, and otherwise it seems a weirdly tilted image of a buildng at night, with a couple of light trails. The brightnedd of the building''s lights means that any trails from the tram''s windows as it has passed have failed to register. <br/> <br/>It was a good idea, I think: outside of the run-of-the-mill obvious approach taken by most, and a effective use of the challenge stipulations, but badly let down, I fear, by the image''s problems. 4<br/> <br/>As you''ve PM''d me asking me to look again at the image, here I am. I think I confused the cross-wires at the end of the road with the suggestion of a partly exposed tram - that and the very odd light-trail so high up the image, and your title. I still absolutely think you were wrong not to adjust the tilt of the shot, I still see no point to it; it adds an unconfortability to the image that it doesn''t deserve. Still a 4<br/> <br/></td>', 'Well - there are a number of obvious ''faults'' here - at least things that I see as ''wrong'' without seeing a good reason for them. The image appears to have been adjusted to be vertical according to the furthest lampost, but that leaves the entirety of the building and all the (larger) lampposts seeming tilted. There''s a simple perspecive correction required if you want everything t be vertical/horizontal. I know there''s a tram there because your title tells me so, but it would require some careful looking to find it without that, and otherwise it seems a weirdly tilted image of a buildng at night, with a couple of light trails. The brightnedd of the building''s lights means that any trails from the tram''s windows as it has passed have failed to register.  It was a good idea, I think: outside of the run-of-the-mill obvious approach taken by most, and a effective use of the challenge stipulations, but badly let down, I fear, by the image''s problems. 4 As you''ve PM''d me asking me to look again at the image, here I am. I think I confused the cross-wires at the end of the road with the suggestion of a partly exposed tram - that and the very odd light-trail so high up the image, and your title. I still absolutely think you were wrong not to adjust the tilt of the shot, I still see no point to it; it adds an unconfortability to the image that it doesn''t deserve. Still a 4 ', '2004-08-14 11:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(859548, 96913, 10818, '<td valign="top">I am normally not a big fan of power lines, but this is well done...great colors and composition.</td>', 'I am normally not a big fan of power lines, but this is well done...great colors and composition.', '2004-08-14 11:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(859549, 96910, 10818, '<td valign="top">I love old country dirt roads.  pretty shot...nice colors.</td>', 'I love old country dirt roads.  pretty shot...nice colors.', '2004-08-14 11:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(859551, 96877, 1570, '<td valign="top">i like this a lot, this was one of my own ideas for this challenge, too, but you executed it better than i could have... 8.</td>', 'i like this a lot, this was one of my own ideas for this challenge, too, but you executed it better than i could have... 8.', '2004-08-14 11:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(859561, 96732, 11895, '<td valign="top">one of the better fireworks photos I''ve seen this year</td>', 'one of the better fireworks photos I''ve seen this year', '2004-08-14 12:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(859562, 96325, 16241, '<td valign="top">i like!  duo-tone?</td>', 'i like!  duo-tone?', '2004-08-14 12:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(859563, 96219, 16241, '<td valign="top">just like that!   funny title</td>', 'just like that!   funny title', '2004-08-14 12:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(859564, 96966, 10208, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea, although it doesn''t seem to meet the suggested requirments for converging lines on the horizon, and it is a little washed out due to the suns glare on the water , but I still like it a lot</td>', 'Very nice idea, although it doesn''t seem to meet the suggested requirments for converging lines on the horizon, and it is a little washed out due to the suns glare on the water , but I still like it a lot', '2004-08-14 12:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(859566, 96661, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice angle</td>', 'nice angle', '2004-08-14 12:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(859568, 96916, 16241, '<td valign="top">funny</td>', 'funny', '2004-08-14 12:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(859570, 96327, 16241, '<td valign="top">clever</td>', 'clever', '2004-08-14 12:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(859571, 96440, 16241, '<td valign="top">like the tilt</td>', 'like the tilt', '2004-08-14 12:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(859572, 96878, 16241, '<td valign="top">cute pic and cute title, makes me happy to see this photo</td>', 'cute pic and cute title, makes me happy to see this photo', '2004-08-14 12:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(859573, 96985, 16241, '<td valign="top">very very nice.  8</td>', 'very very nice.  8', '2004-08-14 12:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(859583, 96203, 24674, '<td valign="top">Pretty funny. High points for that. :)<br/>Actually, about the photo itself, you could crop a bit closer.<br/>Or a lot closer, just keeping the pot.<br/>Also, maybe having the water flowing would also help by adding the swirling structure.<br/>Great that you remembered to make it B&amp;W.<br/></td>', 'Pretty funny. High points for that. :)Actually, about the photo itself, you could crop a bit closer.Or a lot closer, just keeping the pot.Also, maybe having the water flowing would also help by adding the swirling structure.Great that you remembered to make it B&W.', '2004-08-14 13:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(859590, 96355, 14671, '<td valign="top">an interesting take on this challenge but the size is a real issue.  might I suggest you re-size the picture then save as.  even take an inch or 2 from the top or bottom will have a great depth to the vanishing point.  You should also watch the leveling of the picture.  It looks slopped to the left.</td>', 'an interesting take on this challenge but the size is a real issue.  might I suggest you re-size the picture then save as.  even take an inch or 2 from the top or bottom will have a great depth to the vanishing point.  You should also watch the leveling of the picture.  It looks slopped to the left.', '2004-08-14 13:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(859592, 96860, 14671, '<td valign="top">nicely done.  I really like the colors or the lack there of.  it adds a crispness to the shot.</td>', 'nicely done.  I really like the colors or the lack there of.  it adds a crispness to the shot.', '2004-08-14 13:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(859595, 96133, 14671, '<td valign="top">well done.  this was the type of shot I was gonna enter but didn''t have time to submit it.  Why r the cars on the wrong side of the road???  lol j/k  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'well done.  this was the type of shot I was gonna enter but didn''t have time to submit it.  Why r the cars on the wrong side of the road???  lol j/k  <8>', '2004-08-14 13:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(859608, 96698, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely effect created by sea mist and nicely framed by foliage. The lines of the path and lamp posts are pleasing but would be more so if you rotated the image before cropping to restore the posts to a true vertical.</td>', 'Lovely effect created by sea mist and nicely framed by foliage. The lines of the path and lamp posts are pleasing but would be more so if you rotated the image before cropping to restore the posts to a true vertical.', '2004-08-14 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(859611, 96401, 3087, '<td valign="top">The thick black borders of the mirrors combine with your border to create an illusion of a stained glass window. The blurred colours in the main section add to that feel. The exposure of the segment in the smaller round mirror are a little dark and unfortunately not hugely interesting in terms of content. That said I think this is a really creative idea and you deserve kudos for the unique perspective.</td>', 'The thick black borders of the mirrors combine with your border to create an illusion of a stained glass window. The blurred colours in the main section add to that feel. The exposure of the segment in the smaller round mirror are a little dark and unfortunately not hugely interesting in terms of content. That said I think this is a really creative idea and you deserve kudos for the unique perspective.', '2004-08-14 13:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(859616, 95763, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way the light illuminates only a small area and we''re left wondering how large the space is and what else is in it. The little doll adds a surreal touch as does the rosey toning.</td>', 'I like the way the light illuminates only a small area and we''re left wondering how large the space is and what else is in it. The little doll adds a surreal touch as does the rosey toning.', '2004-08-14 13:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(859617, 95899, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an interesting idea and beautifully done. I hate spiders (with a real phobic passion) and yet I''m so fascinated by the tilted composition, the limited focus on just one segment of the web and the colours. I think it would be even stronger were the spider in focus too though only if this could be achieved without bringing too much else into focus. Very original!</td>', 'What an interesting idea and beautifully done. I hate spiders (with a real phobic passion) and yet I''m so fascinated by the tilted composition, the limited focus on just one segment of the web and the colours. I think it would be even stronger were the spider in focus too though only if this could be achieved without bringing too much else into focus. Very original!', '2004-08-14 13:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(859622, 96984, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea and lots of wonderful fiddly things to look at. Beautiful curves and lovely colours. Image seems quite noisy and, for me, that grainy effect doesn''t enhance this subject.</td>', 'Lovely idea and lots of wonderful fiddly things to look at. Beautiful curves and lovely colours. Image seems quite noisy and, for me, that grainy effect doesn''t enhance this subject.', '2004-08-14 13:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(859624, 96679, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautifully balanced composition and I like the contrast between curved and straight lines as well as wobbly ones in the reflection. Black and white enhances abstract nature of this architectural image.</td>', 'Beautifully balanced composition and I like the contrast between curved and straight lines as well as wobbly ones in the reflection. Black and white enhances abstract nature of this architectural image.', '2004-08-14 13:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(859627, 96941, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely curve down from one corner to the other. Black and white is nice but the toning is applied with too heavy a hand for my tastes.</td>', 'Lovely curve down from one corner to the other. Black and white is nice but the toning is applied with too heavy a hand for my tastes.', '2004-08-14 13:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(859631, 96753, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of what looks like low afternoon light. I''m not voting down for this in any way so the following point is about my preferences for this image as a whole rather than within the challenge but I do find that the width of the image emphasises the verticals rather than the lovely path. I wonder if a portrait or square format would emphasise the potentially strong leading lines of the path?</td>', 'Lovely use of what looks like low afternoon light. I''m not voting down for this in any way so the following point is about my preferences for this image as a whole rather than within the challenge but I do find that the width of the image emphasises the verticals rather than the lovely path. I wonder if a portrait or square format would emphasise the potentially strong leading lines of the path?', '2004-08-14 13:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(859633, 96879, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very strong lines and composition balanced well by row of tall trees in back right only.</td>', 'Very strong lines and composition balanced well by row of tall trees in back right only.', '2004-08-14 13:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(859635, 96899, 10339, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I love the colors you have captured. The over-exposure of the boards on the bridge is just perfect. Really gives you that fade-away feeling.</td>', 'Nicely done. I love the colors you have captured. The over-exposure of the boards on the bridge is just perfect. Really gives you that fade-away feeling.', '2004-08-14 13:58:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(859636, 96651, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an unusual image and very strong on use of vivid colours. Nice to see an interpretation of "vanishing point" that does use a point on the horizon but leaves the lines between foreground and vanishing point undrawn.</td>', 'What an unusual image and very strong on use of vivid colours. Nice to see an interpretation of "vanishing point" that does use a point on the horizon but leaves the lines between foreground and vanishing point undrawn.', '2004-08-14 13:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(859638, 96931, 3087, '<td valign="top">Immediate thought, which I''m sure is in every comment, is that this would benefit strongly from being rotated to correct the off-putting tilt. With strong vertical lines you really need to ensure that they are vertical within the frame itself. Might also benefit from cropping/ retaking such that the opening at the end is over to one side rather than right in the centre - my instinct would be to push it towards the right.</td>', 'Immediate thought, which I''m sure is in every comment, is that this would benefit strongly from being rotated to correct the off-putting tilt. With strong vertical lines you really need to ensure that they are vertical within the frame itself. Might also benefit from cropping/ retaking such that the opening at the end is over to one side rather than right in the centre - my instinct would be to push it towards the right.', '2004-08-14 14:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(859640, 96733, 17033, '<td valign="top">I like this effect but, speaking as one who has been punished for overprocessing in the past, I wonder if the processing has been taken a bit too far in this case. I think the contrast is a little too strong at the bottom and the graininess too patchy at the top. How about if you had filled the frame more with the gravestones?</td>', 'I like this effect but, speaking as one who has been punished for overprocessing in the past, I wonder if the processing has been taken a bit too far in this case. I think the contrast is a little too strong at the bottom and the graininess too patchy at the top. How about if you had filled the frame more with the gravestones?', '2004-08-14 14:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(859643, 96786, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great use of light and shadow! Having just viewed a somewhat similar image (colonnade at side of building) which I felt was too centred I know find one where the centred composition works very strongly. Perhaps because, although the end point is centred, the image retains a strong sense of asymmetry. That''s down to the full floor to ceiling nature of the pillars at the right and the reduced height of detail on the left.</td>', 'Great use of light and shadow! Having just viewed a somewhat similar image (colonnade at side of building) which I felt was too centred I know find one where the centred composition works very strongly. Perhaps because, although the end point is centred, the image retains a strong sense of asymmetry. That''s down to the full floor to ceiling nature of the pillars at the right and the reduced height of detail on the left.', '2004-08-14 14:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(859645, 96125, 17033, '<td valign="top">striking, stark image but might have been improved if you had got closer to the level of the road in which case the vanishing point might have been more obvious</td>', 'striking, stark image but might have been improved if you had got closer to the level of the road in which case the vanishing point might have been more obvious', '2004-08-14 14:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(859646, 96378, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract using perspective lines and texture.</td>', 'Nice abstract using perspective lines and texture.', '2004-08-14 14:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(859648, 96564, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely combination of shallow DOF and motion blur. I like the off-centred composition and the vivid red in the background.</td>', 'Lovely combination of shallow DOF and motion blur. I like the off-centred composition and the vivid red in the background.', '2004-08-14 14:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(859649, 96252, 3087, '<td valign="top">Feels a touch top heavy, which I think would be fixed by cropping a strip off from the top. Lovely rich colour within the water which contrasts with the faded weathered appearance of the wood.</td>', 'Feels a touch top heavy, which I think would be fixed by cropping a strip off from the top. Lovely rich colour within the water which contrasts with the faded weathered appearance of the wood.', '2004-08-14 14:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(859650, 96049, 17033, '<td valign="top">very geometric and well-framed. Perhaps a little too much in the mid-tones. Also the masts in the distance disrupt the image.</td>', 'very geometric and well-framed. Perhaps a little too much in the mid-tones. Also the masts in the distance disrupt the image.', '2004-08-14 14:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(859651, 96121, 17033, '<td valign="top">Hard to get the 3D impression of distance in this photo</td>', 'Hard to get the 3D impression of distance in this photo', '2004-08-14 14:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(859652, 96989, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a truly striking image and a nice interpretation of lines converging from front to back. I like the fact that this effect is exaggerated by the fact that the subject actually does get narrower along it''s length. Water droplets and interesting use of lighting add interest. Deep black background works very well.</td>', 'This is a truly striking image and a nice interpretation of lines converging from front to back. I like the fact that this effect is exaggerated by the fact that the subject actually does get narrower along it''s length. Water droplets and interesting use of lighting add interest. Deep black background works very well.', '2004-08-14 14:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(859654, 96847, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m a pretty liberal voter in terms of interpretation of challenge but this image presents no hint of a vanishing point or even of vaguely converging lines (to me) at all.</td>', 'I''m a pretty liberal voter in terms of interpretation of challenge but this image presents no hint of a vanishing point or even of vaguely converging lines (to me) at all.', '2004-08-14 14:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(859655, 96910, 17033, '<td valign="top">I know the wording says horizon, so perhaps you didn''t want to show what was in the distance, but I think the top cropping is too tight. Nice curves though.</td>', 'I know the wording says horizon, so perhaps you didn''t want to show what was in the distance, but I think the top cropping is too tight. Nice curves though.', '2004-08-14 14:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(859657, 96649, 17033, '<td valign="top">Good capture....2/3 land, 1/3sky might have worked. A little bright too.</td>', 'Good capture....2/3 land, 1/3sky might have worked. A little bright too.', '2004-08-14 14:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(859659, 96219, 17033, '<td valign="top">I really like the muted colours in the foreground. Hedge and above necessary?? How about cropping so we don''t see the end of the light??</td>', 'I really like the muted colours in the foreground. Hedge and above necessary?? How about cropping so we don''t see the end of the light??', '2004-08-14 14:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(859661, 96315, 17033, '<td valign="top">Great shot with good range of lighting levels. The model looks a little bit stranded in the middle though...how about cropping the bottom to just below her feet as our eye is pulled to where she has come from....not where she is going???</td>', 'Great shot with good range of lighting levels. The model looks a little bit stranded in the middle though...how about cropping the bottom to just below her feet as our eye is pulled to where she has come from....not where she is going???', '2004-08-14 14:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(859672, 96640, 19608, '<td valign="top">Incredible colors an a very simple yet effective composition.  This should finish in the stratosphere.</td>', 'Incredible colors an a very simple yet effective composition.  This should finish in the stratosphere.', '2004-08-14 14:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(859676, 96910, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nostalgic.  Great lighting and composition make this one really stand out.  Colors are perfect due to spot on exposure.</td>', 'Nostalgic.  Great lighting and composition make this one really stand out.  Colors are perfect due to spot on exposure.', '2004-08-14 14:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(859679, 96133, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully well done.  I don''t know how you metered, but the exposure is perfect.  The "light stars" show you really stopped down - the lens flare doesn''t hurt all all.  A very strong ribbon contender.</td>', 'Wonderfully well done.  I don''t know how you metered, but the exposure is perfect.  The "light stars" show you really stopped down - the lens flare doesn''t hurt all all.  A very strong ribbon contender.', '2004-08-14 14:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(859680, 96952, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent seeing.  The clouds reflected on the road provide a nice splash of color.</td>', 'Excellent seeing.  The clouds reflected on the road provide a nice splash of color.', '2004-08-14 14:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(859684, 96760, 14202, '<td valign="top">Love the angle of this shot</td>', 'Love the angle of this shot', '2004-08-14 14:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(859687, 95899, 11895, '<td valign="top">creative idea and an interesting capture but the poor DoF and focus don''t do it justice</td>', 'creative idea and an interesting capture but the poor DoF and focus don''t do it justice', '2004-08-14 14:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(859688, 96698, 14202, '<td valign="top">I would love to see the colour version of this shot, But love the tranquikity of this.</td>', 'I would love to see the colour version of this shot, But love the tranquikity of this.', '2004-08-14 14:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(859704, 96485, 19608, '<td valign="top">The fence to the vanishing point is a superb example.  The white sky is a disaster - too bad you didn''t have a nice crisp blue sky with a couple cumulus clouds.  Horse is a nice addition.</td>', 'The fence to the vanishing point is a superb example.  The white sky is a disaster - too bad you didn''t have a nice crisp blue sky with a couple cumulus clouds.  Horse is a nice addition.', '2004-08-14 15:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(859705, 96799, 19608, '<td valign="top">Superb lighting that workd exceptionally well with the fog.  Stunning example of vanishing point.</td>', 'Superb lighting that workd exceptionally well with the fog.  Stunning example of vanishing point.', '2004-08-14 15:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(859707, 96926, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice seeing, good subject and exposure.  The tilted horizon is a bit distracting.  Title must be mis-spelled.  Excellent rendition of the vanishing point.</td>', 'Nice seeing, good subject and exposure.  The tilted horizon is a bit distracting.  Title must be mis-spelled.  Excellent rendition of the vanishing point.', '2004-08-14 15:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(859712, 96384, 10208, '<td valign="top">It would be interesting to know how you did this</td>', 'It would be interesting to know how you did this', '2004-08-14 15:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(859713, 96289, 10084, '<td valign="top">I think a closer crop of the bridge would''ve given more impact. Your eyes seem to wonder because of the overhang. I like how the people are included and makes you feel like you are there.</td>', 'I think a closer crop of the bridge would''ve given more impact. Your eyes seem to wonder because of the overhang. I like how the people are included and makes you feel like you are there.', '2004-08-14 15:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(859714, 96799, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very impressive angle. The cobwebs, the rusted nature of the metal and the foggy mist almost gives it a spooky feeling. Very nice eye leading.</td>', 'Very impressive angle. The cobwebs, the rusted nature of the metal and the foggy mist almost gives it a spooky feeling. Very nice eye leading.', '2004-08-14 15:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(859715, 96678, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great tones and contrast in this shot gives the feeling of coolness. Love the abstract shapes that leads your eyes toward the clouds.</td>', 'Great tones and contrast in this shot gives the feeling of coolness. Love the abstract shapes that leads your eyes toward the clouds.', '2004-08-14 15:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(859716, 96403, 10084, '<td valign="top">The blue of the skies really help to bring out the pier. The beautiful clear water adds a great touch of varied color to the shot. The abstractness of the pier itself works very well because of the solid colors surrounding it (sky, water).</td>', 'The blue of the skies really help to bring out the pier. The beautiful clear water adds a great touch of varied color to the shot. The abstractness of the pier itself works very well because of the solid colors surrounding it (sky, water).', '2004-08-14 15:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(859719, 96520, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great spot to capture the moment. Your eyes are follow the road around the bend. I like that you included a point of interest by included the two men. They seem to be on a leisurely walk during a race. Depth of field is excellent. "10"</td>', 'Great spot to capture the moment. Your eyes are follow the road around the bend. I like that you included a point of interest by included the two men. They seem to be on a leisurely walk during a race. Depth of field is excellent. "10"', '2004-08-14 15:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(859730, 96989, 10634, '<td valign="top">By far the most unique idea of this challenge.. and my personal favorite... 10</td>', 'By far the most unique idea of this challenge.. and my personal favorite... 10', '2004-08-14 16:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(859731, 96991, 10634, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful. Love the color of the sky... 10</td>', 'Very beautiful. Love the color of the sky... 10', '2004-08-14 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(859739, 96926, 10084, '<td valign="top">Love the beautiful captured curve that your eyes follow from the foreground toward the background. Straightening the horizon would really make the composition perfect. Possibly adding someone to walk the road would give the feeling of being there. "8"</td>', 'Love the beautiful captured curve that your eyes follow from the foreground toward the background. Straightening the horizon would really make the composition perfect. Possibly adding someone to walk the road would give the feeling of being there. "8"', '2004-08-14 16:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(859746, 96203, 4517, '<td valign="top">Nice clean loo.</td>', 'Nice clean loo.', '2004-08-14 16:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(859752, 96751, 10084, '<td valign="top">Excellent abstract image. The blue just makes it really stand out. I think that the clouds on the right hand corner disrupts the great shapes presented. "9"</td>', 'Excellent abstract image. The blue just makes it really stand out. I think that the clouds on the right hand corner disrupts the great shapes presented. "9"', '2004-08-14 16:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
