(859758, 96708, 19608, '<td valign="top">No  - it''s way more than that - or did you count ''em?  Exceptional demo of vanishing point.  Nice lighting and colors.  I like your perspective too - staying close to the right wall.</td>', 'No  - it''s way more than that - or did you count ''em?  Exceptional demo of vanishing point.  Nice lighting and colors.  I like your perspective too - staying close to the right wall.', '2004-08-14 16:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(859763, 96222, 4517, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge. Hope its blue for you. 10</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge. Hope its blue for you. 10', '2004-08-14 16:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(859766, 96230, 19608, '<td valign="top">Unusual - but in a wonderful way.  The orage in the circular logs makes a great repeating pattern of color.  So - you have multiple vanishing points. Good seeing.</td>', 'Unusual - but in a wonderful way.  The orage in the circular logs makes a great repeating pattern of color.  So - you have multiple vanishing points. Good seeing.', '2004-08-14 16:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(859771, 96974, 19608, '<td valign="top">This is the CLASSIC vanishing point.  The wood shavings are a wonderful golden/orange color which goes so well with the green.  If only your sky would have cooperated - wouldn''t a nice crisp blue tie it all togetherr? The placement of the buildings between the first and second left trees was a nice artistic touch. It  would be a little stronger if you had included just a bit more tree on the right edge, now just a sliver.  Overall - should finish way on up there.</td>', 'This is the CLASSIC vanishing point.  The wood shavings are a wonderful golden/orange color which goes so well with the green.  If only your sky would have cooperated - wouldn''t a nice crisp blue tie it all togetherr? The placement of the buildings between the first and second left trees was a nice artistic touch. It  would be a little stronger if you had included just a bit more tree on the right edge, now just a sliver.  Overall - should finish way on up there.', '2004-08-14 16:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(859774, 97003, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful details on the stone path. I feel that a higher view may give more interest. The path seem to curve in the distant but it''s difficult to tell. Possibly an object on the path would bring more interest to the composition."9"</td>', 'Beautiful details on the stone path. I feel that a higher view may give more interest. The path seem to curve in the distant but it''s difficult to tell. Possibly an object on the path would bring more interest to the composition."9"', '2004-08-14 16:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
