(859930, 96941, 10084, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. The eye is lead along the bridge from the foreground toward the background.Breaks up the compositon and makes it appealing. Showing the people crossing the bridge add a great touch of interest. The tone used is unique, but I wonder what it would look like in regular colors. "8"</td>', 'Excellent composition. The eye is lead along the bridge from the foreground toward the background.Breaks up the compositon and makes it appealing. Showing the people crossing the bridge add a great touch of interest. The tone used is unique, but I wonder what it would look like in regular colors. "8"', '2004-08-14 20:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(859932, 96133, 10084, '<td valign="top">A closer crop may work a bit better as the roadway is very interesting with the long exposure streaking of the car lights. The light currently as the top distracts ones eyes and keeps it away from the roadway. The exposure is perfect. "9"</td>', 'A closer crop may work a bit better as the roadway is very interesting with the long exposure streaking of the car lights. The light currently as the top distracts ones eyes and keeps it away from the roadway. The exposure is perfect. "9"', '2004-08-14 20:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
