(859997, 96049, 16829, '<td valign="top">There seems to be too much going on in this picture, too many conflicting lines, so the eye is not drawn to anything. The multiple borders just make matters worse. Less is more :)</td>', 'There seems to be too much going on in this picture, too many conflicting lines, so the eye is not drawn to anything. The multiple borders just make matters worse. Less is more :)', '2004-08-14 23:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(860005, 96503, 19608, '<td valign="top">Ah - a familar sight!  As a pilot, my fist thought is that you are not on the centerline! Well composed, using the line-up lines adds a lot as does the perfectly level horizon.  It cleary demonstrates the vanishing point.</td>', 'Ah - a familar sight!  As a pilot, my fist thought is that you are not on the centerline! Well composed, using the line-up lines adds a lot as does the perfectly level horizon.  It cleary demonstrates the vanishing point.', '2004-08-14 23:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
