(860109, 96801, 25468, '<td valign="top">I like the idea used here. If I chose one thing I would have done differently, I would have got down on my knees to the little girls level and made her more of the picture. You would not have lost the vanishing point if you took a step to the left.</td>', 'I like the idea used here. If I chose one thing I would have done differently, I would have got down on my knees to the little girls level and made her more of the picture. You would not have lost the vanishing point if you took a step to the left.', '2004-08-15 02:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(860111, 96467, 19880, '<td valign="top">I love the lines, the light, the FEEL.  Aside from composition and relevency to the challenge, it''s the FEEL that motivated me to rate this photo so highly.  Good job.</td>', 'I love the lines, the light, the FEEL.  Aside from composition and relevency to the challenge, it''s the FEEL that motivated me to rate this photo so highly.  Good job.', '2004-08-15 02:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
