(860117, 96401, 19880, '<td valign="top">A very unique submission-- I like that!  Good job matching the black border with the mirror border.  Excellent composition.  The ONLY complaint I have is the content of the detailed part of the mirror.  It''s not as breathtaking as the rest of the photo makes me want it to be (not really your fault anyhow), but it is what accomplishes the vanishin-point challenge-ness of your entry.  That''s all that''s holding me back from giving you a perfect 10.  Great job!</td>', 'A very unique submission-- I like that!  Good job matching the black border with the mirror border.  Excellent composition.  The ONLY complaint I have is the content of the detailed part of the mirror.  It''s not as breathtaking as the rest of the photo makes me want it to be (not really your fault anyhow), but it is what accomplishes the vanishin-point challenge-ness of your entry.  That''s all that''s holding me back from giving you a perfect 10.  Great job!', '2004-08-15 03:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(860120, 96851, 19880, '<td valign="top">A great shot.  Yes, seems like it would be cliche for this challenge, but this is the only photo of this subject matter category that is actually pretty good.  When you can take something that out to be cliche and turn it into something outstanding, you have truly done something great.  Good job!</td>', 'A great shot.  Yes, seems like it would be cliche for this challenge, but this is the only photo of this subject matter category that is actually pretty good.  When you can take something that out to be cliche and turn it into something outstanding, you have truly done something great.  Good job!', '2004-08-15 03:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(860121, 96727, 19880, '<td valign="top">My cousin told me where this picture was from--very cool. I rated this photo very high; the only thing that would make it higher is if the quality (claritity, sharpness, detail, etc.) was a little better.  Great shot!</td>', 'My cousin told me where this picture was from--very cool. I rated this photo very high; the only thing that would make it higher is if the quality (claritity, sharpness, detail, etc.) was a little better.  Great shot!', '2004-08-15 03:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
