(860126, 96786, 25468, '<td valign="top">I thought this looked better as a thumbnail. the lack of detail gave it character that the enlargement lacks.</td>', 'I thought this looked better as a thumbnail. the lack of detail gave it character that the enlargement lacks.', '2004-08-15 03:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
