(860169, 96917, 17033, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea and you have captured the reflection well. I wonder if cropping in closer AND having a plainer background (e.g. a piece of card behind the pot) might have made this stand out even more?</td>', 'This is a great idea and you have captured the reflection well. I wonder if cropping in closer AND having a plainer background (e.g. a piece of card behind the pot) might have made this stand out even more?', '2004-08-15 05:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(860170, 95875, 17033, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the vanishing point is as stand-out as the challenge requires but this photo has a great mood. I like the tint and the dream-like quality....how did you do this? Was it NeatImage? The position of the sign/traffic lights really pulls the eye nicely. Well done.</td>', 'I''m not sure the vanishing point is as stand-out as the challenge requires but this photo has a great mood. I like the tint and the dream-like quality....how did you do this? Was it NeatImage? The position of the sign/traffic lights really pulls the eye nicely. Well done.', '2004-08-15 05:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(860172, 96335, 17033, '<td valign="top">I like grain but I''m sure many won''t. Does it add to the original image?</td>', 'I like grain but I''m sure many won''t. Does it add to the original image?', '2004-08-15 05:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(860175, 96984, 17033, '<td valign="top">maybe angle needed to show more of the length of the strings to get the VP effect</td>', 'maybe angle needed to show more of the length of the strings to get the VP effect', '2004-08-15 05:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(860178, 95763, 17033, '<td valign="top">Eerie little number! Very nice textures and grey tones. Cropping just below the curtain would might have maintained that other-worldly look instead of letting us know it is a normal room. Please tell me what the resolution of the story is...did Prince Charming arrive? Hope it scores well for you!</td>', 'Eerie little number! Very nice textures and grey tones. Cropping just below the curtain would might have maintained that other-worldly look instead of letting us know it is a normal room. Please tell me what the resolution of the story is...did Prince Charming arrive? Hope it scores well for you!', '2004-08-15 05:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(860181, 96222, 17033, '<td valign="top">Had to look this up on Google to find out where it was! So did you climb Mt McKinley? This is a fantastic shot with the striking contrast in landscapes and beautiful lighting. I''m not sure how much post-processing you''ve done but it is subtle and only adds to the final image. Great capture.</td>', 'Had to look this up on Google to find out where it was! So did you climb Mt McKinley? This is a fantastic shot with the striking contrast in landscapes and beautiful lighting. I''m not sure how much post-processing you''ve done but it is subtle and only adds to the final image. Great capture.', '2004-08-15 06:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(860186, 96941, 17033, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot: think it will do well. Minor quibbles: not sure about the foot in bottom right or the reddish tint.</td>', 'Fantastic shot: think it will do well. Minor quibbles: not sure about the foot in bottom right or the reddish tint.', '2004-08-15 06:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(860187, 96205, 17033, '<td valign="top">Minimalist and bold: I like it a lot. Lovely colour gradation, bottom to top.</td>', 'Minimalist and bold: I like it a lot. Lovely colour gradation, bottom to top.', '2004-08-15 06:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(860190, 96926, 17033, '<td valign="top">Great leading curves. I''m sure a lot of people will comment on the horizon. I guess this is because the angle is in the uncertain area where it might be a mistake or a deliberate creative choice.</td>', 'Great leading curves. I''m sure a lot of people will comment on the horizon. I guess this is because the angle is in the uncertain area where it might be a mistake or a deliberate creative choice.', '2004-08-15 06:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(860192, 96881, 17033, '<td valign="top">Nice feel to the picture. Good work</td>', 'Nice feel to the picture. Good work', '2004-08-15 06:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(860193, 96085, 17033, '<td valign="top">Familiar bridge from this challenge? Better angle of shot this one to get the VP.</td>', 'Familiar bridge from this challenge? Better angle of shot this one to get the VP.', '2004-08-15 06:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(860198, 95817, 17033, '<td valign="top">Thought I was going to have the only mist shot!!!! This one is better: very nice tones and composition. Well done.</td>', 'Thought I was going to have the only mist shot!!!! This one is better: very nice tones and composition. Well done.', '2004-08-15 06:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(860200, 96762, 17033, '<td valign="top">This is the best rail close-up this challenge: you''ve got the right balance between getting close to emphasise the VP but not letting the grey metal dominate the photo: I like the light/mist details to the top left. Good work.</td>', 'This is the best rail close-up this challenge: you''ve got the right balance between getting close to emphasise the VP but not letting the grey metal dominate the photo: I like the light/mist details to the top left. Good work.', '2004-08-15 06:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(860201, 96640, 17033, '<td valign="top">Wow! Eye candy. I could stare at this for hours. I hope this does well for you.</td>', 'Wow! Eye candy. I could stare at this for hours. I hope this does well for you.', '2004-08-15 06:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(860202, 96994, 17033, '<td valign="top">E.T. phone home. Very striking image. So much detail but VP ''shines'' through clearly. Podium?</td>', 'E.T. phone home. Very striking image. So much detail but VP ''shines'' through clearly. Podium?', '2004-08-15 06:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(860204, 96903, 17033, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. I wonder if it was taken a little to the left whether the road rather than the wall would be emphasised more. At the moment the very strong vertical line of the wall is a bit dominant</td>', 'Very nice photo. I wonder if it was taken a little to the left whether the road rather than the wall would be emphasised more. At the moment the very strong vertical line of the wall is a bit dominant', '2004-08-15 06:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(860205, 96936, 17033, '<td valign="top">Bold and simple composition with enough detail to satisfy the eye. Only suggestion: I might have cropped one sleeper up. Polished work.</td>', 'Bold and simple composition with enough detail to satisfy the eye. Only suggestion: I might have cropped one sleeper up. Polished work.', '2004-08-15 06:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(860208, 96785, 17033, '<td valign="top">Clever and spooky composition. Perhaps a little too vertical but otherwise very tasty.</td>', 'Clever and spooky composition. Perhaps a little too vertical but otherwise very tasty.', '2004-08-15 06:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(860209, 96865, 17033, '<td valign="top">bottom left sticks detract from the simplicity of this shot. Otherwise great.</td>', 'bottom left sticks detract from the simplicity of this shot. Otherwise great.', '2004-08-15 06:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(860210, 96846, 17033, '<td valign="top">Slick and atractive shot. Well framed</td>', 'Slick and atractive shot. Well framed', '2004-08-15 06:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(860212, 96879, 17033, '<td valign="top">After seeing this in the thumbnails, I''ve been waiting for this to appear large. Not disappointed! This is a wonderful composition with the leading lines hitting the off-centre trees very satisfyingly. Small suggestion: more cropped of bottom so large furrow doesn''t dominate.</td>', 'After seeing this in the thumbnails, I''ve been waiting for this to appear large. Not disappointed! This is a wonderful composition with the leading lines hitting the off-centre trees very satisfyingly. Small suggestion: more cropped of bottom so large furrow doesn''t dominate.', '2004-08-15 06:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(860232, 96454, 11181, '<td valign="top">Hong Kong? Anyway, the vanishing point isn''t clearly portrayed IMHO.. maybe taking the shot more to the right would have worked better. Good luck :)</td>', 'Hong Kong? Anyway, the vanishing point isn''t clearly portrayed IMHO.. maybe taking the shot more to the right would have worked better. Good luck :)', '2004-08-15 10:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
