(860570, 96991, 11895, '<td valign="top">I think it would improve this to crop about half of the solid black from the bottom to put more enphasis on the upper part</td>', 'I think it would improve this to crop about half of the solid black from the bottom to put more enphasis on the upper part', '2004-08-15 20:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(860598, 96954, 19608, '<td valign="top">A classic vanishing point.  It all worked but the sky did not cooperate for you. In this case I think the sky could be cropped out - putting the vp close to the top.</td>', 'A classic vanishing point.  It all worked but the sky did not cooperate for you. In this case I think the sky could be cropped out - putting the vp close to the top.', '2004-08-15 21:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(860602, 96931, 19608, '<td valign="top">Ver nice!  The shadows are at the perfect place, great diagonal lines.  Exposure spot on.  The hint of red at the "far end" is a wonderful touch.</td>', 'Ver nice!  The shadows are at the perfect place, great diagonal lines.  Exposure spot on.  The hint of red at the "far end" is a wonderful touch.', '2004-08-15 21:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(860603, 96991, 19608, '<td valign="top">The orange colors are stunning - and the vanishing point is superb.  Suggestions for improvement:  a) Crop off about 1/2 (or more)  of the black area at the bottom. b) Save it less compressed so that you don''t have the wavy area in the orange sky.  (You are allowed 150k - and you used les that 70k.)<br/> <br/>It''s a really nice submission - very graphic and effective.</td>', 'The orange colors are stunning - and the vanishing point is superb.  Suggestions for improvement:  a) Crop off about 1/2 (or more)  of the black area at the bottom. b) Save it less compressed so that you don''t have the wavy area in the orange sky.  (You are allowed 150k - and you used les that 70k.) It''s a really nice submission - very graphic and effective.', '2004-08-15 21:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(860604, 96623, 19608, '<td valign="top">Whoa - a whole load of vanishing points.  The overexposed white area is really distracting.  It would help if you used more of the 150k file size allowed.</td>', 'Whoa - a whole load of vanishing points.  The overexposed white area is really distracting.  It would help if you used more of the 150k file size allowed.', '2004-08-15 21:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(860605, 96881, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very interesting technique, I like the old-time feel.</td>', 'Very interesting technique, I like the old-time feel.', '2004-08-15 21:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(860610, 96251, 19608, '<td valign="top">Lines?  I see a lot of nice pink-like colors, but no real lines.  The white area is way too powerful.  You need to use more of the allowed 150k to get rid of the blothiness in the image.</td>', 'Lines?  I see a lot of nice pink-like colors, but no real lines.  The white area is way too powerful.  You need to use more of the allowed 150k to get rid of the blothiness in the image.', '2004-08-15 21:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(860612, 96564, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have a unique take on the popular string theme.  The moving strings add some nice lines.  Even with the movement, I''d like to see more in focus.</td>', 'You have a unique take on the popular string theme.  The moving strings add some nice lines.  Even with the movement, I''d like to see more in focus.', '2004-08-15 21:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(860613, 96366, 19608, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I really want to judge this image - it has some nice colors.  But it is just to small to tell.  It seems a bit blurry - even in theis small version.</td>', 'Sorry, I really want to judge this image - it has some nice colors.  But it is just to small to tell.  It seems a bit blurry - even in theis small version.', '2004-08-15 21:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(860615, 96981, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very pastel and peaceful.  May work better with a bit more saturation.</td>', 'Very pastel and peaceful.  May work better with a bit more saturation.', '2004-08-15 22:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(860620, 96458, 22011, '<td valign="top">Did you submit this to the wrong challenge?  I can''t really see a vanishing point here at all..  It''s an interestin g object though, is it a nightlight?</td>', 'Did you submit this to the wrong challenge?  I can''t really see a vanishing point here at all..  It''s an interestin g object though, is it a nightlight?', '2004-08-15 22:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(860630, 96446, 6667, '<td valign="top">I think this shot meets the challenge head on with a variety of perspectives.  I don''t mind the black and white or almost solarized look.  However the shot is somewhat grainy or over sharpened.  In my own humble opinion, this shot could been made even more dramatic by doing two things; Getting down low below the railing and turning the camera vertical.  Getting lower would have broadened thsidewal and funneled  the viewer''s eyes down the path. Best of luck.</td>', 'I think this shot meets the challenge head on with a variety of perspectives.  I don''t mind the black and white or almost solarized look.  However the shot is somewhat grainy or over sharpened.  In my own humble opinion, this shot could been made even more dramatic by doing two things; Getting down low below the railing and turning the camera vertical.  Getting lower would have broadened thsidewal and funneled  the viewer''s eyes down the path. Best of luck.', '2004-08-15 22:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(860631, 97004, 6667, '<td valign="top">Great shot. But in my humble opinion, you included too much in the shot (especially in the foreground).  Best of luck.</td>', 'Great shot. But in my humble opinion, you included too much in the shot (especially in the foreground).  Best of luck.', '2004-08-15 22:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(860637, 95982, 6667, '<td valign="top">It would be interesting to compare notes on your entry and mine after the voting is over.  We have similar compositions. Just curious to see if you got the same kind of comments as I did.  Best of luck.</td>', 'It would be interesting to compare notes on your entry and mine after the voting is over.  We have similar compositions. Just curious to see if you got the same kind of comments as I did.  Best of luck.', '2004-08-15 22:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(860639, 96163, 23354, '<td valign="top">really nice shot.</td>', 'really nice shot.', '2004-08-15 23:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(860641, 96874, 6667, '<td valign="top">Interesting view.   Do you need all of the street in it?  I think, in my hmble opinion,  a narrower crop and eliminating some of the road would enhance the unique vertigo effect you created.  Best of luck</td>', 'Interesting view.   Do you need all of the street in it?  I think, in my hmble opinion,  a narrower crop and eliminating some of the road would enhance the unique vertigo effect you created.  Best of luck', '2004-08-15 23:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(860643, 96851, 23354, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2004-08-15 23:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(860646, 96203, 19608, '<td valign="top">Well - things do indeed vanish there.  Seems flat amd underexposed - and really isn''t exactly what the cahllenge was all about.</td>', 'Well - things do indeed vanish there.  Seems flat amd underexposed - and really isn''t exactly what the cahllenge was all about.', '2004-08-15 23:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(860649, 96152, 23354, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2004-08-15 23:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(860650, 96881, 6667, '<td valign="top">In my humble opinion, if you would have cropped out more of the top portion (gotten rid of that white space) of the shot you would have a much more dramatic presentation.</td>', 'In my humble opinion, if you would have cropped out more of the top portion (gotten rid of that white space) of the shot you would have a much more dramatic presentation.', '2004-08-15 23:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(860652, 96987, 19608, '<td valign="top">A great idea - definitely leads to a vanishing point.  There''s a lot of wasted space in the sky - but cropping it to a square image actually makes it stronger. Crop just higher than the tallest building. That way the vanishing point is at a crashpoint.  Exposure is right on - and the star flares from the lights are great.</td>', 'A great idea - definitely leads to a vanishing point.  There''s a lot of wasted space in the sky - but cropping it to a square image actually makes it stronger. Crop just higher than the tallest building. That way the vanishing point is at a crashpoint.  Exposure is right on - and the star flares from the lights are great.', '2004-08-15 23:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(860653, 96062, 19608, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  Must be New Zealand or some other wine-producing area.  Nice demo of the vanishing point - great exposure and color saturation.</td>', 'Hmm.  Must be New Zealand or some other wine-producing area.  Nice demo of the vanishing point - great exposure and color saturation.', '2004-08-15 23:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(860654, 95822, 19608, '<td valign="top">The black background makes the subtle colors really zing.  I''d like to see the first fret area in the foreground in focus.  The diagonal placement is very effective and creative.</td>', 'The black background makes the subtle colors really zing.  I''d like to see the first fret area in the foreground in focus.  The diagonal placement is very effective and creative.', '2004-08-15 23:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(860656, 95797, 6667, '<td valign="top">In my humble opinion, if you would have moved to the left to include more of the rode (to lead the viewer down it. . .  and gotten that reed out of the way) and gotten down a little lower, you would have increased the dramatic impact of this image tremendously. I am not so sure that you need that much of the farm land on the right showing.  best of luck.</td>', 'In my humble opinion, if you would have moved to the left to include more of the rode (to lead the viewer down it. . .  and gotten that reed out of the way) and gotten down a little lower, you would have increased the dramatic impact of this image tremendously. I am not so sure that you need that much of the farm land on the right showing.  best of luck.', '2004-08-15 23:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(860658, 96372, 19608, '<td valign="top">No, not just not another railway track photo at all!  It''s one that is unique, creative and artistic.  The glowing colors are very magical.  The platform next to the rails is a vanishing point without the rails.  Well seen and shot.</td>', 'No, not just not another railway track photo at all!  It''s one that is unique, creative and artistic.  The glowing colors are very magical.  The platform next to the rails is a vanishing point without the rails.  Well seen and shot.', '2004-08-15 23:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(860660, 96511, 6667, '<td valign="top">Cute, real cute.  Best of luck</td>', 'Cute, real cute.  Best of luck', '2004-08-15 23:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(860661, 95822, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is clearly the fingerboard of a well-played guitar. And it''s past time to change those strings. Great shot, though - you really exaggerated the converging lines well.</td>', 'This is clearly the fingerboard of a well-played guitar. And it''s past time to change those strings. Great shot, though - you really exaggerated the converging lines well.', '2004-08-15 23:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(860664, 96781, 12733, '<td valign="top">I think the perspective in this shot would stand out much better if some of the foreground black were cropped out. And it would stand out still better if the sidewalk extended almost all the way to the lead edge - that is, more sidewalk so there would be no need to crop.</td>', 'I think the perspective in this shot would stand out much better if some of the foreground black were cropped out. And it would stand out still better if the sidewalk extended almost all the way to the lead edge - that is, more sidewalk so there would be no need to crop.', '2004-08-15 23:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(860667, 96169, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the metallic texture on the railing and the concrete texture on the ground. There a real hot spot at the top of the railing that distracts some.</td>', 'I like the metallic texture on the railing and the concrete texture on the ground. There a real hot spot at the top of the railing that distracts some.', '2004-08-15 23:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(860669, 96152, 12733, '<td valign="top">This perspective really pulls the viewer into the picture. I think a crop of the foreground near the start of the right-hand wall would reduce the "cut-off" look of the carpet.</td>', 'This perspective really pulls the viewer into the picture. I think a crop of the foreground near the start of the right-hand wall would reduce the "cut-off" look of the carpet.', '2004-08-15 23:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(860672, 95763, 12733, '<td valign="top">A small, lonely figure in a cavernous space; very effective.</td>', 'A small, lonely figure in a cavernous space; very effective.', '2004-08-15 23:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(860673, 96384, 6667, '<td valign="top">Very neat idea. In my humble opinion a thighter crop, so that the stairs fill up the bottom portion of the image, would have added dramatically to the impact. None te less. . . neat.</td>', 'Very neat idea. In my humble opinion a thighter crop, so that the stairs fill up the bottom portion of the image, would have added dramatically to the impact. None te less. . . neat.', '2004-08-15 23:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(860675, 96154, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and nice perspective effect. I think you got the highlights over bright; the whole effect is too contrasty, particularly with the spillover in the center background.</td>', 'Nice idea, and nice perspective effect. I think you got the highlights over bright; the whole effect is too contrasty, particularly with the spillover in the center background.', '2004-08-15 23:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(860677, 95990, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great pastel colors. The hanging lights really emphasize the sense of a vanishing point and the light at the end of the tunnel is a bonus. Great shot.</td>', 'Great pastel colors. The hanging lights really emphasize the sense of a vanishing point and the light at the end of the tunnel is a bonus. Great shot.', '2004-08-15 23:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(860679, 96994, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice balance of light and shadow. My first reaction was that the building in the foreground is too close and distracting, but the longer I look the more it fits in, especailly with the green at the left of the foreground.</td>', 'Nice balance of light and shadow. My first reaction was that the building in the foreground is too close and distracting, but the longer I look the more it fits in, especailly with the green at the left of the foreground.', '2004-08-15 23:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(860681, 96926, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice textures, and a nice sense of perspective. The colors contrast well, and I think the tilted horizon works to make the shot more dynamic.</td>', 'Nice textures, and a nice sense of perspective. The colors contrast well, and I think the tilted horizon works to make the shot more dynamic.', '2004-08-15 23:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(860682, 96152, 6667, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Did you consider cropping the top just above the glow of the light to add to the depth? Puts the viewers eyes right in line with the hall way. Best of luck</td>', 'Very nice.  Did you consider cropping the top just above the glow of the light to add to the depth? Puts the viewers eyes right in line with the hall way. Best of luck', '2004-08-15 23:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(860685, 96163, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot of the bridge and downtown. The distant figure and dramatic sky make it outstanding.</td>', 'This is a great shot of the bridge and downtown. The distant figure and dramatic sky make it outstanding.', '2004-08-15 23:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(860695, 95919, 12733, '<td valign="top">The brick buildings, paving stones lighting and the curve in the distance build a great mood. All it needs is a silhouetted erson a little this side of the lamp post and you''d have you a 10. Looks kind of empty without the restless dreamer, though.</td>', 'The brick buildings, paving stones lighting and the curve in the distance build a great mood. All it needs is a silhouetted erson a little this side of the lamp post and you''d have you a 10. Looks kind of empty without the restless dreamer, though.', '2004-08-15 23:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(860709, 96640, 6804, '<td valign="top">WOW! This is my favorite picture in the challenge. Perfect coloring, excellent detail with incredible depth of field. The composition is just outstanding.  10</td>', 'WOW! This is my favorite picture in the challenge. Perfect coloring, excellent detail with incredible depth of field. The composition is just outstanding.  10', '2004-08-16 00:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(860712, 96881, 12733, '<td valign="top">The superstructure makes this more than your usual tracks into the distance shot. As I moved the picture down in my browser, I cut off a lot of the foreground, and the first set of girders formed a great frame. I think cutting it there would be a great improvement - but a great shot anywayt.</td>', 'The superstructure makes this more than your usual tracks into the distance shot. As I moved the picture down in my browser, I cut off a lot of the foreground, and the first set of girders formed a great frame. I think cutting it there would be a great improvement - but a great shot anywayt.', '2004-08-16 00:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(860713, 96910, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the curve in the road, but the colors look way oversaturated and too contrasty.</td>', 'I like the curve in the road, but the colors look way oversaturated and too contrasty.', '2004-08-16 00:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(860715, 96688, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of perspective to pull the viewer into the picture.</td>', 'Nice use of perspective to pull the viewer into the picture.', '2004-08-16 00:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(860719, 96222, 7628, '<td valign="top">My favorite for the challenge! 10</td>', 'My favorite for the challenge! 10', '2004-08-16 00:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(860722, 95833, 23929, '<td valign="top">The border may be a bit much. TThe large which frame distracts a bit too much.</td>', 'The border may be a bit much. TThe large which frame distracts a bit too much.', '2004-08-16 00:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(860723, 96203, 23929, '<td valign="top">Very funny. Good thing there''s nothing "vanishing" lol :)</td>', 'Very funny. Good thing there''s nothing "vanishing" lol :)', '2004-08-16 00:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(860728, 95893, 7474, '<td valign="top">beautiful contrast, textures and an intersting point of view .</td>', 'beautiful contrast, textures and an intersting point of view .', '2004-08-16 00:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(860729, 96766, 23929, '<td valign="top">Very noisy. Needs some focus. Good try.</td>', 'Very noisy. Needs some focus. Good try.', '2004-08-16 00:26:24.000000', NULL, 1);
