(861517, 96163, 7560, '<td valign="top">A classic example of the vanishing point using one of Americas icons. Not sure I like the selective desat choice. And the streetlight throws the symmetry off. i''d move closer or farther from the pamp or use a different DOF selection to compress the lights a bit. Nice job. 6</td>', 'A classic example of the vanishing point using one of Americas icons. Not sure I like the selective desat choice. And the streetlight throws the symmetry off. i''d move closer or farther from the pamp or use a different DOF selection to compress the lights a bit. Nice job. 6', '2004-08-16 12:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
