(861706, 96124, 25309, '<td valign="top">The alignment on the left would have given more power to the photo.</td>', 'The alignment on the left would have given more power to the photo.', '2004-08-16 14:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(861730, 96538, 7560, '<td valign="top">You have the right idea with vanishing point here. The key thing is lighting. This looks like it was shot around 1-3 in trhe afternoon. The lighting is overly harsh, and doesn''t lend anything to the scene. A polarizer might help pop out the color a bit. The better bet is to come back around 6-8pm and get the same image in changing light. That will give it more depth.</td>', 'You have the right idea with vanishing point here. The key thing is lighting. This looks like it was shot around 1-3 in trhe afternoon. The lighting is overly harsh, and doesn''t lend anything to the scene. A polarizer might help pop out the color a bit. The better bet is to come back around 6-8pm and get the same image in changing light. That will give it more depth.', '2004-08-16 14:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(861737, 97009, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love the addition of the little piper. :) The major issue I have with this image is the contrast. It ends up feeling a bit over processed to me. The powerlines are also a distraction. I still really like the shot, 7.</td>', 'I love the addition of the little piper. :) The major issue I have with this image is the contrast. It ends up feeling a bit over processed to me. The powerlines are also a distraction. I still really like the shot, 7.', '2004-08-16 14:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(861752, 96733, 7560, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the contrast level is a tad high. You loose too many of the midarea names on the tombstones. A light burn in so you could see the names on the 2-5 stones in the second row might help.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the contrast level is a tad high. You loose too many of the midarea names on the tombstones. A light burn in so you could see the names on the 2-5 stones in the second row might help.', '2004-08-16 15:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(861753, 96203, 22781, '<td valign="top">LOL but not realy within the rules I guess</td>', 'LOL but not realy within the rules I guess', '2004-08-16 15:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(861757, 96847, 7560, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! Sports are always a challenge. I like thethe pov and you crop selection. My only problem is beyond your control. It''s a bit off to have the swimmer in lane 2 hitting the water so early, I''d love to have a nice arch showing on her back. But again, not something you can fix. 7</td>', 'Nice capture! Sports are always a challenge. I like thethe pov and you crop selection. My only problem is beyond your control. It''s a bit off to have the swimmer in lane 2 hitting the water so early, I''d love to have a nice arch showing on her back. But again, not something you can fix. 7', '2004-08-16 15:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(861767, 96168, 7560, '<td valign="top">Great lighting choice here. The only issue I see is the plethora of lines. You have a diagonal cutting the upper left, a curve to the left, another curve coming from the right (trteeline) and the break in the line of tombstones that takes away from the vanishing point you are trying to lead me to. 6</td>', 'Great lighting choice here. The only issue I see is the plethora of lines. You have a diagonal cutting the upper left, a curve to the left, another curve coming from the right (trteeline) and the break in the line of tombstones that takes away from the vanishing point you are trying to lead me to. 6', '2004-08-16 15:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(861845, 96299, 6132, '<td valign="top">I really like this creative idea. I feel the image is a little dark (Probably due to the Fstop), and the focusing seems to be slightly off on the first ring, but overall a good image that fits the challenge well. Good luck!</td>', 'I really like this creative idea. I feel the image is a little dark (Probably due to the Fstop), and the focusing seems to be slightly off on the first ring, but overall a good image that fits the challenge well. Good luck!', '2004-08-16 16:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(861858, 96720, 6132, '<td valign="top">Although a tad overexposed, I really do like this image. I like the effect of the pattern of shadows throughout the length of the path that are created due to the fence posts. I especially like the urban feel of the image, it instantly makes me think of the back of a basketball court down- town or something.  Good luck!</td>', 'Although a tad overexposed, I really do like this image. I like the effect of the pattern of shadows throughout the length of the path that are created due to the fence posts. I especially like the urban feel of the image, it instantly makes me think of the back of a basketball court down- town or something.  Good luck!', '2004-08-16 16:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(861870, 96335, 6132, '<td valign="top">A very nice image that meets the challenge well. I''m sure many will comment about too much grain,  but I personally feel it works well and compliments the gritty subway surroundings.</td>', 'A very nice image that meets the challenge well. I''m sure many will comment about too much grain,  but I personally feel it works well and compliments the gritty subway surroundings.', '2004-08-16 16:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(861886, 96252, 6999, '<td valign="top">So difficult I know, but I find this suffers from a lack of definition around those piles and braces - probably simply because of the brightness of the water; even allowing the sunlit areas of wood to burn out (as I think you should, in this instance), there seems a lack of visible texture and tonality in the wood. Perhaps a touch sharper, or a little work with curves, might bring things out more? Good colour in the water though, and in the reflected light. 6</td>', 'So difficult I know, but I find this suffers from a lack of definition around those piles and braces - probably simply because of the brightness of the water; even allowing the sunlit areas of wood to burn out (as I think you should, in this instance), there seems a lack of visible texture and tonality in the wood. Perhaps a touch sharper, or a little work with curves, might bring things out more? Good colour in the water though, and in the reflected light. 6', '2004-08-16 16:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(861893, 96121, 6999, '<td valign="top">Hugely challenging subject you''ve set yourself ... but I fear you haven''t quite carried it off - a pretty cold image, to me, and it lacks that structural fascination that might give it punch.</td>', 'Hugely challenging subject you''ve set yourself ... but I fear you haven''t quite carried it off - a pretty cold image, to me, and it lacks that structural fascination that might give it punch.', '2004-08-16 16:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(861898, 96661, 6999, '<td valign="top">Neat, well done image. I personally like the distribution of weight added by the tilt - although it doesn''t make it stand out special - and I fear the punters won''t get it at all. Something to do with the sense of vertigo one can get from looking up at things like this. Nice stuff, but lacking in an element of delight - perhaps that light is just a touch too ordinary. 6</td>', 'Neat, well done image. I personally like the distribution of weight added by the tilt - although it doesn''t make it stand out special - and I fear the punters won''t get it at all. Something to do with the sense of vertigo one can get from looking up at things like this. Nice stuff, but lacking in an element of delight - perhaps that light is just a touch too ordinary. 6', '2004-08-16 16:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(861905, 95763, 20115, '<td valign="top">Half expect her to get up and start walking.  Tone and color are perfect for this unreal shot.</td>', 'Half expect her to get up and start walking.  Tone and color are perfect for this unreal shot.', '2004-08-16 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(861913, 96851, 20115, '<td valign="top">Great shot--perfect colorization choice.</td>', 'Great shot--perfect colorization choice.', '2004-08-16 16:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(861942, 96766, 20066, '<td valign="top">So bad it isn''t in proper focus I think since the thumbnail was very good.</td>', 'So bad it isn''t in proper focus I think since the thumbnail was very good.', '2004-08-16 17:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(861945, 96800, 20066, '<td valign="top">Yes that vanish is even vanishing.</td>', 'Yes that vanish is even vanishing.', '2004-08-16 17:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(861952, 96739, 22392, '<td valign="top">it''s defenitley a dutch station. The Hague Hollands Spoor? I am not sure, but like the picture. 7</td>', 'it''s defenitley a dutch station. The Hague Hollands Spoor? I am not sure, but like the picture. 7', '2004-08-16 17:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(862100, 96987, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not wholly convinced abut the composition - though you have at least used the leading lines idea sensibly, which is more than some have managed. I agree it needed some amount of sky to give space to the image - but this much, and to weake the vanishing point by placing it centre-frame? I''m not sure. Not at all a poor attempt - could happily for me have had more contrast, more blacks to off-set those trails: it is perhaps a little over-exposed.</td>', 'Not wholly convinced abut the composition - though you have at least used the leading lines idea sensibly, which is more than some have managed. I agree it needed some amount of sky to give space to the image - but this much, and to weake the vanishing point by placing it centre-frame? I''m not sure. Not at all a poor attempt - could happily for me have had more contrast, more blacks to off-set those trails: it is perhaps a little over-exposed.', '2004-08-16 18:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(862109, 96739, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good work. Nice to see a decent use of burn out, and certainly meets the challenge. lacks any great interest, or difference however - some special moment of light, or composition - to break out of the 6 bracket for me.</td>', 'Good work. Nice to see a decent use of burn out, and certainly meets the challenge. lacks any great interest, or difference however - some special moment of light, or composition - to break out of the 6 bracket for me.', '2004-08-16 18:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(862113, 96651, 6999, '<td valign="top">Oh very dpc! Sure you''ll do well - great colours, great sense of depth, effective composition, gently witty. The smallest point, but that blue sky could do with a touch of cleaning up.</td>', 'Oh very dpc! Sure you''ll do well - great colours, great sense of depth, effective composition, gently witty. The smallest point, but that blue sky could do with a touch of cleaning up.', '2004-08-16 18:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(862120, 96404, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like this very much - structurally, colour, thematically. Ideally, of course, you might have tried to bring up tose crazy forground shadow angles. I''m not completely sure about the collection of whatever it is between the bridges - looks like a trailer or something - and it''s perhaps that lack of definition that hurts the image for my score.</td>', 'Like this very much - structurally, colour, thematically. Ideally, of course, you might have tried to bring up tose crazy forground shadow angles. I''m not completely sure about the collection of whatever it is between the bridges - looks like a trailer or something - and it''s perhaps that lack of definition that hurts the image for my score.', '2004-08-16 18:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(862129, 96972, 25255, '<td valign="top">Should have put all the chains in the picture up!</td>', 'Should have put all the chains in the picture up!', '2004-08-16 19:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(862140, 96916, 24486, '<td valign="top">It might have worked better if you had lined up the cigarettes a bit better to try and gain better perspective.</td>', 'It might have worked better if you had lined up the cigarettes a bit better to try and gain better perspective.', '2004-08-16 19:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(862147, 96859, 12268, '<td valign="top">this is a nice shot but some easily fixed technical stuff is lacking. for instance, the horizon is crooked... can easily be fixed in the digtal darktroom and the water seems a bit underexposed which could have been shot with an ae finction.</td>', 'this is a nice shot but some easily fixed technical stuff is lacking. for instance, the horizon is crooked... can easily be fixed in the digtal darktroom and the water seems a bit underexposed which could have been shot with an ae finction.', '2004-08-16 19:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
