(862247, 96377, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice wood texture and path. Definite vanishing point, but the bare earth (or is it dead grass) near the path detracts, as do the messy leaves peeking out from under the fence.</td>', 'Nice wood texture and path. Definite vanishing point, but the bare earth (or is it dead grass) near the path detracts, as do the messy leaves peeking out from under the fence.', '2004-08-16 20:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
