(862253, 96800, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute pun, but the description of the challenge was pretty specific about what meaning to give "vanishing point." It was all about perspective.</td>', 'Cute pun, but the description of the challenge was pretty specific about what meaning to give "vanishing point." It was all about perspective.', '2004-08-16 20:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
