(862652, 96325, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great angle and perspective. The tone take some getting used to as I find it an unusual choice, its just a bit to red for me and it appears that you were doing a bit of IR as well. I think it works rather well. Like it very much.</td>', 'Great angle and perspective. The tone take some getting used to as I find it an unusual choice, its just a bit to red for me and it appears that you were doing a bit of IR as well. I think it works rather well. Like it very much.', '2004-08-17 01:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(862654, 96352, 8891, '<td valign="top">I think the frame on this is fine but the vignette I do not think was a good choice. The angle and the lines are very good as is the exposure, detail, perspective  and DOF.</td>', 'I think the frame on this is fine but the vignette I do not think was a good choice. The angle and the lines are very good as is the exposure, detail, perspective  and DOF.', '2004-08-17 01:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(862656, 96994, 8891, '<td valign="top">very nice, like the lines and the eventual vanishing of the city scape into the dark horizon. Nice choice of exposure. Not sure about all the dark buildings at the bottom and the two green structures at the lower right are a bit of a distraction. But what are you going to do...they''re there. Very nice effort and I really like the deep DOF. Good luck!</td>', 'very nice, like the lines and the eventual vanishing of the city scape into the dark horizon. Nice choice of exposure. Not sure about all the dark buildings at the bottom and the two green structures at the lower right are a bit of a distraction. But what are you going to do...they''re there. Very nice effort and I really like the deep DOF. Good luck!', '2004-08-17 01:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(862663, 96903, 8891, '<td valign="top">The frame gets lost in the brighness of the horizon and might have been done away with or a darker color chosen. The white sky is, as some told me once in the Deep DOF challenge, a "no no". Minimaliizing it with a crop in this image as is might have been a way to go. Not sure. The road  is very interesting. I like its composition....I think if you had move some to your left that it might have enabled you to include in the foreground a bit more for continuity of it through out the image to its vanishing point.  A very fine effort none the less. Good luck!</td>', 'The frame gets lost in the brighness of the horizon and might have been done away with or a darker color chosen. The white sky is, as some told me once in the Deep DOF challenge, a "no no". Minimaliizing it with a crop in this image as is might have been a way to go. Not sure. The road  is very interesting. I like its composition....I think if you had move some to your left that it might have enabled you to include in the foreground a bit more for continuity of it through out the image to its vanishing point.  A very fine effort none the less. Good luck!', '2004-08-17 01:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(862665, 97004, 8891, '<td valign="top">Very nice exposure and colors, GREAT sky, and perspective. Like the composition and detail too. Well done!</td>', 'Very nice exposure and colors, GREAT sky, and perspective. Like the composition and detail too. Well done!', '2004-08-17 01:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
