(862705, 96986, 8891, '<td valign="top">As I scroll down to comment I see that I like the abstractness of this very much with out any ''horizon'' or in this case the buildings and the people in the background. very nice . Like the  color and I like the bit of interruption of the color by the shadow. Adds some more interest to it for me.</td>', 'As I scroll down to comment I see that I like the abstractness of this very much with out any ''horizon'' or in this case the buildings and the people in the background. very nice . Like the  color and I like the bit of interruption of the color by the shadow. Adds some more interest to it for me.', '2004-08-17 02:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
