(863095, 96991, 19978, '<td valign="top">I see these pivot irrigation systems all the time and have played around with ideas for good shots. You''ve captured that exactly in your shot. It''s beautiful and very well done. A very creative response to the challenge, IMO, and well worth the effort. Bumping from 6 to 7.</td>', 'I see these pivot irrigation systems all the time and have played around with ideas for good shots. You''ve captured that exactly in your shot. It''s beautiful and very well done. A very creative response to the challenge, IMO, and well worth the effort. Bumping from 6 to 7.', '2004-08-17 12:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
