(863099, 96871, 19978, '<td valign="top">A beautiful, well composed shot. I was suspicious of the (apparent) fallen leaves on the ground, but the gods tell us your photo is validated. Beautifully done, I love the composition and crop. I like the touch of the couple walking too, though I think it would have worked with the isolated, lonely feel too. Very well done photo.</td>', 'A beautiful, well composed shot. I was suspicious of the (apparent) fallen leaves on the ground, but the gods tell us your photo is validated. Beautifully done, I love the composition and crop. I like the touch of the couple walking too, though I think it would have worked with the isolated, lonely feel too. Very well done photo.', '2004-08-17 12:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(863103, 96651, 25555, '<td valign="top">even if the small boats in the foreground make a good contrast to the big one in the background, I still think this one would have made more impact having them cropped out, but that''s just my 2 cents...</td>', 'even if the small boats in the foreground make a good contrast to the big one in the background, I still think this one would have made more impact having them cropped out, but that''s just my 2 cents...', '2004-08-17 12:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
