(863402, 96408, 25468, '<td valign="top">I assume by the darkness of the sky that a polarizer was used in this photo, but that''s ok I use them all the time. I think there should be more of the road in the picture. The tree seems too centered and became the center of attention (at least for me)</td>', 'I assume by the darkness of the sky that a polarizer was used in this photo, but that''s ok I use them all the time. I think there should be more of the road in the picture. The tree seems too centered and became the center of attention (at least for me)', '2004-08-17 15:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(863408, 96618, 25468, '<td valign="top">The only thing I liked about this photo was the array of color. I can only imagine the size of the neon sign casting it. For that I give it a 4</td>', 'The only thing I liked about this photo was the array of color. I can only imagine the size of the neon sign casting it. For that I give it a 4', '2004-08-17 15:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(863411, 96940, 25468, '<td valign="top">As a life-long bass player I love the idea. I would like to have seen this done with a smaller aperture so the bluring was alot less. sort of distracting to me</td>', 'As a life-long bass player I love the idea. I would like to have seen this done with a smaller aperture so the bluring was alot less. sort of distracting to me', '2004-08-17 15:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(863414, 96564, 25468, '<td valign="top">As I commented on the ''fireburst bass'' shot I''ll comment on this. I love music and am a lifetime musician so I love the idea. The lighting in this shot is wonderful but the blurring from high aperture disorients me.</td>', 'As I commented on the ''fireburst bass'' shot I''ll comment on this. I love music and am a lifetime musician so I love the idea. The lighting in this shot is wonderful but the blurring from high aperture disorients me.', '2004-08-17 15:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(863417, 96951, 25468, '<td valign="top">This photo didn''t fit my tastes.</td>', 'This photo didn''t fit my tastes.', '2004-08-17 15:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(863419, 96378, 25468, '<td valign="top">As I vote today (the last day of voting) and try to hit my 20%, I have to rate this photo on initial reaction only and will probably feel differently when I figure out what the message is. I give this a 5 because it''s beyond point-and-shoot. There is composition, and feeling. I didn''t rate it higher because it seems the stairs vanish off the side of the photo as opposed to an actual ''vanishing point'' somewhere within the photo.</td>', 'As I vote today (the last day of voting) and try to hit my 20%, I have to rate this photo on initial reaction only and will probably feel differently when I figure out what the message is. I give this a 5 because it''s beyond point-and-shoot. There is composition, and feeling. I didn''t rate it higher because it seems the stairs vanish off the side of the photo as opposed to an actual ''vanishing point'' somewhere within the photo.', '2004-08-17 15:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(863423, 96463, 25468, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what this is so I''ll give it a 5. No hate, No help.</td>', 'I don''t know what this is so I''ll give it a 5. No hate, No help.', '2004-08-17 15:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(863426, 96154, 25468, '<td valign="top">I really like this kind of work. It takes precision and patients. It''s amazing how the cars don''t seem to be swerving. My guess this was done at about 1 to 2 second exposure. maybe it bit longer since the sky is beautifully lit up.</td>', 'I really like this kind of work. It takes precision and patients. It''s amazing how the cars don''t seem to be swerving. My guess this was done at about 1 to 2 second exposure. maybe it bit longer since the sky is beautifully lit up.', '2004-08-17 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(863457, 96299, 20889, '<td valign="top">very nice....10</td>', 'very nice....10', '2004-08-17 16:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(863494, 96952, 25553, '<td valign="top">incredible clouds, nice wet look!</td>', 'incredible clouds, nice wet look!', '2004-08-17 16:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(863508, 95817, 25486, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, the lighthouse is just on the point of vanishing. Not sure about the figures though? Especially with them looking at the camera.  Would have been better with them walking away about halfway down the pier.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, the lighthouse is just on the point of vanishing. Not sure about the figures though? Especially with them looking at the camera.  Would have been better with them walking away about halfway down the pier.', '2004-08-17 16:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(863511, 96640, 25486, '<td valign="top">Great shot, fantastic depth of field (no pun intended), the lighting looks great!<br/> <br/>How would you feel about cropping to remove the sky altogether?  I know it adds contrast, just an idea.</td>', 'Great shot, fantastic depth of field (no pun intended), the lighting looks great! How would you feel about cropping to remove the sky altogether?  I know it adds contrast, just an idea.', '2004-08-17 16:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(863520, 95999, 25486, '<td valign="top">Great exposure control! Wonderful silky appearance to the road surface.  Technically difficult, assuming you weren''t standing in the middle of the highway! Great urban landscape.</td>', 'Great exposure control! Wonderful silky appearance to the road surface.  Technically difficult, assuming you weren''t standing in the middle of the highway! Great urban landscape.', '2004-08-17 16:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(863522, 96495, 25486, '<td valign="top">God shot but, a lower veiwpoint and more emphasis on the fence would have produced a more striking image I think.</td>', 'God shot but, a lower veiwpoint and more emphasis on the fence would have produced a more striking image I think.', '2004-08-17 17:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(863525, 96985, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure control, good viewpoint, lovley reflections.  Nicely worked image.</td>', 'Nice exposure control, good viewpoint, lovley reflections.  Nicely worked image.', '2004-08-17 17:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(863530, 96931, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and texture. Assuming that''s a figure in red at the end of the row of columns its a bit too small.  Also I think a lower viewpoint and slightly offset from the center would have worked better.</td>', 'Nice lighting and texture. Assuming that''s a figure in red at the end of the row of columns its a bit too small.  Also I think a lower viewpoint and slightly offset from the center would have worked better.', '2004-08-17 17:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(863542, 96708, 25486, '<td valign="top">A real quality image, some might say a bit obvious but very well presented non the less.  The only flaw, if you can call it that, for me would be the very burnt out lights, but I don''t know how that could be avoided without some manipulation.  The viewpoint is excellent, the depth of field is spot on, the colour, the reflections combine to produce a very high quality image in my opinion.  One I would be very proud of and very envious of as it happens.  Well done!</td>', 'A real quality image, some might say a bit obvious but very well presented non the less.  The only flaw, if you can call it that, for me would be the very burnt out lights, but I don''t know how that could be avoided without some manipulation.  The viewpoint is excellent, the depth of field is spot on, the colour, the reflections combine to produce a very high quality image in my opinion.  One I would be very proud of and very envious of as it happens.  Well done!', '2004-08-17 17:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(863544, 96222, 3032, '<td valign="top">I cannot believe how sharp those mountains look, it really enhances the beautiful profile. The light and bright sky/mountains vs the darker foreground is wonderful. The touch of sunlight on the right front hill, the leading line of the road, the lighting as a whole and the cloud patterns finish it off: GREAT SHOT!<br/>The only things I could think of adding is a car on the road with a dust cloud behind it or kicking some moose and get them to stand int the lower left third. :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'I cannot believe how sharp those mountains look, it really enhances the beautiful profile. The light and bright sky/mountains vs the darker foreground is wonderful. The touch of sunlight on the right front hill, the leading line of the road, the lighting as a whole and the cloud patterns finish it off: GREAT SHOT!The only things I could think of adding is a car on the road with a dust cloud behind it or kicking some moose and get them to stand int the lower left third. :) ', '2004-08-17 17:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(863550, 96964, 3032, '<td valign="top">The red clothes vs all the blue/grey works great. Also funny how those iron/alu poles at the side get higher and higher as they work to the main subject.</td>', 'The red clothes vs all the blue/grey works great. Also funny how those iron/alu poles at the side get higher and higher as they work to the main subject.', '2004-08-17 17:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(863552, 96871, 3032, '<td valign="top">Rainy days make a photo shine. :)<br/>I like these kind of compositions, the people make it work.</td>', 'Rainy days make a photo shine. :)I like these kind of compositions, the people make it work.', '2004-08-17 17:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(863558, 96758, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, good exposure, nice detail in the grain of the wood.  Nicely framed, the angle of the planks I mean.  For me its a bit to tighly cropped, I would have liked to have seen further along the planks, more of the perspective effect.</td>', 'Nice idea, good exposure, nice detail in the grain of the wood.  Nicely framed, the angle of the planks I mean.  For me its a bit to tighly cropped, I would have liked to have seen further along the planks, more of the perspective effect.', '2004-08-17 17:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(863560, 96375, 22734, '<td valign="top">voted earlier returning for comments:<br/>This may be the most interesting viewpoint with the binus of cool b/w. Great shot</td>', 'voted earlier returning for comments:This may be the most interesting viewpoint with the binus of cool b/w. Great shot', '2004-08-17 17:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(863561, 96994, 22734, '<td valign="top">Vited earlier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>Whar a panorama and what breath...It is like saying you want vanishing points, here, take this. nothing like the magic of an illuminted city.</td>', 'Vited earlier, returning for comments. Whar a panorama and what breath...It is like saying you want vanishing points, here, take this. nothing like the magic of an illuminted city.', '2004-08-17 17:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(863563, 96801, 25486, '<td valign="top">A nice try at the challange. Plenty of lead-ins, the edge of the grass, the gaurd rail, the decking etc. They all lead the eye into the picture, but there isn''t really an object of interest to see there once the eye is drawn in.  The child looking the other way is distracting, makes you want to see what she is looking at.  The picture as a whole is a bit messy and cluttered.  Try changing your view point with shots like this, keep the lead-ins as strong as possible but try to loose as much clutter as possible.</td>', 'A nice try at the challange. Plenty of lead-ins, the edge of the grass, the gaurd rail, the decking etc. They all lead the eye into the picture, but there isn''t really an object of interest to see there once the eye is drawn in.  The child looking the other way is distracting, makes you want to see what she is looking at.  The picture as a whole is a bit messy and cluttered.  Try changing your view point with shots like this, keep the lead-ins as strong as possible but try to loose as much clutter as possible.', '2004-08-17 17:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(863564, 96222, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> A very good entry with an eyefull of ersth and sky. I love it.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. A very good entry with an eyefull of ersth and sky. I love it.', '2004-08-17 17:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(863565, 96152, 12802, '<td valign="top">How scary does this look, isn''t that the same scene from The Shining?? :-)<br/> <br/>A good shot here, glad it isn''t in colour.  Nice and crisp, good DOF.</td>', 'How scary does this look, isn''t that the same scene from The Shining?? :-) A good shot here, glad it isn''t in colour.  Nice and crisp, good DOF.', '2004-08-17 17:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(863568, 96479, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/>Yes, this is certainly vanishing.  i would have increased the sky contrast, nonetheless, a very nice image.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments.Yes, this is certainly vanishing.  i would have increased the sky contrast, nonetheless, a very nice image.', '2004-08-17 17:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(863570, 96446, 25486, '<td valign="top">Quite a stiking image but somehow the lighting doesn''t look right with that sky?  Plenty of lead-ins and the perspective is good.</td>', 'Quite a stiking image but somehow the lighting doesn''t look right with that sky?  Plenty of lead-ins and the perspective is good.', '2004-08-17 17:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(863573, 96631, 22734, '<td valign="top"><br/>Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>Actually a river is not composed of parallel lines, but it is also subject to the vanishing point. Very nice, quiet and tender.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. Actually a river is not composed of parallel lines, but it is also subject to the vanishing point. Very nice, quiet and tender.', '2004-08-17 17:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(863574, 96481, 25486, '<td valign="top">A nice image but somehow not attention grabbing enough.</td>', 'A nice image but somehow not attention grabbing enough.', '2004-08-17 17:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(863578, 96546, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>A yes, you are giving the viewer the opportunity to find his own vanishing points. Certainly a vast image with great distance. I like the hazy look.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. A yes, you are giving the viewer the opportunity to find his own vanishing points. Certainly a vast image with great distance. I like the hazy look.', '2004-08-17 17:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(863580, 96619, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> A very nice sky and certainly a diminishing, though quick curving road. Ah, but it continues.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. A very nice sky and certainly a diminishing, though quick curving road. Ah, but it continues.', '2004-08-17 17:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(863581, 96847, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>of course, they will ask: "Why not shot with the camera facing the swimmers?" However, no penalty here.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. of course, they will ask: "Why not shot with the camera facing the swimmers?" However, no penalty here.', '2004-08-17 17:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(863582, 96974, 25486, '<td valign="top">Obvious idea but it works well enough.  Slightly less central may have worked better?  The colours are saturated well, almost to the point of being overdone.  The tree down the left of the picture should have been cropped out.  Close attention should be given to what is in the frame.</td>', 'Obvious idea but it works well enough.  Slightly less central may have worked better?  The colours are saturated well, almost to the point of being overdone.  The tree down the left of the picture should have been cropped out.  Close attention should be given to what is in the frame.', '2004-08-17 17:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(863586, 96980, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>Now, you want me to believe that this writing pad is gigantic and these lines do appear to merge. But, hey, I get your drift, these lines are starting to merge. A noce entry because it gives us a break from the roads and railroad tracks. Nice.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. Now, you want me to believe that this writing pad is gigantic and these lines do appear to merge. But, hey, I get your drift, these lines are starting to merge. A noce entry because it gives us a break from the roads and railroad tracks. Nice.', '2004-08-17 17:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(863588, 96859, 25486, '<td valign="top">I like the muted colours in this shot a nice overall tone.  However the fundamental error is that the horizon is not level.  Also having the horizon on or about the midddle of the shot does not usually work very well.  Its generally better to have the horizon on the top or bottom third of the photograph, depending on what you what to emphasise, the sky, or the sea.</td>', 'I like the muted colours in this shot a nice overall tone.  However the fundamental error is that the horizon is not level.  Also having the horizon on or about the midddle of the shot does not usually work very well.  Its generally better to have the horizon on the top or bottom third of the photograph, depending on what you what to emphasise, the sky, or the sea.', '2004-08-17 17:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(863590, 96481, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>Amazing what a lens can do the perpective of an image. Great sky.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. Amazing what a lens can do the perpective of an image. Great sky.', '2004-08-17 17:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(863595, 96795, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>Looks like Brooklyn bridge. I am not going to penalize you, but this image could have boasted a sharper foreground.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. Looks like Brooklyn bridge. I am not going to penalize you, but this image could have boasted a sharper foreground.', '2004-08-17 17:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(863598, 96983, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>This image is nice but it would be great if we could get a liitle better defintion on the foreground.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. This image is nice but it would be great if we could get a liitle better defintion on the foreground.', '2004-08-17 17:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(863599, 97008, 25486, '<td valign="top">If it was intentional to burn out the foreground and the other side of the tunnel then sorry but this does nothing for me.  A nice idea but it needs detail to hold the interest of the viewer.</td>', 'If it was intentional to burn out the foreground and the other side of the tunnel then sorry but this does nothing for me.  A nice idea but it needs detail to hold the interest of the viewer.', '2004-08-17 17:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(863600, 96895, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice dappled lighting, the figure adds interest and a sense of perspective.  I think a slight change in viewpoint, to the left and a tighter crop to loose the parked cars would have made the image better.</td>', 'Nice dappled lighting, the figure adds interest and a sense of perspective.  I think a slight change in viewpoint, to the left and a tighter crop to loose the parked cars would have made the image better.', '2004-08-17 17:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
