(863612, 96163, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>I would have renamed this "vanishing into Manhattan" But hey, you got the vanishing point and that is all I am judging. No penalty for the typo.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. I would have renamed this "vanishing into Manhattan" But hey, you got the vanishing point and that is all I am judging. No penalty for the typo.', '2004-08-17 17:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
