(863629, 96781, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, good lighting and texture but it lacks a point of interest.  Cropping out the window/door frame at the top would improve the image I think, it seems like unnecessary detail.</td>', 'Nice idea, good lighting and texture but it lacks a point of interest.  Cropping out the window/door frame at the top would improve the image I think, it seems like unnecessary detail.', '2004-08-17 17:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(863630, 96865, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>meets the challenge and becomes a heathy alternative to the roads and tracks. A beautiful scene to boot with a consistent wonderful blue. Bumping from 5 to 6.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. meets the challenge and becomes a heathy alternative to the roads and tracks. A beautiful scene to boot with a consistent wonderful blue. Bumping from 5 to 6.', '2004-08-17 17:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(863636, 96393, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>A yes. Meets the challenge and you even used the darkness to help out with the vanishing point.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. A yes. Meets the challenge and you even used the darkness to help out with the vanishing point.', '2004-08-17 18:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
