(863644, 96325, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>Wow, these white lines do not only meet the challenge, but they also take over the picture. Nice resolution of the concept.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. Wow, these white lines do not only meet the challenge, but they also take over the picture. Nice resolution of the concept.', '2004-08-17 18:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
