(863647, 96733, 1827, '<td valign="top">I like the idea a lot, but don''t care for a lot of the choices you made.  I don''t like the excessive contrast or the grain.  I imagine you probably them both to add to the statement of the photo, but they just don''t move me.<br/></td>', 'I like the idea a lot, but don''t care for a lot of the choices you made.  I don''t like the excessive contrast or the grain.  I imagine you probably them both to add to the statement of the photo, but they just don''t move me.', '2004-08-17 18:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(863650, 96315, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>Yes, the VP is certainly implied and the human form gives the image an extra boost.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. Yes, the VP is certainly implied and the human form gives the image an extra boost.', '2004-08-17 18:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(863655, 96404, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>Very interesting going from the dark to the light. Yes, the diminishing concept is well illustrated.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. Very interesting going from the dark to the light. Yes, the diminishing concept is well illustrated.', '2004-08-17 18:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
