(864003, 97007, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>Good viewpoint.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. Good viewpoint.', '2004-08-17 21:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(864005, 96699, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>Lovely to look at. Bumping from 5 to 7</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. Lovely to look at. Bumping from 5 to 7', '2004-08-17 21:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(864007, 96984, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>very nice selection, however, I would have used bounced light. nevertheless you aptly demostrated the VP concept. Bumping to 6.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. very nice selection, however, I would have used bounced light. nevertheless you aptly demostrated the VP concept. Bumping to 6.', '2004-08-17 21:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(864010, 96446, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>Very odd but interesting with that infra red look. Bumping to 6.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. Very odd but interesting with that infra red look. Bumping to 6.', '2004-08-17 21:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(864011, 96401, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>Cool and visionary with that semi abstract look. Bumping from 5 to 7. Good work.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-08-18 09:37:26.</i></td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. Cool and visionary with that semi abstract look. Bumping from 5 to 7. Good work.', '2004-08-17 21:13:20.000000', '2004-08-18 10:37:26.000000', 1),
(864018, 96564, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>If it were not for the nut, these strings would converge. However, your presentation does demonstrate the vp, because even if they arer not parallel, they are also subject to perspective convergence. Nice effect on the strings. Bumping to 6.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. If it were not for the nut, these strings would converge. However, your presentation does demonstrate the vp, because even if they arer not parallel, they are also subject to perspective convergence. Nice effect on the strings. Bumping to 6.', '2004-08-17 21:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(864025, 96948, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the way the fence seems to bound wild, untouched forest, and the way it goes off into the distance. I wish there were a little more detail in the "keeper," some more texture or shadow.</td>', 'I like the way the fence seems to bound wild, untouched forest, and the way it goes off into the distance. I wish there were a little more detail in the "keeper," some more texture or shadow.', '2004-08-17 21:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(864026, 96772, 12733, '<td valign="top">The pier seems to go off into an infinity of distance, very nice. Nice texture on the pavement and a dark brooding sea. Wish there were more color in the sky, though.</td>', 'The pier seems to go off into an infinity of distance, very nice. Nice texture on the pavement and a dark brooding sea. Wish there were more color in the sky, though.', '2004-08-17 21:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(864027, 96289, 12733, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and textures; the lighting is just perfect to bring them out. The riders fill the width of the road, cutting off the sense of infinite distance it might otherwise have. Aside from that, a perfect shot.</td>', 'I really like the colors and textures; the lighting is just perfect to bring them out. The riders fill the width of the road, cutting off the sense of infinite distance it might otherwise have. Aside from that, a perfect shot.', '2004-08-17 21:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(864029, 96871, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the path going off to the distance and the way the trees force the viewer to follow it. The figures give the photo some scale. Those very red leaves at the side look unnatural. I assume from the validatin that they are really that color, but they do detract from the overall effect.</td>', 'I like the path going off to the distance and the way the trees force the viewer to follow it. The figures give the photo some scale. Those very red leaves at the side look unnatural. I assume from the validatin that they are really that color, but they do detract from the overall effect.', '2004-08-17 21:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(864033, 96869, 12733, '<td valign="top">I think this picture would look more natural if the ground were darker relative to the lights. This looks like a daylight shot with lights on or a "night for day" through long exposure.</td>', 'I think this picture would look more natural if the ground were darker relative to the lights. This looks like a daylight shot with lights on or a "night for day" through long exposure.', '2004-08-17 21:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(864035, 96520, 17577, '<td valign="top">I want to know where they''re going and why. Nice shot....</td>', 'I want to know where they''re going and why. Nice shot....', '2004-08-17 21:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(864036, 96697, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the dappled light effect on the boardwalk. I''m sure there''s a bird sanctuary somewhere in there, but for the title to be meaningful to me I would have to see some birds - that doesn''t affect the score, which is based on the picture, just an observation.</td>', 'I like the dappled light effect on the boardwalk. I''m sure there''s a bird sanctuary somewhere in there, but for the title to be meaningful to me I would have to see some birds - that doesn''t affect the score, which is based on the picture, just an observation.', '2004-08-17 21:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(864038, 96252, 12733, '<td valign="top">I hope you didn''t get your feet too wet taking this shot. Nice colors and textures, and a view we don''t often get.</td>', 'I hope you didn''t get your feet too wet taking this shot. Nice colors and textures, and a view we don''t often get.', '2004-08-17 21:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(864039, 96500, 12733, '<td valign="top">Those towers look like strange giants out in the dark, and the streak of red light adds a striking note. Great shot.</td>', 'Those towers look like strange giants out in the dark, and the streak of red light adds a striking note. Great shot.', '2004-08-17 21:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(864040, 96222, 12733, '<td valign="top">That''s beautiful country. Great colors, great composition.</td>', 'That''s beautiful country. Great colors, great composition.', '2004-08-17 21:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(864043, 96931, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the color and texture of the pillars and the rhythm of the shadows. The bit of sky at the end of the structure adds a lot. Is that red thing a person or an object?</td>', 'I like the color and texture of the pillars and the rhythm of the shadows. The bit of sky at the end of the structure adds a lot. Is that red thing a person or an object?', '2004-08-17 21:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(864046, 96640, 22340, '<td valign="top">golden photo ... best of the bunch</td>', 'golden photo ... best of the bunch', '2004-08-17 21:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(864047, 96384, 12733, '<td valign="top">It''s a stairway to heaven! Very interesting picture; is that really the sky in the background? And what is that in the foreground? It''s a nice shade of blue whatever it is.</td>', 'It''s a stairway to heaven! Very interesting picture; is that really the sky in the background? And what is that in the foreground? It''s a nice shade of blue whatever it is.', '2004-08-17 21:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(864049, 97003, 12733, '<td valign="top">The nice, sharp slabs hold my eye in the foreground. I think more DOF is needed to pull the viewer into the rest of the picture.</td>', 'The nice, sharp slabs hold my eye in the foreground. I think more DOF is needed to pull the viewer into the rest of the picture.', '2004-08-17 21:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(864051, 96763, 23939, '<td valign="top">long title    6</td>', 'long title    6', '2004-08-17 21:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(864052, 96628, 12733, '<td valign="top">The degree of brightness in a night shot is unnatural. I think a mysterious darkness, achived with less exposure or a curves adjustment would make this an outstanding picture.</td>', 'The degree of brightness in a night shot is unnatural. I think a mysterious darkness, achived with less exposure or a curves adjustment would make this an outstanding picture.', '2004-08-17 21:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(864054, 96808, 12733, '<td valign="top">Wow, that purple sky is just the right balance between going too dark and being unnaturally light. Beautiful colors and reflections, and the bridge makes a great compolsitional element.</td>', 'Wow, that purple sky is just the right balance between going too dark and being unnaturally light. Beautiful colors and reflections, and the bridge makes a great compolsitional element.', '2004-08-17 22:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(864057, 96481, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great vertical perspective - not your cliche vanishing point shot at all. And you had a perfect sky for a background.</td>', 'Great vertical perspective - not your cliche vanishing point shot at all. And you had a perfect sky for a background.', '2004-08-17 22:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(864060, 96972, 12733, '<td valign="top">Now that we know what it''s not, what is it? Very interesting shot and a great sense of perspective.</td>', 'Now that we know what it''s not, what is it? Very interesting shot and a great sense of perspective.', '2004-08-17 22:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(864061, 96378, 12733, '<td valign="top">An interesting study in shape and perspective.</td>', 'An interesting study in shape and perspective.', '2004-08-17 22:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(864062, 96922, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflections and textures.</td>', 'Beautiful reflections and textures.', '2004-08-17 22:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(864069, 96984, 12733, '<td valign="top">An original idea, beautifully executed. I really like the detail and brilliant color.</td>', 'An original idea, beautifully executed. I really like the detail and brilliant color.', '2004-08-17 22:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(864070, 96587, 12733, '<td valign="top">My first reaction was that the light in the distance is too bright, but the more I look at this picture the more it seems to work.</td>', 'My first reaction was that the light in the distance is too bright, but the more I look at this picture the more it seems to work.', '2004-08-17 22:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(864072, 96881, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>Now, this is a cool subject for this challenge. I would have preferred more sharpness. bumping from 5 to 7.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. Now, this is a cool subject for this challenge. I would have preferred more sharpness. bumping from 5 to 7.', '2004-08-17 22:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(864075, 96454, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>Very impressive shot. An entry with a great deal of human interest that favors the vp with great charm. Bumping from 5 to 7.</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. Very impressive shot. An entry with a great deal of human interest that favors the vp with great charm. Bumping from 5 to 7.', '2004-08-17 22:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(864076, 96252, 12151, '<td valign="top">I really like the complex texture and color patterns embedded into a simple overarching pattern.</td>', 'I really like the complex texture and color patterns embedded into a simple overarching pattern.', '2004-08-17 22:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
