(864088, 96299, 22975, '<td valign="top">What a great idea for a vanishing point challenge.  If only the sun could have been perfectly on top so the shadows would be symmetrical.  ;)  Like you can fix that... it''s a great shot, no matter what the sun decided to do.  I give you a 9!</td>', 'What a great idea for a vanishing point challenge.  If only the sun could have been perfectly on top so the shadows would be symmetrical.  ;)  Like you can fix that... it''s a great shot, no matter what the sun decided to do.  I give you a 9!', '2004-08-17 22:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(864089, 96808, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>This vp entry sets a very good mood. Bumping from 5 to 6</td>', 'Voted eralier, returning for comments. This vp entry sets a very good mood. Bumping from 5 to 6', '2004-08-17 22:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(864091, 95875, 12151, '<td valign="top">The energy in this shot is really amazing- your color choice is excellent.  This is much livelier than most all the other images in this challenge.</td>', 'The energy in this shot is really amazing- your color choice is excellent.  This is much livelier than most all the other images in this challenge.', '2004-08-17 22:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(864093, 96376, 22975, '<td valign="top">I really like the desaturation of this one, the contrast is very attractive.  Good subject, too.</td>', 'I really like the desaturation of this one, the contrast is very attractive.  Good subject, too.', '2004-08-17 22:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(864094, 96375, 22975, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot... The bridge just disappears, doesn''t it?  :)</td>', 'Excellent shot... The bridge just disappears, doesn''t it?  :)', '2004-08-17 22:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(864095, 96708, 12151, '<td valign="top">I like the gritty and psychadelic style of this one - don''t be discouraged if others don''t.  You impressively managed to capture wildness from a still environment.</td>', 'I like the gritty and psychadelic style of this one - don''t be discouraged if others don''t.  You impressively managed to capture wildness from a still environment.', '2004-08-17 22:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(864096, 96899, 22975, '<td valign="top">Your choice in colors is perfect.  This fits the challenge wonderfully, and is a really beautiful picture.  9</td>', 'Your choice in colors is perfect.  This fits the challenge wonderfully, and is a really beautiful picture.  9', '2004-08-17 22:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(864097, 96674, 12151, '<td valign="top">I strongy appreciate this photo even as an abstract.  The color and jagged patterns here are really interesting to look at.  Also, I think this photo looks much better up close than afar.</td>', 'I strongy appreciate this photo even as an abstract.  The color and jagged patterns here are really interesting to look at.  Also, I think this photo looks much better up close than afar.', '2004-08-17 22:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(864098, 97005, 22975, '<td valign="top">Another shot with great colors, focus and DOF.  Excellent job.  9</td>', 'Another shot with great colors, focus and DOF.  Excellent job.  9', '2004-08-17 22:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(864099, 96927, 22975, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot, and very unique for the challenge.</td>', 'Really cool shot, and very unique for the challenge.', '2004-08-17 22:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(864102, 96409, 12151, '<td valign="top">The far wall is superb - the patterns and reflections mesh with the lines of the floor and pins extremely well.  Great photo.</td>', 'The far wall is superb - the patterns and reflections mesh with the lines of the floor and pins extremely well.  Great photo.', '2004-08-17 22:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(864103, 96678, 22975, '<td valign="top">Great idea and perspective.  Another one that I think, "wish I had thought of that."  I think you''ll do well.  :)  9</td>', 'Great idea and perspective.  Another one that I think, "wish I had thought of that."  I think you''ll do well.  :)  9', '2004-08-17 22:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(864105, 96152, 22975, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT focus and lighting.  8</td>', 'EXCELLENT focus and lighting.  8', '2004-08-17 22:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(864109, 96847, 22975, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photo, but I don''t think it fits the challenge because of your point of view... but it''s such a good photo, I''m torn.</td>', 'This is an excellent photo, but I don''t think it fits the challenge because of your point of view... but it''s such a good photo, I''m torn.', '2004-08-17 22:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(864112, 96299, 12583, '<td valign="top">This seems a bit dark, but I REALLY loved this shot. I think this was a great, fresh take on vanishing point. Nice work! :)</td>', 'This seems a bit dark, but I REALLY loved this shot. I think this was a great, fresh take on vanishing point. Nice work! :)', '2004-08-17 22:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(864113, 96362, 22975, '<td valign="top">Cute subject... it really livens up what could have been a pretty boring sidewalk.  Good addition.</td>', 'Cute subject... it really livens up what could have been a pretty boring sidewalk.  Good addition.', '2004-08-17 22:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(864115, 96869, 22975, '<td valign="top">I like the colors on this, I just wish there was about half as much sidewalk at the bottom of the photo.</td>', 'I like the colors on this, I just wish there was about half as much sidewalk at the bottom of the photo.', '2004-08-17 22:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(864118, 96851, 20941, '<td valign="top">Already voted but came back to comment on how much I like this. The sepia gives it a timeless kinda feeling and reminds me of the movie "Vanishing Point" which first came to my mind when I saw this challenge, Good Luck!</td>', 'Already voted but came back to comment on how much I like this. The sepia gives it a timeless kinda feeling and reminds me of the movie "Vanishing Point" which first came to my mind when I saw this challenge, Good Luck!', '2004-08-17 22:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(864119, 96232, 22975, '<td valign="top">This was a good idea.  I wish the lines didn''t photography, they detract from the photo, but it''s still a nice execution.</td>', 'This was a good idea.  I wish the lines didn''t photography, they detract from the photo, but it''s still a nice execution.', '2004-08-17 22:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(864120, 96564, 22975, '<td valign="top">LOVES it.</td>', 'LOVES it.', '2004-08-17 22:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(864122, 96989, 22975, '<td valign="top">Another beautiful and unique take on the challenge.  Great job.</td>', 'Another beautiful and unique take on the challenge.  Great job.', '2004-08-17 22:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(864124, 96478, 22975, '<td valign="top">The color contrast is fantastic!  Great idea, too!</td>', 'The color contrast is fantastic!  Great idea, too!', '2004-08-17 22:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(864127, 96963, 22975, '<td valign="top">What an interesting shot!  Good job!</td>', 'What an interesting shot!  Good job!', '2004-08-17 22:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(864128, 96795, 20941, '<td valign="top">Nice visual of a VANISHING POINT, like the composition with the Bridge on the horizon. One of my favorites this challenge, good luck!</td>', 'Nice visual of a VANISHING POINT, like the composition with the Bridge on the horizon. One of my favorites this challenge, good luck!', '2004-08-17 22:46:58.000000', NULL, 1);
