(864137, 95875, 20941, '<td valign="top">Already voted, came back to compliment you on this. LOVE the sepia tone here, and while the vanishing point is not the main focul point here its a great photo, in my somewhat predjudist opinion, I love the City! Good Luck.</td>', 'Already voted, came back to compliment you on this. LOVE the sepia tone here, and while the vanishing point is not the main focul point here its a great photo, in my somewhat predjudist opinion, I love the City! Good Luck.', '2004-08-17 22:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
