(864175, 96984, 8891, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.  Not sure but with the length piano wire and maybe in a macro setting it might have made more of a vanishing point type of pic starting at the right behind the back pins straight on and to the front or towards the action. This angle is vey nice and I like the curves you got, but I think your VP might have better if you had shot from the similar angle but closer to the tops of the strings.  Not sure, But I always appreciate a good Piano shot and I like this a lot.</td>', 'Nice abstract.  Not sure but with the length piano wire and maybe in a macro setting it might have made more of a vanishing point type of pic starting at the right behind the back pins straight on and to the front or towards the action. This angle is vey nice and I like the curves you got, but I think your VP might have better if you had shot from the similar angle but closer to the tops of the strings.  Not sure, But I always appreciate a good Piano shot and I like this a lot.', '2004-08-17 23:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(864176, 96674, 8891, '<td valign="top">Excellent reflections and colors not sure about the VP part.</td>', 'Excellent reflections and colors not sure about the VP part.', '2004-08-17 23:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
