(864578, 96222, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is the best work I have seen from you Danny, absolutely amazing! Congratulations on the win and for creating such a masterpiece. Respect! And to think you were thinking of giving up a couple of weeks back. I bet this has fired up your determination again! And you almost cracked the 8 barrier as well! If it weren''t for those cowardly weasels who voted you "1"''s and "2"s you would have done it. My hat off to you Danny!</td>', 'This is the best work I have seen from you Danny, absolutely amazing! Congratulations on the win and for creating such a masterpiece. Respect! And to think you were thinking of giving up a couple of weeks back. I bet this has fired up your determination again! And you almost cracked the 8 barrier as well! If it weren''t for those cowardly weasels who voted you "1"''s and "2"s you would have done it. My hat off to you Danny!', '2004-08-18 02:35:38.000000', NULL, 0),
