(864690, 96418, 23251, '<td valign="top">Nice shot Mandy..</td>', 'Nice shot Mandy..', '2004-08-18 03:36:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(864695, 96331, 23478, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of the helpful comments.  I took this shot at about 6am one morning, when there were no people out.  The slow shutter speed helped to get the effect on the water.  I had gone out without any intention of taking the photo.  In fact, I had to find a place to set my camera down and use as a secure surface for this photo because I did not have a tripod with me and the shutter speed (2.5 seconds) was way too slow for handheld.  I snapped about 15-20 shots, but the very first shot was the best.  This shot is of a slums in Brazil that is built over and along side the creek.  Only some of the houses have electricity and none have indoor plumbing.  During the rainy season, the water will rise above the wooden walkway and people will use canoes to get to thier homes.  A very unique location and by far my favorite photo that I took for this competition.  Thanks again for all the useful comments.</td>', 'Thanks for all of the helpful comments.  I took this shot at about 6am one morning, when there were no people out.  The slow shutter speed helped to get the effect on the water.  I had gone out without any intention of taking the photo.  In fact, I had to find a place to set my camera down and use as a secure surface for this photo because I did not have a tripod with me and the shutter speed (2.5 seconds) was way too slow for handheld.  I snapped about 15-20 shots, but the very first shot was the best.  This shot is of a slums in Brazil that is built over and along side the creek.  Only some of the houses have electricity and none have indoor plumbing.  During the rainy season, the water will rise above the wooden walkway and people will use canoes to get to thier homes.  A very unique location and by far my favorite photo that I took for this competition.  Thanks again for all the useful comments.', '2004-08-18 03:38:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(864698, 96222, 16238, '<td valign="top">This has gotta be the one of the best shots I have ever seen here. I am absolutely dumbfounded by its beauty and how you captured it.</td>', 'This has gotta be the one of the best shots I have ever seen here. I am absolutely dumbfounded by its beauty and how you captured it.', '2004-08-18 03:39:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(864757, 96651, 12316, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for the comments.<br/>UNCLEBRO : off course I was punished for this photography.<br/></td>', 'Thanks all for the comments.UNCLEBRO : off course I was punished for this photography.', '2004-08-18 04:44:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(864760, 96455, 24767, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by spencew:</b></div><hr/><i> Interesting, but off the mark (where are the parallels? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The four main cables dominating the top half of the picture ARE actually parallel.<br/> <br/>Anyway, to answer another question, it''s not Spokane (I have no idea where that is, but I''ll look it up) - It''s the BA "London Eye," England.</td>', 'Originally posted by spencew: Interesting, but off the mark (where are the parallels?   The four main cables dominating the top half of the picture ARE actually parallel. Anyway, to answer another question, it''s not Spokane (I have no idea where that is, but I''ll look it up) - It''s the BA "London Eye," England.', '2004-08-18 04:46:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(864767, 96133, 19959, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for your votes and comments. I am very please to have broken the 6 mark for the first time. <br/> <br/>I have one request though, for those 12 who voted in the 1''s, 2''s and 3''s could you please comment on why you scored me down. I hope to improve my entries and this will help me learn.<br/> <br/>Thank you.</td>', 'Thanks all for your votes and comments. I am very please to have broken the 6 mark for the first time.  I have one request though, for those 12 who voted in the 1''s, 2''s and 3''s could you please comment on why you scored me down. I hope to improve my entries and this will help me learn. Thank you.', '2004-08-18 04:52:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(864768, 96230, 22913, '<td valign="top">Nice shot Bob, Should have been rated higher in my opinion.<br/>Keep up the great work<br/>Cheers mate,<br/>Ross</td>', 'Nice shot Bob, Should have been rated higher in my opinion.Keep up the great workCheers mate,Ross', '2004-08-18 04:55:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(864784, 96375, 16046, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the kind comments, my idea was to shoot the bridge at sunrise, well it rained that early morning, (I had to crop out my umbrella that got in the way). Turns out the rain worked out nicely, otherwise you would see Mercer Island at the end of the bridge. My highest score yet.<br/> <br/>Frank</td>', 'Thanks for all the kind comments, my idea was to shoot the bridge at sunrise, well it rained that early morning, (I had to crop out my umbrella that got in the way). Turns out the rain worked out nicely, otherwise you would see Mercer Island at the end of the bridge. My highest score yet. Frank', '2004-08-18 05:20:09.000000', NULL, 0),
