(867248, 96979, 21171, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your kind comments.  I realize the photo lacked the impact factor the winners had, but I still like it.</td>', 'Thanks for all your kind comments.  I realize the photo lacked the impact factor the winners had, but I still like it.', '2004-08-19 09:30:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(867252, 96923, 1570, '<td valign="top">thank you, everybody, for all your great comments! <br/> <br/>and this is to robert: <br/> <br/>just wanted to thank you personally for your very thoughtful comment, i do appreciate it! thank you so much for taking the time! you were wondering about maybe cropping the sky out of the picture - i did try that, and it was pretty good, but in the end i chose this crop with some sky in it... it just looked more balanced to me... thanks again! i am posting this here to encourage more comments like yours! irina. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-08-19 08:40:12.</i></td>', 'thank you, everybody, for all your great comments!  and this is to robert:  just wanted to thank you personally for your very thoughtful comment, i do appreciate it! thank you so much for taking the time! you were wondering about maybe cropping the sky out of the picture - i did try that, and it was pretty good, but in the end i chose this crop with some sky in it... it just looked more balanced to me... thanks again! i am posting this here to encourage more comments like yours! irina. ', '2004-08-19 09:32:40.000000', '2004-08-19 09:40:12.000000', 0),
