(868552, 96998, 8860, '<td valign="top">D''you know - I was going to shoot a plane at night myself someday soon, then I saw this! Excellent stuff.  I love the pulses of landing lights punctuating its tracks. Very clear and well exposed.<br/> <br/>I think the only improvement would be to either have shot it dead centre of the frame or more offset so that the streaks were more dynamically arranged.</td>', 'D''you know - I was going to shoot a plane at night myself someday soon, then I saw this! Excellent stuff.  I love the pulses of landing lights punctuating its tracks. Very clear and well exposed. I think the only improvement would be to either have shot it dead centre of the frame or more offset so that the streaks were more dynamically arranged.', '2004-08-20 13:33:09.000000', NULL, 0),
