(869166, 96881, 20330, '<td valign="top">To answer some of the questions.. This is a bridge in Catawba North Carolina. This is not the bridge from the movie Stand by Me, I just named it that because it reminded me of the movie. I had another version where I had the top white area cropped out but deicded to go with this one. Thanks for all the nice comments.</td>', 'To answer some of the questions.. This is a bridge in Catawba North Carolina. This is not the bridge from the movie Stand by Me, I just named it that because it reminded me of the movie. I had another version where I had the top white area cropped out but deicded to go with this one. Thanks for all the nice comments.', '2004-08-21 03:00:32.000000', NULL, 0),
