(873434, 96952, 6202, '<td valign="top">Critique Club<br/> <br/>As I look at this I am trying to figure out what would make it stronger and it hits me I''m looking at the sky and your actually vanishing point is not even grabbing my attention.  The sky is your real attention grabber here.  If you do follow the road when you get to the vanishing point you just suddenly find yourself in the clouds enjoying them.<br/> <br/>In all its a nice photo the problem you have here is those clouds are grabbing the attention from the subject of the challenge.</td>', 'Critique Club As I look at this I am trying to figure out what would make it stronger and it hits me I''m looking at the sky and your actually vanishing point is not even grabbing my attention.  The sky is your real attention grabber here.  If you do follow the road when you get to the vanishing point you just suddenly find yourself in the clouds enjoying them. In all its a nice photo the problem you have here is those clouds are grabbing the attention from the subject of the challenge.', '2004-08-24 02:53:43.000000', NULL, 0),
